{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread","id":361610,"title":"Clash of the Southeast IC post thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-06T14:45:06-08:00","id":361610,"title":"Clash of the Southeast IC post thread","content":"This will be the IC post thread.<br /> <br /> <b>As of now, anyone that has already private messaged me their character sheet is in the game. There are two of you I have to talk about tweaking your sheet as the points don't quite match up. I will mail you later about it. You can start the game though.</b><br /> <br /> The city of Puyo was bustling on this fine bright, sunny day 15 of the season of descending fire year 770. It seemed the whole of creation was stirring. Everyone knew that the Scarlet Empress was gone for good. This was not another one of her trips away. This was the time to build up further and gain control of the lands. <br /> <br /> Noone really mentioned Puyo and the kingdom of Harborhead until now. They were not the largest regions and of critical importance. A few cities here and there, but that did offer certain advantages. And as this was the time to expand, the guild and the Goddess of the Grey River (on behalf of the Thousand River's Court) sought to expand their influence further south. As the guild knew they would never be allowed to step into the Thousand River's Court metting on Drigia, they sought to appeal directly to the people (and maybe fatten up their wallets) to start their influence at a key stop on the way to the south; Puyo. <br /> <br /> Knowing this, the Thousand Rivers Court sought to win over Puyo and gain full control of the area. They could use the area's resources and did not want to guild changing their perceived role. The guild had been acting a bit different for the last couple of years and the Court did not like it. The Goddess of the Grey River sought to stop their expansion and make sure they stayed under her thumb (well; as much as they were ever). <br /> <br /> Trade seemed to be thriving in the area and a lot of money could be seen passing around at the small bazaar. A throng of citizens were yelling, haggling, threatening, buying, selling, and more. On the other hand, many dignitaries and politicians could be seen leaving the court hall, whispering in each others ears as they made their way home. <br /> <br /> Times were very hectic in this town. With the guild coming in creating a great amount of trade in such a short time, the Thousand River Court appearing among the masses, and stories of black lands and knights slowly creeping their way towards Puyo, the city didn't know what to do. All they could do was focus on their daily activities. The leadership even seemed for a bit of a loss. Power dynamics had been changing too fast for a small town to keep up. Who knows what would happen to this town...<br /> <br /> You all find yourselves together amongst the outskirts of this bustling city. What do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":".  Accidentally made this in the forums :/ 01-06-2015, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:27:02-08:00","id":361841,"title":"","content":"Flynn sat in a local tea house, considering his glass of water. He heard that water was tasteless, but the liquid in this glass tasted like dirt. Who knows what sort of things have been swimming around and shitting in it? At least with alcohol, you knew that it was clean. Otherwise, they wouldn't pour it on wounds.<br /> <br /> As a tall, young man, he fit awkwardly at the small table in the tea house. His long blond wavy hair was pulled back into a tail. He rubbed his day old stubble nervously as he waited for his contact to arrive. His grey eyes searched the room to see if he could find Swimming Owl. It was probably useless; she wouldn't be see until she wished to reveal herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Flynn looks like he is in his mid twenties. Edited the description slightly to make that more clear. Yay, almost eternal youth! 01-06-2015, 10:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:32:41-08:00","id":361849,"title":"","content":"Nobody noticed another Guild clerk. The Perfect Petal was a popular establishment with merchants passing through the city who wanted a break from the dust and grit and sore legs of the road and a taste of civilization. It was packed with young men and women from the latest caravan, looking to part ways with a portion of their pay.<br /> <br /> Just as sore and tired as the rest of them, completely unremarkable in her dust-stained travel garb, Swimming Owl slipped into a booth in the corner opposite a man she recognized even if nobody else did.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please tell me you're not drinking on the job already, Flynn?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:40:06-08:00","id":361859,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, don't worry. It's just water.&quot; Flynn lifts up his glass and takes a gulp. Grimacing, he puts the glass down. &quot;I'd be in a better mood if I was drinking.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So.... I should apologize. I didn't think they's assign you to make sure I don't fuck this up.&quot; Flynn moved around to try and get more comfortable at the little table. &quot;Babysitting doesn't seem to be your expertise.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:53:25-08:00","id":361872,"title":"","content":"Swimming Owl raised an eyebrow. &quot;Okay, first things first. If we're going to work together? Two things. Number one: you don't order water in a fucking teahouse. Even if you're tryin' to cut back on the booze. You there! Two cups and a kettle! Nexus Red Company's black tea, fresh if you have it, please.&quot;<br /> <br /> She smiled as the waitress bustled off.<br /> <br /> &quot;Second? You are correct. I am terrible at baby sitting. Not gonna babysit you. You're old enough to be my father, and I expect you to act like it. We've been assigned here because this place is a goddamned powder keg, and you don't send people you can't afford to lose into a goddamned powder keg. We are expendable assets, you and me, we are going to be in hot water, and I need to know you've got my back. Do you have my back?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T19:18:54-08:00","id":361919,"title":"","content":"&quot;Bah. Could never stand the taste of tea. Never understood...&quot; Flynn trails off. He was about to bring up his time with the Bronze Faction. But that was behind him now. Time to move forward.<br /> <br /> Flynn met Swimming Owl's eyes. &quot;Maidens know I deserve it, but I'm tired of being treated like a fucking kid.\u201d<br /> <br /> His eyes unfocused for a bit, getting lost in his own memories. &quot;I'll be honest. I'm not that good in a fight. Jericho died because of that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Taking a deep breath, Flynn continued. &quot;I plan on changing that. I\u2019ve been training on my own each morning. To think of all the opportunities I've squandered...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBut we are in this together. I got your back. If we go down, we will go down together. Though, if possible, let\u2019s arrange things so that the chance of us dying horrible is kept to a minimum. There are other ways to achieve our goals besides combat.\u201d Flynn smiled and gently patted his Sanxian case.<br /> <br /> &quot;Seriously, I need to introduce you to coffee. It has a much stronger kick than tea.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-06-2015, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T19:45:01-08:00","id":361954,"title":"","content":"&quot;Stuff gives me headaches.&quot; Owl smiled. &quot;Hopefully we won't get in any fights, or if we do we'll have big burly Exalts between us and the enemy. Now, just to be sure we're on the same page here, because the Bureau's done it to me before...we <i>do </i>have the same mission objectives, right? No secondary objectives or surprise moves from you on this one? I tend to work deep cover, and it can get risky if I have to improvise.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T19:55:18-08:00","id":361982,"title":"","content":"Nahuel had never, in his entire life, felt so profoundly uncomfortable, nor looked so utterly out of place, as he did entering the bustling tea house. Sorath had explained the basics of 'civilized' etiquette, but he honestly hadn't paid much attention after the first half hour; how could anything so absurd be terribly important?<br /> <br /> Ah well, it was not truly in his nature to be put off or back down from something simply because it was strange to him. If the city folk didn't like it, surely they were just covering their jealousy at someone who so obviously knew how to truly live. If they stared, well, he'd take it as a compliment. Straightening his shoulders, he looks about the place for the people Sorath described to him... ah, there they are. He strides across the tea house like a tiger among housecats towards the table with the two Sidereals. He arrives just in time to pick up the tail end of their conversation.<br /> <br /> &quot;Or perhaps that is why I am here. Are you Swimming Owl and...Fleen?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T20:02:32-08:00","id":361992,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmmm.....&quot; Flynn pulls out a piece of parchment and makes a show of reading it. &quot;It says right here that I am assassinate the first woman that buys me tea at the Perfect Petal Tea House. Or is that deflower? My handwriting is so fucking illegible...&quot; He shows Swimming Owl the parchment which contains his grocery list. <br /> <br /> The waitress arrives with the tea and Flynn waits until she leaves to continue. He leans in close and whispers &quot;I'm to bring notice to the good works that certain unappreciated groups have done. Also, our traveling companions aren't suppose to leave the city for the foreseeable future. &quot; <br /> <br /> Somehow, he managed to lean back without knocking anything on the table over. Flynn then starts spooning sugar into his tea. Perhaps if he adds enough of it, it will make it taste bearable.<br /> <br /> &quot;Obviously, the second part of the mission is easier to accomplish than the first. I still thinking about how to accomplish the first without attracting the wrong sort of attention.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T20:08:02-08:00","id":362000,"title":"","content":"(Flynn probably wouldn't be quite so open about his mission in front of the lunar. Silly Play by Post timing). <br /> <br /> Seeing Nahuel approach, Flynn puts away his grocery list. &quot;Come join us! &quot; He scoots over to make room for the Lunar and pushes his tea cup over. &quot;Here, have some tea! I hope you like sugar.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T20:18:05-08:00","id":362008,"title":"","content":"Having left his small town of Stone Thumb in the capable hands of his thurmaturge ally and armed with the knowledge of the disarray Puyo garnered form his once refuge new ally he set off to investigate the disruptions that risked his first and new ward. Better yet how to twist the chaotic nature of the time to benefit him, his town, and Creation. Upon approaching the Puyo knowing full well of his his wanted nature kept his false form as The Healer, Fovnag that served to open his eyes to the world and provide a new form to explore it with. He must take the upmost care less he be reviled his form compromised and be wide open to mundane forms of tracking. To gather information on his wanted statues in the city and to immerse him self in the local goings on he headed to the market center. Unsurprising there where a few posters up for his capture but none terribly recent and all of other forms. As for information of current news he chose the tea house over then pub as his current form would seem far more at home in the prior. While searching for a good seat he over heard two gentleman talking of Maidens. Well as good a lead as any, taking a seat nearby and ordering the cheapest tea available. Sipping his newly delivered tea he settled in and focused on the neighboring conversation. What a interesting conversation theses two appear to be sidereals, time for him to do some spying. Unfortunately his snooping was interupted by a man that obviously had something against even the notion of subtlety.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-06-2015, 11:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T20:55:21-08:00","id":362050,"title":"","content":"Seeing that they accepted and even expected such a barbarous man and a lunner no less into there conversation that these where no ordinary Sidereals. The kind he had heard about hunting down and killing all Lunenrs. He decided to approach. \u201cGood day gentlemen!\u201d his eyes hanging a bit longer on the barbarian then was strictly necessary when saying this. \u201cI could not help but overhear that you are in fact not mere men and that the you are aware of what is afoot in the kingdom. May I take a seat and join you in your worldly conversation?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:08:06-08:00","id":362060,"title":"","content":"Flynn is taken a back that this random person has been listening in to their conversation and now has barged into said conversation.<br /> <br /> <i>Gods, I hope Arcane Fate takes care of this fuck up,</i> Flynn thinks to himself.<br /> <br /> However, Flynn recovers quickly and &quot;Of course you can join us. Have a seat! I think we need more tea or coffee, if they have it. &quot; He flags down the waitress to take their orders.<br /> <br /> &quot;Perhaps we should introduce ourselves. My name is Flynn. If you can't tell from the Saxian Case, I am a traveling musician. What is your name?&quot; Flynn asks of the eavesdropper.<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl (and The Servant, since he was eavesdropping) will notice that Flynn's entire mood has shifted when Nahuel and the Servant approached the table. Flynn is always at his best when he has an audience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-07-2015, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:14:27-08:00","id":362066,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am Nahuel. I was told to find the two of you and aid you... I was told nothing about tea.&quot; He's seen tea before; the shamans used to make it as medicine, but he doesn't think that's what it's being used for here. &quot;I don't know. I have never had sugar before.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:25:51-08:00","id":362073,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sugar is sweet, like honey. It's used to lessen the bitter taste of the tea. Some also add milk or lemon to tea to try to mask its taste. Try it. If you don't like it, there are other things to drink at the tea house. &quot; Flynn adds some sugar and cream to his coffee.<br /> <br /> &quot;Nahuel, who sent you our way? It is not often that people such as yourself are sent to find us.&quot; <i>Or able to find us in the first place,</i> Flynn thinks as he drinks his coffee.<br /> <br /> He logically knew that Lunar Exalts were more powerful than Dragon Blooded, but... Flynn was used to having to come to the object of his mission. Never had the object of his mission come and track him down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-07-2015, 12:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:28:05-08:00","id":362074,"title":"","content":"\u201cFantastic to make your acquaintance Flynn\u201d bowing his head slightly. \u201c Its an honorer to meet someone of your high standing. Also I would like to to apologies for my unforgivable rudeness but interjecting my self into your esteemed conversation. It is simply that to happen upon such a man as your self is so rare I would be want to miss the chance of your company. Ah now look what I have done another rudeness. I have yet to introduce myself I am called Fovnag. My equal esteem to masters Nahuel and Swimming Owl&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:39:11-08:00","id":362080,"title":"","content":"&quot;One to whom I owe a debt,&quot; he responds simply. &quot;Sorath said that I was repaying a favor that she owed to someone named Ayesha.&quot; He tries the sugared tea with an... odd expression.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:41:52-08:00","id":362085,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is a pleasure to meet you, Fovnag. Though men such as myself aren't as rare as you may think, but I appreciate your enthusiasm about the Sanxian. It is a noble instrument. Perhaps later I can play for you. &quot; Flynn moves the case to make more room at the table. He had a feeling that more people will show up. <br /> <br /> &quot;So what bring you to Puyo?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:45:53-08:00","id":362091,"title":"","content":"&quot;Try the coffee. You might like it better.&quot; He passes over the cup. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, Ayesha. She is a great lover of the arts. You might say that she is our patron. A hard taskmaster at times, but with artists such as Swimming Owl and I, you would need to be. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:53:17-08:00","id":362095,"title":"","content":"\u201cI was sent by my town to investigate whats happening to the kingdom as we have been flooded with refugees.\u201d \u201cthe refugees carried rumors a massive push by The...\u201d pausing a moment as Nahuel almost spit out his tea .\u201c Guild into the kingdom and the requisite misery and exploitation that fallows when they get involved.\u201d His eyes and words alight from the impassioned hatred for The Guild and his life under them. Calming himself. \u201cim here to to make sure The Guild is kept inline with what is best for my people and creation.\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:56:28-08:00","id":362097,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is not bad, just... strange. Very strange. But so is everything else here. Art... you make praises to your gods?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T21:58:05-08:00","id":362098,"title":"","content":"Flynn smiles at Nahuel. &quot;Among other things. Mostly I play the Sanxian to entertain people. &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Guild...&quot; Flynn puts his coffee cup down. &quot;One can never forget the vacant look of slaves returned from the Fair Folk. No song I can play can return the joy to their lives.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> (Night all)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-14-2015, 12:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T22:22:20-08:00","id":362108,"title":"","content":"The jungle-dweller retains the politely uncomprehending look he has held through most of the conversation. &quot;Hmm. In my homeland, there is little time for idle entertainment... every moment was a struggle to survive. But slaves,&quot; he says, face twisting into a snarl of disgust, &quot;that is something I know all too well. The raksha are not the only ones to drain the souls from those they take, only the fastest. Anyone who would make a man a slave does the same.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T22:34:13-08:00","id":362115,"title":"","content":"Swimming Owl smiled, silently cursing Flynn for using her real name, and the two strangers for showing up before she could finish debriefing Flynn. Lunars tended to know sorcery, dammit, you don't use your real name! She hoped Arcane Fate would smooth out the edges of this conversation in retrospect...<br /> <br /> &quot;Every man's a slave to something, in my experience, friend.&quot; She smiled a friendly smile. &quot;For Flynn it's drink and music, for me it's an entirely unreasonable fear of spiders. Regardless, I suggest you use caution. This teahouse is full of Guild merchants, like myself, many of whom deal in slaves. If you offend one of them and we get caught up in a fight, it would be...well, rather the opposite of paying back that favor.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T22:57:03-08:00","id":362147,"title":"","content":"\u201cWhile I loth to remember it. I spent over 20 years as a slave laborer of The Guild. I know its horrors first hand.\u201d His eyes faded and and his frowning face like stone. His continence however was broken by the words of Swimming Owl. In a hushed shout, as he had a point about there location \u201cYou would compare the atrocity that is slavery to bad habits and irrational fears?! It is beyond inhuman it is abhorrent to all that is good.\u201d slowly regaining himself \u201cPeople must unite to stand ageist the threats that seek to destroy creation and The Guild Could provide such a framework if only it seeks to abandon slavery and otherwise exploiting the weaknesses of men, constantly undermining one another.\u201d still facing Swimming Owl \u201cand what good sir is your area of trade?\u201d he then tuerned back to his tea awaiting a reply. What a fantastic brew but the money that went into this one pot would have fed him for a week as a slave. These people throw wealth around so frivolously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-07-2015, 01:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T04:59:00-08:00","id":362336,"title":"","content":"Flynn drank his coffee and observed that Swimming Owl seemed to be annoyed at him. Because it was his fault that Ayesha sent some fucking barbarian with their real names to &quot;help&quot; them. <br /> <br /> Flynn sighed. He knew that Ayesha forgave him too easily for that &quot;Stupid Bitch&quot; comment. Apparently the stupid bitch decided that being ripped apart by Lunars was an appropriate punishment for calling the Gold Faction Leader names.<br /> <br /> Gods, he needed a drink.<br /> <br /> &quot;I wouldn't say I'm a slave to drink. We had a pretty good relationship, until recently. &quot; Flynn swirled the remains of his coffee around in his cup.<br /> <br /> &quot;While dismantling the slave trade is a noble goal, it must be done carefully or else you simply replace the Guild with something harsher. You can say many things about the Guild, but at least their actions aren\u2019t motivated by malice.\u201d<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T09:43:39-08:00","id":362557,"title":"","content":"<b>One hour ago, some miles distant</b><br /> <br /> It was wrong. Wrong in ways he lacked the words to explain. They had all felt it when they returned to the Creation, a visceral sense of loss and horror that felt like grief mixed with vertigo. Now he stood on a low rise, a space around him here none would approach. That was part of it, the fear in the invisible eyes. Something in him moved, a shift of feeling like a foundation settling, and he felt compelled to speak. It would be long before he would again be able to speak to those here, if even the least part of what they suspected was true they had far more pressing concerns.<br /> <br /> &quot;A splendor has gone out of the earth.&quot;<br /> <br /> The accusation hung in silent air.<br /> <br /> &quot;This light is not the light of elder days,<br /> that shown glad and golden in bliss.<br /> <br /> Harsh and broken is this fumbled speech,<br /> where once was song in metered verse.<br /> <br /> All about are faces once held dear,<br /> adorning empty tombs with smiles.<br /> <br /> What justice can cover so great a sin,<br /> as to leave us witness to this mockery?&quot;<br /> <br /> He felt like he should cry, to see the squalor of the mortal town, but he had no more tears. The last fat of easy life had burned away in the wyld, whether from hunger or mourning he did not know.<br /> <br /> &quot;Was that what <i>they</i> had fought for? What we had to watch Agralzo die for?&quot;<br /> <br /> It was an empty question. For whatever reason, it was here now, and he could not even bring himself to be disgusted. He felt only weariness; and hate.<br /> <br /> &quot;I cannot repay what you have all sacrificed. I have no thanks that are not an insult before my debt, yet still you have my thanks. For my part, I hold whatever obligations bound you to me discharged. Go as you will, and do as you think best. Your needs must now far exceed my own.&quot;<br /> <br /> He could neither see nor here what transpired, yet he knew one presence would remain. It could not but remain, for he had not included it in his dismissal. It was that presence he now addressed.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hold yourself in readiness to my call, but exercise what discretion you can.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Present</b><br /> <br /> There was a brief creak of the door and brightening of the room as a new man entered. He was covered head to foot in shapeless, concealing garments with only eyes of bright, northern blue visible. If he wished to go unnoticed, he had much to learn. The numerous lengths of cloth were silks and satins in deep blue, tyrian purple, and crimson; were elaborate and striking weaves and patterns; and hung heavy with embroidery and adornment of gold, amber, coral, and fire opal.<br /> <br /> The burden on his back was similarly concealed, yet by its size and the ease with which he bore it there was no question that it was one of the great weapons of the Exalted and children of gods.<br /> <br /> With almost predatory intensity he scanned the tea house, no doubt making many people very uncomfortable, before his gaze fell on the already crowded table where the others waited. His measured, determined steps quickly brought him to it. Only then did he speak, addressing himself to Swimming Owl.<br /> <br /> &quot;Guild'swoman?&quot; his accent was... off, touched by the slow, crisp diction of Heaven.<br /> <br /> He had met her not long after leaving the Wyld, with a caravan bearing fey treasures, the most readily able to speak his native Old Realm. He had gathered that they were part of some merchant venture, and likely an illegal one. Why else why they not have a warrant of trade or asked to see his transit papers? Yet if they would do him the courtesy of not prying he would do the same. He could ill afford any more risk when he knew so little.<br /> <br /> He had not believed much of what she said, the stories had been so outrageous as to be obvious dissembling. Now, here, they did not seem so impossible. That worried him. How could things have degenerated so quickly in so short a time? Even a refugee camp should have had better facilities and services, yet these structures looked permanent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 01-07-2015, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T13:25:00-08:00","id":362832,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ah, what a pleasure to see you, Master Splendor.&quot; Swimming Owl stood and she gave the newcomer a long bow. &quot;You are early, sir, and your punctuality much appreciated. Please allow me to introduce you to Nahuel, Flynn, and Fovnag the Healer. Gentle friends, this is Master Splendor of Unfurling Horizons, an artisan and savant who is, in this humble merchant's experience, without peer in the region at present. To answer your question, Healer, my services have been retained by Master Splendor. I ensure that he has access to the materials and supplies necessary for his work, and on occasion I assist him in the sale of the wonders he creates, or act as his intermediary with those with whom he chooses to do business.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Please, Master, have a seat. These men are the ones I mentioned to you in our earlier conversation. I believe, sir, that your interests in the city and theirs will align, and that you will all find one another's skills extremely useful in your endeavors.&quot;<br /> <br /> She offered up her spot at the booth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T13:57:58-08:00","id":362851,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am going to go see where the waitress wondered off to,&quot; Flynn gets up and goes to look for the frightened waitress to get refills on tea and coffee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T15:26:30-08:00","id":362966,"title":"","content":"Splendor of Unfurling Horizons now that is a name born from privilege if I have ever heard one. \u201cIt a joy to be in such august company as your self master Splendor.\u201d Bowing his head deeply.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T16:46:13-08:00","id":363008,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm. I do not normally... drink tea among my enemies, but this is your land, and your ways. I will let you advise me, until it is time for my ways.&quot; Nahuel takes another drink.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello. That is a very long name,&quot; he says to the new arrival with a nod of his head. He bows to no one. &quot;And what interests do you have? Or is that something else we should not talk about here?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T17:10:56-08:00","id":363038,"title":"","content":"Flynn comes back with a tray loaded with tea and coffee. He unloads the tray with ease and carefully sits back down at the table. <br /> <br /> &quot;Now, let's not be so hasty in our judgement. The Guild is a large and complex organization with a long reach. I even have had dealings with the guild at times. &quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn unlatches his Saxian case and carefully removes the instrument. The Saxian is a work of art- a relic from a long age. <br /> <br /> As he tunes the instrument, he continues, &quot;Obviously, I prefer to go freelance. I have no love of the Guild, but sometimes high ideals go to the way side. if you want to eat.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T17:38:13-08:00","id":363067,"title":"","content":"&quot;They can keep food from you? Hmph. There is food everywhere in nature, my friend. Even here I saw small beasts, and places where plants could grow.&quot; He shakes his head in dismay at the city-dwellers' silliness. &quot;No, this man has spoken the truth of things,&quot; Nahuel says with a nod to Servant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T17:46:54-08:00","id":363072,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, but the small beasts you see are owned by other people. Things are done differently than you are used to in these lands. You will attract unwanted attention if you do not follow the customs of the city.&quot;<br /> <br /> Not wanting to get into a disagreement with the Lunar, Flynn says, &quot;I'm not defending what the Guild is or represents, but I will not look down upon a man who is doing what he must to feed his family. The best option would be to replace the Guild with something that is less unsavory for the common man to work for.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T18:06:45-08:00","id":363080,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Guild merely gives people what they want, for a price. There will always be someone who does that. Get rid of us, and someone else would fill the void. If you really wanted to change things, you'd have to change what people wanted. Which is a task for musicians like Flynn and poets and great orators, not for humble merchants like myself.&quot; Owl smiled. &quot;But this place is busy and loud. Let us finish our meal and speak of sensitive matters elsewhere: some merchants trade in secrets, and I'd rather not give them ours cheaply if they're among the many caravan staff currently enjoying this tea house.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T18:09:37-08:00","id":363082,"title":"","content":"\u201c My apologies for the confusion, my words mislead.\u201d<br /> \u201cI mean no such brash action against The Guild as I learned long ago it has no effect and more commonly counter productive however delightful it might feel to do.\u201d The scum that deal in slaves might not be motivated by malice but greed can generate just as great of evil. The people can be far better fed and prosperous if it where not for The Guilds prying on men and there vices.\u201d<br /> \u201cDestroying The Guild outright is indeed fool hardy and overwhelmingly disastrous idea. No, the best way to purge the filth from The Guild without destroying its valuable framework is from the inside.\u201d &quot; But the question is best how to do it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Owl specks truth, let us find a more friendly venue&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T18:18:18-08:00","id":363088,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well there is a bar not far from here...&quot; Flynn smiles mischievously and watches Swimming Owl to she what her response to this is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Edited to make it clear Flynn is screwing with Swimming Owl. I couldn't think of the correct adverb last night. 01-08-2015, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T22:21:16-08:00","id":363212,"title":"","content":"The waitress seemed to be busy finding some &quot;lost&quot; item. <i>I can't believe my second shift had to start of with all of these weirdos. It's too bad anyone can just walk into a tea shop... coffee... coffee of all things. Why is he even here?!?</i><br /> <br /> Upon seeing Flynn the waitress straightens up. &quot;I am sorry. I was just looking to see if we had any coffee... yes... well... we don't have any sorry. Would you like some extra tea? I can have some more fireleaf tea prepared for you if you would like. It is one of our best brews!&quot; Her face brightens up with a smile that seems rather to be a face of annoyance than anything.<br /> <br /> However, you find that another waiter happens to have coffee available.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":".  Apparently... I was stuck on page 2 and didn't see the third page XD 01-08-2015, 01:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T13:30:00-08:00","id":363755,"title":"","content":"There were many things Splendor wished to say, very few of them meant for polite company. However, his tutors had broken him of the habit of speaking out long before he had ever met anyone it would be impolite to speak out in front of.<br /> <br /> Mostly he was confused. Slavery on the scale they were suggesting couldn't be merely the gratification of the rich, and infrastructure should have removed all motivation for large scale manual labor. Yet even as he began to open his mouth to comment or question his mind began to race. Situations when the networks began to break down and isolation and loss of tools leading to barbarism might bring back those motivations. The more he thought about it the filthier he felt. He could never accept it, but the fact that he could understand why rational people might engage in it was condemnation enough.<br /> <br /> All he did say was, &quot;For what are the majority of slaves used? If your guild is involved in their sale you must have some idea of who purchases them and for what.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T14:53:10-08:00","id":363838,"title":"","content":"Stunned at Splendor's ignorance of the pervasive use of slavery he spoke \u201c Other then for pleasures of the flesh and house servants of which someone of your stature surely has in abundance, slave are largely used for labor.\u201d<br /> \u201cThe type of labor that is hard, dangerous and potentially fatal. In the jungle entire tribes are taken to farm sugar for the rich to put in there tea.\u201d A fact the barbarian will surely delight to know that he has drank the product of his enslaved brethren labor.<br /> \u201ci was forced most often to build and rebuild roads and work the query for stone. I have seen many of my friends die from falling rocks and had no time to morn less I be punished for slowing down my work.\u201d \u201c That I survived is a miracle of a god I do not know.\u201d Looking downat his withered hands holding his sugarless tea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T15:09:48-08:00","id":363861,"title":"","content":"&quot;Really? Sorry Master, in your brilliance I sometimes forget that in your studies you have focused on the occult to the neglect of the mundane.&quot; Swimming Owl seemed a little surprised at Splendor's lack of knowledge. &quot;It's not really my area of business, I don't deal in the Hard Trade, but the majority of slaves are used for manual labor. Agriculture, construction, that sort of thing. More skilled slaves who have unique skills fetch a much higher price. The Guild doesn't go around enslaving people-most of the slaves we get are bought from their previous owners. Lots of them are taken prisoner during war in the Threshold lands, and the fact that the Guild is willing to pay for them encourages warlords to capture their enemies rather than just slaughter everybody. It's not pretty, but the economic reality is that the slave trade helps prevent shadowlands, and gives heads of state a better way to get rid of their opponents than genocide. There's more complicated local markets, too-some nations use slavery as punishment for major crimes or to pay off debts...but those are a smaller portion of the trade.&quot;<br /> <br /> She shrugged.<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, slavers tend to be...well, I hate to speak ill of my fellow guildsmen, but it's not work you take to if you're burdened with a conscience or empathy for your fellow man. There's a reason I choose to work with our artisans even though it's less profitable. Craftsmen are usually more pleasant business partners.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T15:28:56-08:00","id":363869,"title":"","content":"The coffee in Flynn's stomach soured as he listened to Fovnag's explanation. He had been on Coffee plantations before and they used slave labor also. How easy it was to ignore the suffering of the unseen for the pleasures right in front of you.<br /> <br /> Flynn idly plucked the first few chords of an old Flametongue Ballard. Dismantling the slave trade was a noble cause, but not everyone would agree. Men of Power did not like change and would turn the populace against them, if they succeeded. He could see the initial chaos used as just another reason why Anathema were dangerous and needed to be put down.<br /> <br /> It would take a great deal of skill and effort to change the opinion of the masses. But this was his battle field. Not the blood and gore of fist and sword, but hearts and minds of the average man.<br /> <br /> \u201cI know of a restaurant not far from here that rents private rooms for business. Perhaps we can acquire one for the evening and discuss more. \u201c Flynn was eager to get started.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-08-2015, 06:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T15:37:55-08:00","id":363873,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sounds perfect.&quot; Swimming Owl nodded, and left a few coins on the table. &quot;That should cover our beverages, gentlemen.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T17:03:01-08:00","id":363926,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well.&quot; Nahuel finishes his tea (it's rude to leave food uneaten, after all) and stands. &quot;Perhaps you do not know... sometimes, the Guild does go looking for slaves. It seems they cannot get enough.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T18:00:43-08:00","id":363956,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, sure.&quot; Owl shrugged again. &quot;The Guild is huge, and encompasses thousands of different merchant companies. Some of them do things differently. On the whole, though, buying slaves pre-captured from their tribe's enemies is cheaper than hiring a mercenary company to do the raiding yourself, so that's what most slave traders try to do. Not like there's exactly a shortage of territorial conflicts in the world.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T18:14:55-08:00","id":363960,"title":"","content":"&quot;Is that what you call them? We always just said we were at war.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T18:29:04-08:00","id":363978,"title":"","content":"The Sailor's Grotto was a run down restaurant not far from the Perfect Petal. It was a bit an eye-sore next to the other more reputable businesses in the area. Flynn walked up to the hostess at the front counter.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'd like a private room for a party of five. I'll be playing,&quot; gesturing at the Sanxian Case at this back, &quot;So it might be a good idea to situate us far from your other guests. I don't want to be a nuisance.&quot; Flynn smiles and passes over some coin to the hostess.<br /> <br /> As everyone settled in the room, Flynn said, &quot;It might not look like much, but the food is good and...&quot; He trails off for a moment. &quot;and the liquor is cheap. Not that I will be drinking any...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T18:39:24-08:00","id":363981,"title":"","content":"His ignorance as beginning to show more than he had hopped. Still, a morbid curiosity kept him talking. As they walked from one squalid hovel to a slightly more wretched hovel he asked,<br /> <br /> &quot;So these... wars damaged the bounty and practices of the land. Faced with starvation, poverty, and military weakness the people take up arms to acquire new lands and workers to sustain themselves. They remove the former inhabitants, who will not accept them, and purchase the dispossessed in other conflicts to perform the labor on their large domains. Is all this correct?&quot;<br /> <br /> It seemed fairly simple, except...<br /> <br /> &quot;Why have the savants not restored the upright practices so that the use of slaves is no longer required or the envoys negotiated among the factions so that they do not cause further conflict by their actions?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T19:43:22-08:00","id":364031,"title":"","content":"Flynn sighs. Where did the Gold Fraction find these people? No wonder they sent Swimming Owl and Flynn to guide them.<br /> <br /> Taking the Sanxian out of its case again, Flynn says, &quot;The world is more complicated than you would think; the straight forward solution is not always the best solution. Most people don't act in rational manner. &quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn sits down on a stool and tunes his instrument again. Taking a deep breath, he starts playing a mournful ballard.<br /> <br /> <i>Flynn's Performance Roll - 8 Successes out of 9 Dice (3 for Charmisa, 5 for Performance, 1 for String Instrument Performance Specialty) - <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3712/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3712/view</a></i><br /> <br /> The Riverspeak lyrics tells a story about a dragon blooded warlord that seduces and kidnaps the daughter of a Lookshy Shogun. The Shogun declares war on the Warlord\u2019s people in order to get his daughter back. After countless lives have been lost, the two lovers declare suicide to escape the consequences of their actions.<br /> <br /> Flynn leaves out the verse about how the Immaculate Dragons reincarnated the lovers as the lowest of worms for their actions. No need to bring up the Immaculate Philosophy here. And it really gives the song a bad ending in Flynn's opinion.<br /> <br /> After the song has ended, Flynn says \u201cI know numerous songs about the origins of countless wars. People, especially people in power, don\u2019t often act rationally. That is something that you should never forget. \u201c","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T19:58:43-08:00","id":364040,"title":"","content":"He shouldn't, he really shouldn't, but nevertheless...<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you know one about the... battle against the...&quot; what would it be called? It certainly wouldn't be framed in true terms. &quot;... war where the old order fell and the current state of the world began?&quot;<br /> <br /> He cursed himself for the vagueness, betraying yet more ignorance, yet he didn't know how to ask the question safely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T20:09:37-08:00","id":364048,"title":"","content":"Why, yes, Flynn knew many songs about the Usurpation, but there was no way that a mortal musician would know any from a Solar point of view. Best pretend not to know any at all.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, you like sad songs then? &quot; Flynn begins a song written not long after the Contagion. A gloomy song about a woman who was away from home during the Contagion and was trying to find her way back. It ends on a high note, if one could call it that, with her reuniting with her family in the underworld. <br /> <br /> Flynn takes a drink from a glass of water after he is finished. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T21:44:52-08:00","id":364092,"title":"","content":"Settling down before the table ordering nothing as not to waste his resources on frivolous food. He looked around at the group of people that, impossibly, not only shared completable goals to his but seemed to have the power he so desperately lacked, and to think all he was looking for was some information on the current goings on in a tea house he had arbitrarily chosen.<br /> \u201cYour grace you asked why the savants have not solved the plight of the people.\u201d The Servant say looking into the eyes of Splendor \u201cIt is well know you are be far the greatest savant in the entire East.\u201d<br /> \u201cIn fact I have a proposal for your greatness.\u201d \u201cPeople want cheap labor that slaves are exploited for.\u201d \u201c Have you considered creating a substitute or otherwise eliminating that deamned, with your peerless abilities you could most definitely succeed ?\u201d<br /> \u201cMoreover\u201d looking now at the Guildsmen \u201cthe wealth generated by such labor would be preposterous and bring power accordingly.\u201d<br /> <br /> That should appeal to the slavery loving scum of a Guildsmen. Focusing to contain his hatred the reminded him self that a person can only be your enemy when they are of no use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-09-2015, 07:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T21:52:59-08:00","id":365108,"title":"","content":"&quot;To begin, I wish to be clear that I mean to offer no offense and speak only out of ignorance that desires its own destruction. I am certain word of me has not spread across the East so rapidly and that no work I have done is worthy of notice, much less retelling. When you say it is known that I am the greatest savant in the East do you mean to be polite, to pay me a complement, or to illustrate my lack of accomplishment?&quot;<br /> <br /> He let the question hang for a moment before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;As for what I take to be the heart of your question, such things are complicated. I would first have to understand the tasks for which slaves are used before I could begin to know if I have the skill to devise better ways to perform them. Such an undertaking may be beyond me and I will make no promises I cannot keep. Moreover, another duty calls me which may prevent me from doing what I might otherwise wish.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T22:47:22-08:00","id":365122,"title":"","content":"&quot;I suspect he means no offense, Master Splendor.&quot; Owl smiled. &quot;I did, after all, just introduce you as the greatest savant of my experience, and we caravan-merchants do tend to travel.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T02:48:01-08:00","id":365233,"title":"","content":"Splendor's response was not only stunning but enlightening. He is not a shallow I first thought. All the better. While hidden depths oft contain danger they can contain equal treasurer and Splendor will be quite valuable.<br /> <br /> \u201cIndeed, I meant no offense nor did I intend to appear that I do not understand the complexity of the problem. I merely sought to propose a possible course of action to which apply your skills towards.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSkills I know you possess for you yourself said 'my lack of accomplishment' implying you are capable so such grad feats for a man of little skill can not be displeased at his lack of world shacking achievements.\u201d \u201c I can only ask for your forgiveness for my brash words.\u201d \u201cSlavery is a issue quite close to my heart and my passion flairs when it is brought to the fore.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201c You mentioned a preoccupying duty.\u201d \u201c If I my be so bold...\u201d pausing for a moment as he realized it was this exact type of bold speech that so often got him into difficult spots continued none the less. \u201cWhat is the task before you that someone so great would require such a motley assortment of peoples?\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T06:26:29-08:00","id":365338,"title":"","content":"Flynn sets his instrument aside; he has played enough for now for the cover story he gave the hostess to stick. He is interested in Splendor's response, as it might tell him what Swimming Owl's mission is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-10T09:19:22-08:00","id":365470,"title":"","content":"&quot;I was waiting for that, as well. I was told nothing of why I came here, and from your words, Swimming Owl, I doubt that vile slavers are the cause.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T14:42:06-08:00","id":366657,"title":"","content":"Swimming Owl glanced around the private room of the private room Flynn had gotten for them, smiling a slightly melancholy smile at the echoes of his music as he finished his songs and turned to the conversation. She took in the heavy wooden table, the small mirror on the wall, the paper lantern holding a candle hanging over the table and providing light...she pursed her lips and shook her head slightly.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm sure that Master Splendor will explain it better than I...and my apologies, gentlemen, I'm afraid I must leave you briefly. Flynn, you know this establishment. Which way is the restroom?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T17:54:17-08:00","id":366773,"title":"","content":"&quot;They are down stairs, not far from the kitchen...&quot; Flynn scratches his head. &quot; They can be difficult to find. Do you want me to show you?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T18:56:28-08:00","id":366799,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you don't mind terribly?&quot; Owl shrugged. &quot;We'll be right back, gentlemen. Please feel free to continue getting acquainted.&quot;<br /> <br /> She headed out the door, and once Flynn followed her out and down the hall towards the stairs and out of earshot, she whispered to him.<br /> <br /> &quot;We've got trouble incoming. Not sure what it is, but based on who sent me the warning, I'd put money on a Wyld Hunt. Which is just not fucking coincidence. Somebody up there must disagree with Ayesha's plan for the situation. I'm actually going to the bathroom, I need some privacy to ask my secretary a few questions, but would you mind giving the entrance a quick look? If it's just Shikari you might be able to distract them or send them next door or something. If they've got heavenly backup, I say get a warning to our guests upstairs and make an escape, I'll play the innocent bystander and gather information and catch up to you guys later. Sound good?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>OOC: We're in a reasonably busy tavern, and presumably there's talk and drinking all over the place which makes her whisper harder to hear. If any of y'all have invested in Awareness or Perception, though, I'll leave it up to the ST what you need to roll to hear someone down the hall and down the stairs whispering and to make it out of all the other conversations going on.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T19:21:28-08:00","id":366811,"title":"","content":"&quot;Shit. I'll go deal with whoever is at the entrance. &quot; Flynn heads towards the front door. He is going to stand in the hallway out of sight of the entrance and listen to what is going on at the front door.<br /> <br /> (Perception 2 + Awareness 3 + Listening Specialty 1 = 6 Dice. 6 Successes <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3818/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3818/view</a>)<br /> <br /> (Flynn wants to know what is going on at the front door and if he recognizes any voices as Sidereals.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Bad Grammar. 01-12-2015, 09:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T02:23:07-08:00","id":367166,"title":"","content":"Talos Cauthon sat alone at a table near the staircase leading to the private rooms, quietly looking over an old looking book in his hands. A private room was not outside of his price range, but it had been a long while since he had heard the dull roar of a busy tavern or restaurant. After so many weeks exploring the Clockwork Citadel, the distractions of the Sailor's Grotto were almost soothing. The former Guild prince had his wide brimmed hat sitting on the table next to him, leaving the young man's mess of light blue hair exposed. He wore an overcoat that had one point been well made, but had seen one too many days on the road. His weapon (he had taken to calling the spear &quot;Hidden Storm&quot; due to the Old Realm inscription on the shaft) was wrapped up in simple cloth to hide it's true appearance.<br /> <br /> <i>One would think a book about the City of Makers might include SOME way to get inside the damned place...</i> Talos thought to himself as he marked his page, sliding the book back into the satchel that was slung on the back of his chair. He took a sip of his tea, surveying the common room of the Sailor's Grotto. As he took a sip of his now cold tea, Talos realized that he had been reading for a few hours now. He needed a break<br /> <br /> Talos put on his hat and reached for his &quot;walking stick&quot;, but stopped as he saw Swimming Owl walk past. He smiled at the pretty woman, &quot;Hello there. Care for a drink? The server was just about to get me a new pot of tea if you'd like to sit down.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> (I don't know of a better way to introduce Talos, so hitting on a Sidereal while oblivious to a dire situation seems like the most fun way :P )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 01-12-2015, 05:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T08:09:22-08:00","id":367370,"title":"","content":"OOC: Best watch out. Owl's rocking Appearance 4 and a Presence Specialty in seduction!<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl glanced over her shoulder.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hm. No, I don't think I'll sit down. You'll have to stand up. Follow me.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that she swept past, towards the restrooms.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T10:12:53-08:00","id":367486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=366799#post366799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;If you don't mind terribly?&quot; Owl shrugged. &quot;We'll be right back, gentlemen. Please feel free to continue getting acquainted.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>OOC: We're in a reasonably busy tavern, and presumably there's talk and drinking all over the place which makes her whisper harder to hear. If any of y'all have invested in Awareness or Perception, though, I'll leave it up to the ST what you need to roll to hear someone down the hall and down the stairs whispering and to make it out of all the other conversations going on.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>[OOC] Since noone has any &quot;keen&quot; senses, I will ignore a roll at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T11:05:21-08:00","id":367563,"title":"","content":"(My roll was for listening in the hallway for Wyld Hunt disturbance at front entrance. If Flynn doesn't hear anything, he will go check it out visually.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 02:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T12:57:16-08:00","id":367749,"title":"","content":"As Flynn realizes that listening for sign of a Wyld Hunt or Sidereal is of no use, he goes outside to see a bustling street. It seems everything is going on as normal and he hears a bit more about the &quot;Lady&quot; and the guild.<br /> <br /> The day is still young and the sun is brightly shining overhead causing it to be quite warm, as one would expect in the fire months. The humongous, nearby trees are swaying in the wind, thankfully showing that there is a breeze nearby to possibly cool down in. The birds are chirping furiously in the nearby patch of the woods. The road to the edge of town is filled with carts bringing wares back and forth between stalls and most likely other towns.<br /> <br /> Through all the bustle, you do not see anything unusual or signs of a Wyld Hunt (<i>roll Per+Awareness for more info; Flynn only</i>). There actually seems to be a lack of high-up dragon-blooded and warriors in this town. It seems pretty quiet. The town has all the usual things for a small town; a bar, a pleasure house, tea house, bazaar, smithy (which doesn't seem to get very busy), a courthouse, and a small outcropping of huts at the edge of town. (At least that is all you can see right now.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 01-12-2015, 04:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:16:02-08:00","id":367767,"title":"","content":"Flynn breezes in the fresh air as he looks around from the doorway of the Sailor's Grotto.<br /> <br /> (Perception 2 + Awareness 3 = 5 Dice - 3 Successes <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3825/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3825/view</a>)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 04:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:17:16-08:00","id":367769,"title":"","content":"Flynn notices that the furiously chirping birds seem to be upset about something happening in the trees. You can hear a sort of quiet rumbling coming from the distance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:21:02-08:00","id":367771,"title":"","content":"Flynn will also activate Prior Warning (Sidereal, p 173) for 6 motes of Personal Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:39:57-08:00","id":367790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=367771#post367771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Flynn will also activate Prior Warning (Sidereal, p 173) for 6 motes of Personal Essence.</div> </div> </div> </div>[OOC] Please make the (wits+awareness) roll for the charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:41:04-08:00","id":367792,"title":"","content":"&quot;There are two questions at issue, and I will openly state that I am uncomfortable giving complete answers.&quot;<br /> <br /> He took a breath to steady himself, though it was more for effect than his nerves.<br /> <br /> &quot;For what may call my attention elsewhere, I owe a debt of vengence for the murder of my father. Those responsible are powerful and secretive. I do not believe I now possess the ability to pay them back for what they have done. Furthermore, his absence has let to the ruin and decay of much that he once managed. That is the essence of the wider purpose.<br /> <br /> Bluntly, this area is a cesspit of ignorance, want, squalor, and immorality. The Realm has withdrawn and chaos rushes in to fill the vacuum. The prevalence of slavery and exploitation by the Guild is only a part of the broader problems. Where my father here I believe his influence would have counteracted this. Now I must take up his responsibilities, though I am one and alone.&quot;<br /> <br /> He straightened, catching the eye of each of those present before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Swimming Owl assembled you all here to be part of this effort. She assures me that none of you owe love or allegiance to the current order and would be willing to exert great effort to redeem creation from this Age of Sorrows. I cannot ask it of you, for all things run down and we would be fighting against the current of the age. The Guild and corrupt gods who trespass against the Mandate of Heaven already move to oppose any true change, and they are merely the threats we know of. However, I believe we can succeed. Rather, we must succeed. Humanity deserves more than this; fought and died for more than this.<br /> <br /> We each bring unique skills and advantages to such a task, yet one is worth more than most. I <i>know</i> things can be better. I have seen it. Even if the old ways are gone, we have proof that we do not need to accept this.&quot;<br /> <br /> He spread his hands at the last word, taking in the dingy room in the grungy city in the unstable world.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, what say you all?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T13:47:20-08:00","id":367799,"title":"","content":"(Wits 4 + Awareness 3 = 7 Dice - 3 Successes <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3832/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3832/view</a>)<br /> <br /> <br /> [OOC] Flynn has been to this town before. Is the lack of Dragonblooded unusual? Also, is the disturbance in the trees and the distance rumbling coming from the same direction?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T14:39:53-08:00","id":367845,"title":"","content":"Talos freezes a moment in surprise. Usually women weren't this forward with his advances. He quickly picked up his satchel of books and followed Swimming Owl, taking careful note of the rest of the bar and this beautiful stranger. She didn't seem like your average courtesan, nor a barmaid looking for a cheap thrill.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm going to take a wild guess and say that this encounter isn't going to end in casual sex?&quot; Talos asks as they exit the common room to the bathroom hallway.<br /> <br /> (I would have rolled an Investigation to discover something was wrong, but Invisible Castle appears to be down for maintenance.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I'm gonna go by the trust system for now. I rolled 4, 2, 8, 3, 9, 5, 1 and 6. So that's a total of two successes.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 01-12-2015, 06:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T14:53:14-08:00","id":367856,"title":"","content":"Flynn notices that the rumbling and the disturbance are coming from the same area. <i>There is trouble coming to this area in 5 minutes. </i>Flynn does not notice much difference in the amount of dragon-blooded. Seems like any given normal day (well since the guild and Thousand Rivers came in and all).<br /> <br /> [OOC] You can use rpnation for dicerolling if need be. Feel free to use another for now. Invisible castle seems to go down quite a bit :/. If you wish to roll dice in real life and post it, I am fine with that. I will go with the trust system for right now. If anything seems odd, then I might start asking to use only online dicerollers.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T15:07:25-08:00","id":367866,"title":"","content":"Flynn heads back into the Sailor's Grotto and back up stairs to the private room. While packing up his Sanxian, he says, &quot;I went out side to get some fresh air and noticed a strange rumbling outside. I don't know what is causing it. Doesn't sound like thunder. Even the birds in the trees seem to be unsettled by it. I got a bad feeling about this. &quot;<br /> <br /> Swinging his Sanxian case to his back, Flynn continues, &quot;I think it might be a good idea to get somewhere safe until it all blows over.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T16:03:56-08:00","id":367909,"title":"","content":"Splendor's hand gripped what must be the handle of his oversized weapon.<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems assassins do not wait overlong.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T16:11:56-08:00","id":367939,"title":"","content":"&quot;No offense, but I don't think the birds would be reacting to just assassins. The rumbling is not a good sign. There are plenty of other dangers in the south that could affect the whole town.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 07:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T16:22:44-08:00","id":367948,"title":"","content":"Crap! The Guild has found him, could it be the guildsmen knew who he was somehow?<br /> <br /> The blood dried from his face when he realized an even worse possibility then the Guild. Was it his old master? Reflexively his had went to the hammer hidden under his clothes, this hammer better be worth it. Gods knows it was not. HE must watch his tongue less it cause more difficulties in his life.<br /> <br /> He relaxed however when the others suggested different troubles. He had never considered the fact theses new acquaintances might have trouble of their own. His life however was still possibly in danger keeping his guard up he grasped his walking staff.<br /> <br /> \u201c Well then lets get a move on.\u201d as he walked towards the stairs with much more vigor then one would expect for a 50 year old man.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T16:31:38-08:00","id":367973,"title":"","content":"Flynn looked over the other men in the room. Will they stand thier ground and fight? Or will they run and hide? <br /> <br /> &quot; Let's leave though the kitchen. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-12-2015, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T17:05:36-08:00","id":367997,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not engage in casual sex, sir.&quot; Swimming Owl chuckled. &quot;I have <i>passionate affairs.</i> They're much more interesting. You're coming with me because I expect I'm about to be in a world of trouble and I could use a man with me who carries a cloth-wrapped weapon into a tavern-which, by the way, is just asking for someone to try to steal it, nobody wraps up anything that's not at least highly valuable-and because what's the point of being a Prince of the Earth if you say no to a beautiful woman in danger? I expect you know how to use that spear of yours if you have to?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T18:15:48-08:00","id":368067,"title":"","content":"&quot;Many of your words are strange to me, referring to things I do not know,&quot; Nahuel says slowly when Splendor asks them to join in the turning of the course of an Age. &quot;Until six months ago, I had never seen any land that was not jungle or swamp. But if I do understand you, I agree that the world is getting worse, that can be seen even from my small corner of it. If that is the purpose for which Luna Chose me to wield her power, it would be shameful indeed for me to turn away.&quot;<br /> <br /> His ears perk up - literally - when Flynn speaks of the birds being disturbed. &quot;This city must be dulling my senses... I have had to run from danger before... I do not care for the taste of it. If Splendor is right, and assassins come for us, I would rather slay them here and now. If it is some other danger, the people in the town deserve a chance to flee as well. Let me go forth in a borrowed skin, and see what I can discover.&quot;<br /> <br /> He rises from the table, and heads for the door outside, through the kitchen as Flynn suggested. As soon as the group is relatively unobserved, or at least attention is off of him, he shifts his form to a common southeastern bird and takes wing to see what has the real birds so agitated, casting about with his avian senses and letting his instincts interpret the other birds' calls.<br /> <br /> (4 successes on Perception + AWareness. <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3840/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3840/view</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:16:19-08:00","id":368152,"title":"","content":"Flynn enviously watches Nahuel fly away and mumbles &quot;Amazing&quot; under his breath. He has never seen a Lunar shift before. The only time he was on a Wyld Hunt was when he and Jericho were on the wrong end of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T21:14:52-08:00","id":368244,"title":"","content":"<i>Prince of the Earth.....Crap! She thinks I'm a Dynast!</i> <br /> <br /> Talos shrugs, &quot;I can handle my own with this, though I have a few questions first. Namely, who are you and who is chasing you?&quot; He begins to undo the cloth hiding his spear. &quot;And exactly how worried should I be for our safety?&quot; He looks out into the common room, trying to spot whoever might be chasing this woman.<br /> <br /> (Perception Awareness Roll to spot any dangerous looking individuals: 3,9,4,10,8. So 4 successes in total.)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T22:23:27-08:00","id":368296,"title":"","content":"&quot;Swimming Owl, don't know yet, and...moderately. Guard the door of the restroom? I'll be right back out.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T22:56:51-08:00","id":368312,"title":"","content":"&quot;But there's.....&quot; Talos starts as Swimming Owl vanishes into the bathroom. &quot;Well, I guess when you gotta go....&quot; He leans against the wall, unwrapping his spear so he can be ready for anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T23:10:59-08:00","id":368318,"title":"","content":"Nahuel notices that a giant Yeddim is for some reason trying to travel through the forest. It continues to run into many trees, knock nests from trees, and trample many creatures' homes on the ground. You see no signs of anyone near the Yeddim. Just running creatures and birds watching.<br /> <br /> Talos notices that there is one man that has a knife strapped to his leg under his pants, but he does seem to be very intoxicated. He is probably not any REAL danger here. Everything else seems fairly par for the course in the bar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T01:04:28-08:00","id":368400,"title":"","content":"&quot;Damn damn damn,&quot; a muttering came from inside the restroom door. &quot;Should have been ready for this...&quot;<br /> <br /> Sitting on the toilet with the stall door closed, Swimming Owl focused her mind and her Essence until a glimmering green spider scuttled down out of nowhere and into her palm. Of course, since it was invisible and the restroom was empty other than Owl, nobody could see its green glimmering. &quot;According to Bullet's reports filed with the Thousand Rivers Oversight Committee, what is the nature of the trouble which is projected to arrive at the Sailor's Grotto tavern in Puyo today? Make it snappy, little guy.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the spider scuttled back to wherever it came from, Swimming Owl stood and reached behind her back. The flowing black cape she wore concealed her neatly-folded starmetal bow...she decided to leave the bow hidden unless she needed it. Besides, its pressure against her spine helped her stand up straight instead of slouching...instead, she pulled one of her firewands out of its holster. With practiced skill, she took a small glass vial from her belt and loaded it into the barrel, then stuffed a small piece of cloth in to hold it in place. Then she pulled the cloth of her cloak over the lower part of her face, smiling at the familiar feel of the magical mask tightening into place.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fuck you, Bullet,&quot; she muttered under the mask. &quot;Would it have been so hard to send me the details?&quot;<br /> <br /> About a minute after she had entered, she stepped out of the bathroom, her nose and mouth masked in black and a firewand in hand.<br /> <br /> Her eyes glimmered in a green smile as she turned to Talos. &quot;Thanks for helping, new friend. I'm Swimming Owl, Merchant Princess. I hope it doesn't come to this, but if I shoot this firewand, hold your breath until the smoke clears, alright?&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: 2m on Efficient Secretary Technique.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T02:39:24-08:00","id":368471,"title":"","content":"He watched as Nahuel shifted his form in a relatively public place. <i>Ah the indiscretions of youth. Does he care that some people see him for a lunner, risky business transforming in public even if it appears secluded. Young people must have there way must they not. Flying straight towards the unknown danger. Alas we do need more information, someone had to do it. Well better his death then mine. It appears having foolhardy companions high with the heady feeling of youth has some benefits.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cWhat a brave warrior.\u201d he says mostly to himself, but loud enough for Nahuel to hear as he took flight. <i>That should stroke his ego.</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T05:58:13-08:00","id":368545,"title":"","content":"After exactly 7 seconds (quite snappy indeed), the spider coalesces on your shoulder out of sight of the others. You feel a small little <i>tap, tap ,tap, </i>and hear a small little whisper say, &quot;According to the reports files with the Thousand Rivers Oversight Comittee, a huge falling tree crushing the Sailor's Grotto Tavern is going to occur in exactly 3 minutes and 42 seconds.&quot; As soon as the words finish coming out of its mouth, it promptly de-materializes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T14:07:51-08:00","id":368955,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, a pleasure.&quot; Talos says, taking off his hat, &quot;I'm Talos Cauthon, originally from Nexus.&quot; He takes another look over his shoulder, &quot;But we should get to know each other later. If you're in danger, we should make our way to the door. Or a window.&quot; He moves to the end of the bathroom hallway, opening up a window to the outside. He turns to Swimming Owl and gestures out, &quot;Merchant royalty first.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T14:22:46-08:00","id":368965,"title":"","content":"&quot;We should keep moving. I have a feeling that Nahuel can easily find us once he comes back and I want there to be an &quot;us&quot; to come back to.&quot; He worried a bit about Swimming Owl, but she said that she could take care of herself and probably had some plan she wanted to enact. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T16:48:14-08:00","id":369147,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">He turned his back at this statement having already started his strategic withdrawal form the incoming danger. \u201cI could not agree more with such a wise sentiment.\u201d he said as he continued walking</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:02:51-08:00","id":369169,"title":"","content":"&quot;A fellow Nexus brat, huh?&quot; Swimming Owl smiled for real at that. &quot;Small world....your name's familiar, Talos Cauthon, but I'm having trouble placing it. But yes, leaving the bar immediately is a good idea. Say, you're one of the Exalted, right?&quot;<br /> <br /> She gracefully clambered up to perch on the window sill, one leg dangling down. &quot;How strong are you? Like, are you pull-a-wagon strong, or carry-a-wagon strong?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:14:26-08:00","id":369180,"title":"","content":"[OOC] I am going to assume that the window is on the back wall of the tavern.<br /> <br /> Flynn followed Fovnag out the back door into the alley ran behind all the business on the street. He kept an eye out for any dangerous persons and finds Swimming Owl half out of a window.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you need a hand down?&quot; Flynn asks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-13-2015, 08:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:19:56-08:00","id":369183,"title":"","content":"[OOC] Wait. Swimming Owl is in her mask. What is the effect of the mask? Would Flynn recognize her?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:27:15-08:00","id":369193,"title":"","content":"Splendor followed the general exit, only now painfully aware that celestial casual wear might not be inconspicuous in Creation. Yet for all that his hand was firmly gripping his weapon, the unspoken command on his lips was far more readied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:43:42-08:00","id":369212,"title":"","content":"OOC: See that dark cloak she's wearing in the character portrait? That's a Gill Cloak-the mask lets her breathe underwater if she has to. The hood of the cloak wraps up around her mouth and nose, but her eyes and hair are uncovered, and she's not in disguise or anything. So yes, you may feel free to recognize her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:45:18-08:00","id":369214,"title":"","content":"[OOC] Cool. I won't edit my post then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T17:58:24-08:00","id":369227,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm.....not really a 'pull a cart' kind of Exalted.&quot; Talos says as he follows Swimming Owl out of the window, &quot;I'm the 'figure out ancient puzzles that have killed hundreds of explorers' kind of Exalted.&quot; He looks out the window at Flynn helping her down, &quot;I'm gonna go out on a limb here and say you guys <i>aren't</i> part of the Wyld Hunt?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T18:03:15-08:00","id":369233,"title":"","content":"Well that's odd. Yeddims usually have more sense than to go running headlong into trees. The fact that it's heading towards the town makes it even more worrisome... Nahuel's seen the kind of damage a falling tree can do first hand. This requires a closer inspection.<br /> <br /> He flies towards the rampaging beast, trying to discern what's driving it to this state, and to see if he can do anything to divert it. If nothing else is apparent, he'll change from a small songbird into a large eagle and dive at the Yeddim's eyes to distract it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T19:21:25-08:00","id":369302,"title":"","content":"&quot;Safe limb.&quot; Owl smirked as she slid out the window, taking Flynn's proffered hand as she climbed down. &quot;Come on. Wasn't expecting to run into this lot again until later, but I suppose we can do introductions now. Gentlemen, this is Talos Cauthon, explorer, adventurer, Scavenger Prince...and a fellow Guildsman, if I'm remembering my ledgers rightly? I knew the name sounded familiar.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T19:46:47-08:00","id":369326,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>Allies just seem to be falling out of the sky today, or windows in this case. </i></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">\u201c Its a delight to make you acquaintance good </span>Talos Cauthon.\u201d <i>By the gods another Guildsmen just what I need in a traveling companion at least hes an Exalt and he does strike me a dyniest none I have known would put them selves so low as to clime out a window into an alleyway, so hes likely another sidereal.</i><br /> <br /> \u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Well don\u2019t get your hopes up youngen there might well be a wyld hunt coming straight for us.\u201d \u201cDoes anyone actually know the danger we are facing?\u201d \u201cWhat the strange rumbling noise we are dealing with is?\u201d casting his head about and settling on \u201cFlyn, any ideas?\u201d</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-14-2015, 12:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T19:49:38-08:00","id":369330,"title":"","content":"Flynn continues to walk down the alley. &quot;I was hoping Nahuel would return soon with details.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:03:55-08:00","id":370478,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whatever it is, it's getting louder, which means it's coming this way. I propose we clear the immediate area...though of course, there's something to be said for attempting to get everyone else to do the same. Any ideas on how to clear out the bar's other patrons real quick?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:18:23-08:00","id":370498,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmmm.... Perhaps we can start a small kitchen fire? Or at least fake one?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:23:15-08:00","id":370504,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>The best way is probably to transform into a bear and rampage thue the bar to clear it out, but talk about exposure.</i> He thought to him self. While The Servant did not pertinently care about the people drinking with in the bar, besides many of them are Guildsmen deserving of what ever came their way, his new travailing companions did seem to. </span><br /> \u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">... instead of burning the place down lets just make everyone believe there is a danger and have them flee in panic out the doors.\u201d </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-14-2015, 09:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:35:18-08:00","id":370523,"title":"","content":"&quot;How are we suppose to go about doing that?'' Flynn asked. They did not have much time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:53:56-08:00","id":370569,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Keeping a stone face of indifference and continuing his withdraw from the danger. \u201cWhy not just run in screaming that there is a fire by the gods there is a fire RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!, with a panicked demeanor then running out?\u201d he said in a nonchalant manner as he tossed his hands around, keeping hold of his staff. \u201c You're a performer Flynn surely you pick something up about acting while learning such a fine instrument.\u201d</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T06:41:54-08:00","id":370930,"title":"","content":"&quot;...okay, this is dumb.&quot; Owl sighed. &quot;I'll meet up with you guys later. I'm gonna go tell the bartender there's a giant rumbling coming this way and tell him to kick everyone out and close the bar early. Worst case, I'll have to bribe him. Meanwhile, you big burly heroes can stand between whatever that rumbling noise is and the bar and make sure nobody blows the place up while I'm in there. Sound good?&quot;<br /> <br /> Without waiting for an answer, she jumped up to grab the windowsill and began climbing back <i>in </i>through the window she'd just climbed out of.<br /> <br /> &quot;Today has been a strange day,&quot; she observed.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T07:05:01-08:00","id":370988,"title":"","content":"Flynn looks embarrassed that he didn't think of that. An orderly evacuation is much better than panic. Or setting the kitchen on fire. Without a word, he heads out of the back alley and towards the front of the bar. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T18:27:53-08:00","id":371674,"title":"","content":"Once she was back inside, Owl sprinted down the hall towards the bar's main room. Grabbing a waitress, she growled, &quot;Who's in charge here? We need to close this place, now.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Shit shit shit I have less than two minutes I really hope one of those guys is up to stopping a tree from falling on me, </i>she thought to herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T19:13:49-08:00","id":371692,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Watching as Swimming Owl slithered back into the bar window, <i>like the slavery loving snake she was</i>, he saw the situation for what it is.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>Everyone thinks the bars going to be destroyed so if she fails in her goal she might well die along with her guildmen kin or if she succeeds some innocent people, sans the guilds men inside, will be saved and I will look no the worse having supported such actions publicly.</i> He cracks a smile in spite of himself and the vary real danger he sill remains in from the sound. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">He continued into the Bazaar proper filled with pedestrians on the verge of panic from the rumbling and wet snapping sounds coming from the outskirts of town. <i>Where had that barbarous Nahule gotten off too, hope hes ok he has such utility left in him?</i></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T19:27:02-08:00","id":371706,"title":"","content":"Flynn heard the rumbling growing closer. <i> What the fuck is that?</i> he asked himself.<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl seems to know what is going on, but wasn't able to share. He felt bad about having Swimming Owl go into the bar instead of himself. He shouldn't have let that manipulative bastard of a lunar rile him up.<br /> <br /> She mentioned clearing the immediate area. He could lead these people away from the bar after they exit but how far away was safe?<br /> <br /> <br /> [OOC] Does Prior Warning tell Flynn when he is out of danger? Can he use it to know if he is far enough away from the danger?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-15-2015, 10:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T21:42:13-08:00","id":371828,"title":"","content":"As the rumbling grew louder, Talos slowly began to back away from the Sailor's Grotto.<br /> <br /> &quot;It truly is a pleasure to meet you all, and I'm sure we'll all become fast friends, but whatever <i>that</i> is,&quot; He points his spear out into the forest, where the rumbling seems to be coming from, &quot;I'm gonna need a plan in order to take it on.&quot; He tips his hat up with the butt of the spear, looking around the area.<br /> <br /> (OOC: Investigation+Intelligence roll to see if Talos can spot some sort of tactical advantage to taking on the approaching danger: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4750987/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4750987/</a><br /> <br /> That's three successes unless I'm counting wrong)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T22:54:28-08:00","id":371941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=371706#post371706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Flynn heard the rumbling growing closer. <i> What the fuck is that?</i> he asked himself.<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl seems to know what is going on, but wasn't able to share. He felt bad about having Swimming Owl go into the bar instead of himself. He shouldn't have let that manipulative bastard of a lunar rile him up.<br /> <br /> She mentioned clearing the immediate area. He could lead these people away from the bar after they exit but how far away was safe?<br /> <br /> <br /> [OOC] Does Prior Warning tell Flynn when he is out of danger? Can he use it to know if he is far enough away from the danger?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> [OOC] No it does not. It only tells you that your current path would lead to big trouble in x amount of time.<br /> <br /> A pang of feelings rush through Swimming Owl, who now feels that incoming danger seems to have moved back to about 4 minutes from now.<br /> <br /> Nahuel's claws stride at the Yeddims eyes. You can tell they are already damaged, but not it has completely lost its sight in its right eye. It lets out a loud type of moan and swings its head back and forth. The wind from this forces you back into the sky several yards away from it. After it finishes thrashing its head, it lowers its head towards the ground and begins to kneel for a second. After another few seconds, it begins to get back up and runs on the path towards another tree.<br /> <br /> Talos sees that the hill nearby seems to be a great view point to get a better idea of what is going on. It would also be a great place to have a bit of cover and still be near the forest.<br /> <br /> [OOC] You did count those correctly. 2 sux for a 10, 1 for the 9.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T01:08:56-08:00","id":372092,"title":"","content":"Talos takes off in a dead sprint for the hill, stabbing his spear into the ground when he reaches the top. He spins around to look at the forest (hopefully) seeing the yeddim rushing through the trees. &quot;Oh damn it....&quot; With a flick of his wrist, a flame piece flew from his sleeve into his hand. He takes aim at the stampeding creature, hoping to at least divert it away from the Sailor's Grotto.<br /> <br /> (OOC: Talos is just going to take aim at the rampaging yeddim now. I assume he sees it from the new vantage point at the top of the hill. If not, I'll roll Perception/Awareness)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T06:12:13-08:00","id":372237,"title":"","content":"Flynn pulls a small bamboo flute and a headband made of thick cloth from his messenger bag. After tying the headband over his forehead, he pulls on his bamboo rice hat. He leaps onto a convenient wooden crate in front of the crowd and puts the flute to his lips and starts playing.<br /> <br /> [OOC] Flynn is going to activate Perfection in Life (p. 147 in Sidereal book) for 5 personal motes. This is an non obvious charm. I am going to spend a willpower to channel Compassion for four extra dice. (Flynn has spent 11 personal motes and one willpower thus far).<br /> <br /> [OOC] Charisma 3 + Performance 5 + Compassion 4 = 12 dice with 4 successes (<a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3938/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3938/view</a>)<br /> <br /> [OOC] If Flynn succeeds, he is trying to get everyone in the crowds attention and try to calm them down. Once people start leaving the Sailor's Grotto, he will start moving away from the tavern and the rumbling noise. Also, everyone who can hear him play will get one point of temporary willpower (which can go over their max willpower).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-16-2015, 06:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T06:36:47-08:00","id":372265,"title":"","content":"As she followed the waitress to the barkeep, Swimming Owl let her false fate drop. Rather than a guildswoman, she was once again a stranger in town, an imposing and armed stranger wearing a black mask that covered her nose and mouth, whose beauty and deadly stare drew the eye but whose face would slide from the memory once she had left.<br /> <br /> Once she reached the proprietor of the establishment, she leaned in close and spoke firmly and very quietly, &quot;First, be quiet until I tell you to speak-I am Exalted, and a professional killer, and not in the mood to be questioned. You're going to do what I say and get paid handsomely, or else I'm going to quietly and painfully murder you and there is nobody in three miles dangerous enough to stop me. Understand? Good. I need use of your tavern. You have three minutes to kick everyone out. Tell them the place has been reserved for a private function. Recommend some other tavern nearby.&quot;<br /> <br /> She gave him a cold smile and put a moderately sized purse full of silver dinar down in front of him with a heavy <i>clink.</i> It was enough money for him to buy a whole second restaurant. A small one, but still.<br /> <br /> &quot;Send your staff home and take the rest of the day off. If anyone asks, a Guild Merchant wanted to show off for his young lover by reserving the whole restaurant. <b><i>These coins are not from Thorns, nobody is negotiating the sale of any slave caravans to the Mask of Winters today, and if any of your staff get curious and stick their noses in no harm will come to them.</i></b> Nod once if you understand.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: Spending 2m on Avoiding the Truth Technique for the bolded bit. Rolled 6 successes, plus 3 auto successes makes 9 successes to scare the hell out of the inkeeper, persuading him to quietly and quickly evacuate the place for the day. Enhanced with charms, this social attack would cost 3wp to resist. If his tongue wags in the coming days or weeks and rumors spread that the Mask of Winters is secretly buying up tons of slaves...well, two birds, one stone. <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=XPPHHNX2\" target=\"_blank\">Here's the link to my roll</a> (and to all the other rolls I've made or will make for this campaign).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","user":"Wise Old Guru","date":". 01-16-2015, 09:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T15:16:13-08:00","id":372934,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>I supposes I should actually do something less I appear the useless old man. </i>The crowds being enchanted by Flynn's stunning performance he found an unattended stall. Hunkering down and making sure no one could see him, he shifted. Darting out from the booth was a black hawk careening towards the sound. <i>It's safer to be in the sky then on the ground anyways, far easier to escape if need be.</i></span><br /> [OOC: 3 motes of personal essence spent]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-16-2015, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:38:50-08:00","id":373062,"title":"","content":"Talos takes aim at the giant Yeddim near the edge of the forest with his flamepiece. He knows that in just a second, he can make a more lethal attack. He notices a great black hawk soaring past him towards the Yeddim, but he is not distracted.<br /> <br /> As Flynn begins to play, people start to calm down and feel an urge to follow this wonderful man playing such a lovely tune. They don't seem to know why, but they know they should. People begin to skip after you, feeling very calm and a bit giddy.<br /> <br /> Flynn then notices that the patrons of the bar have started to file out of the tavern (mostly drunkenly), but join in trying to sing a song to the tune and wobble their way to you. After a short while, the barkeep runs out of the building holding a pouch. <br /> <br /> A short while after the barkeep nodded his head, Owl notices that everyone has gotten out except the completely drunk man with the knife in his boot. He seems to be going back to sleep. He had even slapped away a staff member trying to pull him out. At the moment, he seems quite oblivious to your presence.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:44:44-08:00","id":373069,"title":"","content":"Flynn leaps down from the crate and leads the crowd away from the tavern. Every so often, he turns to face the crowd. He is watching to see if Swimming Owl has left the Sailor's Grotto.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T23:28:54-08:00","id":373342,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Well, if the creature won't be diverted from causing havoc, and is clearly in pain... there's only one course left. <br /> <br /> Put it down.<br /> <br /> Nahuel's hawk eagle form rises up, gaining altitude above the mad yeddim, then stoops down in a dive. Just before impact, he shimmers in silver light, quickly stretching and growing, feathers becoming scales, beak becoming deadly fangs. A bird started the dive; a raptor cat completes it, sinking those fangs into the yeddim's spine.<br /> <br /> (Assuming a 2-die stunt, making a Fierce Blow. If successful, invoke Rocks-To-Pebbles and 2nd Strength Excellency to boost damage.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3996/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/3996/view</a> 4 successes.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T09:15:49-08:00","id":373520,"title":"","content":"Swimming Owl frowned.<br /> <br /> <i>Why must I be cursed to always deal with stubborn, stupid, old men? </i><br /> <br /> She briefly considered leaving the drunk old bastard to his fate. An old man showing up dead in the middle of the place would put some teeth into the rumors she'd just planted. Teeth which would make her mission easier, and hopefully lead in a roundabout way to making her new friends easier to point in the right direction.<br /> <br /> <i>Actually, Swimming Owl, you make a great point. And if he was anybody really important, I'm sure they wouldn't have scheduled a tree to fall on him.</i><br /> <br /> And with that thought, Owl walked away and let the old bastard enjoy his drink in peace and quiet. She left the pub out the front door, the last to exit, since the old man wouldn't be leaving soon if he ever left at all, and she watched the crowd following Flynn away. As the rumbling from the nearby forest grew louder, she sighed.<br /> <br /> &quot;Always,&quot; she muttered, and wandered off to join the crowd following Flynn, in search of high ground or a good vantage point from which to watch whatever happened to the tavern she'd just vacated. Gently waving her hand, she pulled at the skein of Fate and donned once more the garb of the cynical guildswoman who liked shiny objects and plotted with the Anathema. Time to watch and see what these Anathema would do about that rumbling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T09:26:12-08:00","id":373538,"title":"","content":"Splendor had watched all that occurred with detachment. He was not accustom to all this excitement, and would likely have made things worse with his attempts. Also, if this was what he thought it was, the best thing he could do for these people was get far away.<br /> <br /> &quot;Guildswoman, what do you suppose the odds are that just as we all gather together, with one of the Stewards in our number no less, that <i>this </i>would happen?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T09:53:01-08:00","id":373567,"title":"","content":"Flynn was visible relieved when he saw Swimming Owl exit the tavern. He kept an eye on where she was headed to see just how far he had to lead the crowd away to be safe.<br /> <br /> Doing a quick search of the crowd to see where everyone else was, he noticed that everyone else was gone except for Splendor and Swimming Owl. Splendor seemed nervous about the whole situation. Flynn made a mental note to talk to the Solar to see why the situation was making him uncomfortable. There will be future crisis to be dealt with.<br /> <br /> As Flynn continued playing his flute, he tried not to worry about the fate of his other companions. His supervisors in Yu Shan always said that he needed to keep an emotional distance from his mission objectives, but Flynn was never good at following the advice of his superiors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-17-2015, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:18:33-08:00","id":373785,"title":"","content":"Talos keeps his arm steady, aiming at the Yeddim's head. &quot;Come on.....come on you stupid beast. Give me an opening.....&quot; As soon as the creature's head is exposed from between the trees, he pulls the trigger. A bolt of fire flies from the flame piece and towards the yeddim.<br /> <br /> (OOC: With the three bonus die, Talos should be up to eight. His intention is either to kill the yeddim, or get it to turn away from the town. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4752049/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4752049/</a><br /> <br /> So that's 4 successes.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T00:31:47-08:00","id":374101,"title":"","content":"&quot;Pretty good, Master Splendor.&quot; Swimming Owl shrugged. &quot;Many of us were traveling in the same caravan together. It was only a matter of time until some danger arose, and when danger arises...well, you are all the sort of people who charge towards it. If it wasn't today it might have been tomorrow, or next week, but my old teacher always taught me, <i>Owl, when you work with the Exalted, you have to be ready for anything, because whatever happens they will shove their noses right in the middle of it.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> She smiled. &quot;I'd be lying if I said I don't admire that quality in people, Master. But it is something I have to take into consideration financially, in terms of risk management analysis on my investments. Mostly I'm betting that you can handle whatever fate throws your way, and that if you can't several of you together can. I hope I'm right, sir. I'm wagering quite a bit on you lot.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T19:34:50-08:00","id":374684,"title":"","content":"After multiple injuries bursting with blood, the Yeddim slowly falls down. As it is shot, the final blow kills the giant beast and dies in place. None of the trees are knocked down in the process.<br /> <br /> A few seconds later, a figure comes out of the trees. They seem to be mumbling a bit angrily to themselves, and Flynn hears &quot;...to help, but....&quot;. The next second, the figure kicks the tree nearly in half, and it falls onto the tavern. Seemingly satisfied, the figure quickly disappears into the trees.<br /> <br /> [OOC] Yes, that is a sufficient for a two die-stunt. Please count that as 1 bonus exp for this &quot;story session&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T20:58:55-08:00","id":374829,"title":"","content":"<i>What the fuck? </i>Flynn continues to play, but tries to catch Swimming Owl's eyes. He nods towards where the strange figure disappeared into the woods. Taking the flute from his lips, Flynn begins singing an Audience Participation song. <br /> <br /> [OOC] Flynn is trying to get the crowd to entertain themselves so he can stop performing and sneak away. <br /> <br /> Manipulation 5 + Performance 5 = 10 dice (2 Successes)<br /> <br /> [/OOC]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T21:25:22-08:00","id":374848,"title":"","content":"Nauel rides the Yeddim down as it falls, and clambers up onto its back to observe the results of his and the stranger's strike. He is a bit stupefied by the man who walks out of nowhere and makes all their efforts for naught before disappearing. He attempts to trace the man who kicked the tree back where he came.<br /> <br /> <i>OOC: </i><i>Using Perception excellency and Eye of the Cat if applicable.</i><br /> <br /> If those efforts fail, he returns to his human form and heads in the direction the fire-bolt came from. &quot;Who are you, hunter-with-flame?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T21:55:44-08:00","id":374858,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think we can dispense with the idea that this was natural out of hand, and move on to the more pertinent question. Which one of us was the target? Based on everyone's reaction we all appear to have some sort of doom hanging over our heads.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T21:56:00-08:00","id":374859,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Just as he reached to where he could strike the Yeddim a rain of fire brought the beast down forcing him into trying to act he knew what he was doing. What he saw next however nearly made him fly into a tree in astonishment. A man just walked up and kicked a tree in to the tavern. <i>That is simply not appropriate behavior.</i> Ignoring the falling Yeddim and recovering he focused on the man and </span></span>followed <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">him (OOC: Perception+ Awareness 4suc <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4035/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4035/view</a>) perched on a low branch of a tree in the direction the man was fuming away towards. The Servant shifted in to Fovnag and dropped form the tress in front of him (OOC: 3 motes)<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat the hell do you think you\u2019re doing?! Do you think buildings just suddenly appear like I did?!&quot;<br /> <br /> Pausing just long enough let cut off any response from the insolent man.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou have no idea how long it takes people to cobble together a building that large!\u201d \u201c this totally ignoring the fact that people in that building are likely dead now. I am in total awe How? How?! In your mind can you justify what you have just done? Here he paused long enough for a replay as he sooo, desperately, wanted to know why he so heedlessly destroyed hundreds of man hour <i>(slave hours more like it) </i>of work.<br /> <br /> <br /> If i failed to catch him i walk back to town as Fovnag </span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-19-2015, 01:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-18T23:31:01-08:00","id":374938,"title":"","content":"&quot;You are wise as always, Master Splendor. My master also told me, <i>Never put down to circumstance what you can attribute to malice. </i>It is always safer to err on the side of paranoia. That being said...&quot; she shook her head in thought. &quot;No one knew that we would be at that particular tavern except Flynn, who chose the place and who I doubt wanted a tree dropped on his head. And, frankly...well, anyone who had a reason to target one or more of our little gathering would surely have had the good sense to move quietly. A rampaging yeddim is, after all, detectable from some distance away, and easily enough avoided. If I were trying to kill one or more of you, I'd have put sleeping powder in the drinks and lit the place on fire, or hired someone to kill you in your sleep. If this was an attack, it was directed at the poor tavernkeeper or his business partners, not at us.&quot;<br /> <br /> She watched the edges of the crowd as the others began to gather together once more. &quot;Still, Master, I think we should take this as a warning. There are definitely powers which would take lethal action to prevent the venture we're trying to put together here. The Realm has retreated, but surely there are still those loyal to the Scarlet Empire in the region. The Guild has plans for this city, and a dozen merchant princes besides myself will be making plays for a cut of the profit that might be made here, and where our plans conflict we will try to undercut one another. And there's always Thorns. We should make every effort to either move quietly or move quickly.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T00:49:21-08:00","id":374987,"title":"","content":"&quot;.....I stopped it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Talos stares wide eyed at the fallen Yeddim for a long while. He then holsters the flame piece with a grin, turning around to pull his spear out from the ground, &quot;I might be better at being a hero than I thought.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>CRASH</b><br /> <br /> The former merchant prince winces, then slowly turns around to see the fallen tree having flattened the Sailor's Grotto. His face falls in disappointment, &quot;Well.....so much for the best shot I've ever made....&quot; Talos jumped as he heard Nauel approaching, quickly turning around to face the stranger.<br /> <br /> &quot;I.....I was just trying to stop that creature from hurting people,&quot; He says to the Lunar, tipping his hat towards him, &quot;I am Talos Cauthon, Gui-&quot; He pauses, thinking back to a title given to him by Swimming Owl, &quot;I'm Talos Cauthon, Scavenger Prince from Nexus.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T11:55:05-08:00","id":375432,"title":"","content":"Just before the figure disappears, The Servant hears a quick reply, &quot;Not my problem. T'was meant to happen.&quot;<br /> Out of the corner of his eye a nearly imperceptible movement is made and Nahuel notices the figure running through the forest directly north. <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Roll wits+ survival to track the figure (Nahuel only)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Back in the city however, the crowd continues to follow Flynn instead of entertaining themselves. &quot;Play light upon the elements next!&quot; &quot;No, no, no! Play a walk upon a daystar's morning! That is a better dancing song!&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T12:11:27-08:00","id":375450,"title":"","content":"&quot;Funny, my father told me, <i>never ascribe to malice what can be adequately explained by stupidity.</i> It is quite possible <i>someone</i> thought this was a good plan and botched it terribly. Or, more distressingly, that could have been a distraction. It has already revealed certain prominent characters. Still, I think your recommendation is the correction one. Personally, I would prefer swiftness. However, if subtlety preserves the lives and livelihoods of the innocent there is no other choice.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T14:43:59-08:00","id":375601,"title":"","content":"The crowd continues to be very merry. Most are still ignoring the fact that a large tree just destroyed the bar. A couple people even manages to salvage a couple of undestroyed barrels. They pass alcohol around to Flynn and the others in the area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T14:49:11-08:00","id":375602,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ironic lack of foresight for a Sidereal&quot; was the term used on his last yearly review and the situation Flynn has found himself in was living up to that. Flynn could play all day, but it was hot and his mouth was getting dry. His headband was soaked in sweat even though he hadn't been outside for long.<br /> <br /> Flynn started to put his flute up to his lips when he noticed someone at the foot of the crate. The man reach up with a wine skin and said &quot;You looked thirsty&quot;. Flynn took the skin and uncorked it. Wine had never smelt so wonderful. He took a couple of large mouthfuls and began to hand the skin back to the man.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keep it,&quot; the man said. \u201cThere is plenty more where that came from.\u201d He pointed at the wreckage of the tavern.<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you kindly, sir!&quot; Flynn said back. Sailor\u2019s Grotto was a good place and would be missed. Especially its cheap liquor prices. Taking a few more gulps of wine, he notice that the crowd was growing impatient with the delay in entertainment.<br /> <br /> <i>Hmmm.... They wanted to dance? </i> He set the skin down on the crate next to him and began the first notes of &quot;A Walk upon a Daystar's Morning&quot; Perhaps he could tired them out.<br /> <br /> Flynn knew Swimming Owl wasn't going to be happy with him about the wine, but really, the few sips he had were barely enough to get him tipsy. He wasn\u2019t planning on drinking the whole skin. Anyways, she was busy with the other exalted and probably wouldn't notice him drinking.<br /> <br /> [OOC]<br /> Forgot the roll for performance to tire out the crowd with dancing music.<br /> <br /> Charisma 3 + Performance 5 = 8 Dice (7 Successes) <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=6G7DY4J6\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=6G7DY4J6</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-19-2015, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T19:04:02-08:00","id":375773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=375432#post375432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of the corner of his eye a nearly imperceptible movement is made and Nahuel notices the figure running through the forest directly north.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Roll wits+ survival to track the figure (Nahuel only)</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4084/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4084/view</a><br /> 2 success, and add one more with the 2nd Excellency... probably not enough.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;Well met, Talos Cauthon. I am Nahuel. That was a well-aimed shot, even if your weapon was strange. I have met one of your countrywomen, and some other unusual people. They are wiser than I, and perhaps we can decide what to make of these happenings.&quot;<br /> <br /> He gestures for Talos to follow him, and heads for the ruins of the tavern, nodding at Servant as he goes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T20:01:48-08:00","id":375792,"title":"","content":"&quot;Strange weapon?&quot; Talos frowns, looking at the flame piece in his hand, &quot;You can get one from most weaponsmiths in Nexus....&quot;<br /> <br /> He follows the Lunar to the ruins to rejoin the others. However, he walks right by and heads towards the yeddim's corpse.<br /> <br /> &quot;I doubt whoever sent this beast stampeding did much to hide his tracks.&quot; Talos says he walks by, &quot;As subtle as this assassination attempt was.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stops in front of the beast, shutting out all distractions as he walked by the yeddim, taking in every detail he could. The head wound from his flame piece, the dust in it's fur, the random rocks and bits of junk in the ground where it fell. All of it could be important. He knelt down at the creature's head, looking at the beast's mouth to see if it was domesticated or wild.<br /> <br /> (OOC: Investigation roll ahoy!! I'm gonna use 4 motes to activate my Investigation Excellency to gain 2 automatic successes. Also, that was an attempt at a stunt. Up to the ST if it worked<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4754092/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4754092/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4754092/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4754092/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Geez.....good thing I used the Excellency.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T22:40:13-08:00","id":375905,"title":"","content":"&quot;I cannot imagine what this Nexus place is like. It seems that everything I have never heard of comes from there,&quot; Nahuel says with just a touch of exasperation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T23:06:26-08:00","id":375911,"title":"","content":"Talos notices that was a wild Yeddim, but that it came from somewhere outside of this area. He cannot find any hints on where it originally came from however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T15:33:49-08:00","id":376654,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>Meant to happen my wrinkly ass. </i>Just as he was about to retort the figure vanished before his eyes. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><i>Oh for the love of Luna was that another sidereal? It must be, who else could be so flippant about the destruction they wreck . I mean if you nearly destroyed all of creation whats another building. My master was right, there are thousands of the little buggers always watching, making sure there dastardly planes in the name of \u201cFate\u201d. Everywhere I turn there are more of the vermin.</i> His face slumped in to a tired expression of resignation. <i>I am getting to old for this. Nothing he could do now, might as well head back and see what his new allies had to say on this matter.</i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Hanging close to </span>Nahuel he kept his mind to himself preferring these others to speculate for him.<i> Nahuel while clearly a savage had true and proper values held only those who had lived a difficult life. Nahuel, this is a man capable of true </i><i>comradery</i><i><i>.</i></i><br /> <br /> \u201cNexus, master Nahule, is one of the largest cities in creation. It retains some of the waning splendor left to be had. Most importantly it serves as the headquarters of The Guild, as far as something as diffuse as The Guild has a headquarters. One could destroy the whole of Nexus and The Guild would go on. There is no cutting off the head of that snake.\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T16:23:10-08:00","id":376704,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Guild is less an organization than an idea. Much like the language we speak it is a construct which exists nowhere in a pure form. Put another way, there is not one guild but many that have all agreed to use the same name to describe themselves. Each merchant prince is master of their own organization and it is the will of his or her peers rather than the mandates of Nexus that decide how business will be carried out.<br /> <br /> It could not be otherwise. A system of sorcerous communication sufficient to keep all major figures in touch would be ruinously expensive without a massive change in the availability of enlightenment, artifacts, or incentives for sorcerers. Even if it exists, there is no structure in place to enforce the will of the Guild in Nexus on the merchant princes. Ties besides force would be necessary and none of the leaders see the gain in giving up power and independence for the minimal benefits that greater unity would provide at this time.<br /> <br /> For the time being we shall have to hold to Neillzi's truism that 'all politics is local'. This applies even to the Realm and Thorns who cannot effectively project power all the way here.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 01-20-2015, 08:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T20:20:01-08:00","id":376882,"title":"","content":"Nahuel looks at the two, clearly having followed almost none of their explanation. &quot;So... the word 'guild' does not mean 'slave taker?' And a city is a very large village, even bigger than this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T21:20:21-08:00","id":376899,"title":"","content":"<i>Ah, Apparently I have to dumb down my speech further for the man in the loin cloth.</i> \u201cThe Guild does take slaves. It is the worst thing they do. Many of the slavers live in Nexus, but their will always be more. Nexus makes this village look like a lone hut. Killing slave takers feels good, but it does not stop.\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T21:32:07-08:00","id":376902,"title":"","content":"&quot;A guild is like a tribe you chose to join, where everyone does the same thing and everyone is supposed to help each other. It doesn't always work out that way. The Guild,&quot; he emphasized the article, &quot;is a guild where the thing they all do is make money and the help they give to each other is preventing anyone else from making money. They also fight against each other, when one believes he will make more money if he does so. They do not care about other people except to consider how they might make money from them.&quot;<br /> <br /> At the mention of cities Splendor looked around with a disappointed look in his eyes. &quot;A city is not a large village, though that is where many of them come from. A city happens when a place becomes a person. Though it never speaks with words it has its moods and hopes and feelings. A city is the monument people build to their dreams and to their failure to achieve those dreams. A city is where all the secret desires people hoard in their hearts are spilled out into the world to be exposed to shame and honor. A city is ignorance that must be left to gain enlightenment and the destination where enlightenment is attained.<br /> <br /> A true city is all these things and none, for each is the model that all cities emulate or diverge from, and each informs all others. A city is great because other cities are squalid, a city is happy because others are miserable, a city is beautiful because others are ugly. You can enter the large collection of buildings and not see the city, yet it is there.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T21:33:59-08:00","id":376903,"title":"","content":"&quot;I... think I see. Forgive me, many of the things that must seem commonplace to you, are new and strange to me. Until half a moon ago, I had never set foot outside of the jungles that my tribe called home. The first people other than ourselves and our neighbors that I had seen were men of the Guild, who tried to take all the survivors of my people as slaves as we fled from an even greater threat. I have seen more people, and more different kinds of people, in this town, in this morning, than in all my life, and I am only just beginning to realize how ignorant of the world I really am.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T23:23:00-08:00","id":376997,"title":"","content":"&quot;Trust me, friend.&quot; Talos says to the Servant as he leaves the yeddim and rejoins the group, &quot;There are much worse things the Guild does than simple slavery. Trust me, I've seen it.&quot;<br /> <br /> He gestures back to the dead beast, &quot;The yeddim wasn't a tamed, but that doesn't really tell me much. However, if you think the Guild is behind this I'm afraid this might be my fault. I have......a bad history with the Guild and they may have put a price on my head.&quot; He sighs, looking over the ruins of the inn, &quot;I didn't think they would catch up to me so fast, but it seems that my carelessness may have cost someone his livelihood. Perhaps it's best if I returned to my safehouse.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T07:08:36-08:00","id":377186,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hm.&quot; Swimming Owl was smiling at Splendor's description of what it meant to be a city. &quot;If there's a price on your head, sir, I'm not aware of it...but then, as Master Splendor explained, we Guildsmen are not always of one mind, nor can we communicate cheaply over long distances. Best to keep wary. Is your safehouse nearby? I am looking for a safe place to keep these gentlemen to keep them from getting assassinated until such time as they can make me rich.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T19:56:31-08:00","id":377742,"title":"","content":"Once it's explained to him what the phrase &quot;price on head&quot; means, Nahuel nods thoughtfully. &quot;Now that you mention it, some of the Guild may wish to see me dead as well. At least one of the group that tried to enslave my village escaped. So yes, let us go. While I fear no enemy, I would very much like to not die until after I have learned just why I was sent to aid someone else in the Guild.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T22:08:25-08:00","id":377799,"title":"","content":"&quot;All trouble with the Guild I am beginning to feel left out. The only significant experience I have with them is our own Swimming Owl.&quot; Splendor did not elaborate further as he followed to the safehouse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T22:39:42-08:00","id":377840,"title":"","content":"&quot;My safehouse is actually a few miles to the south,&quot; Talos Cauthon points his spear towards the thick forests, &quot;It's a bit of a walk, but we can probably get there before sunset if we leave now.&quot; He heads down the road, using his orichalcum spear as a walking staff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T22:48:21-08:00","id":377843,"title":"","content":"&quot;The advantages of having an overarching structure to which your business belongs are many. Guild merchants can offer each other better deals, we have easy access to investors and business partners for new ventures, membership carries with a certain respectability and knowledge that your credit is good when dealing with others, and the Guild pays protection money to a number of pirates, bandits, and criminal organizations in order to protect its merchants from predation. The downside, of course, is that honest blacksmiths and accountants and mercenaries and craftsmen and prostitutes and sailors and artists and middlemen get tarred with the same brush as the merchants who spend their time selling opium or slaves or trading with the Fair Ones.&quot;<br /> <br /> Swiming Owl sighed.<br /> <br /> &quot;I can see it's going to be a problem with this group. But the evils of the Guild are not something you can fight from the outside, gentlemen. It is not a nation that can be conquered or a tyrant that can be slain. The only way to fix the problems with the Guild are to prove that some other option is more profitable than the evils they engage in. Our code is simple and pure. If we can build a world where the slave trade ceases to be a profitable business venture, then the Guild will stop trading slaves. Same goes for drugs, or bartering with demons, or any of the other high-risk high-reward ventures of dubious morality that certain merchants engage in. One of the things I'm hoping to get you gentlemen to do is start changing the world. I intend to take full advantage of that change to get rich in the process, but it would be nice to do some good and get rich at the same time.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T21:11:50-08:00","id":378708,"title":"","content":"&quot;I had thought to simply kill every last one of them, but if you are right, it seems that will not be possible. How am I to change a world that I barely knew existed a handful of days ago?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T22:07:00-08:00","id":378730,"title":"","content":"Flynn finished the song and put his flute down. Picking up the wine skin, he uncorked it and took a few gulps. He was just getting warmed up. With the wine, he could play all night. The crowd was at his command. It had been months since he played for such a responsive gathering.<br /> <br /> The crowd seemed to be tired from all the dancing and was using the break in music to salvage some more beer and wine from the destroyed tavern. He saw Swimming Owl and the others talking in a group. The blue haired man from the Sailor\u2019s Grotto was among them. He pointed with his spear towards the woods. With the group ignoring Flynn for the moment, he drank some more wine and considered his next action.<br /> <br /> Information is what they needed now. And playing for this crowd wasn\u2019t going to give him that. It would be better to go out on the town and talk to people. Flynn has a basic understanding of the political situation between the Guild and the Thousand Rivers Court, but they needed more. Names, Alliances, Dirty Secrets. There were enough bars and taverns in Puyo to find such things out.<br /> <br /> <i>I need to know if you got my back. Do you have my back?</i> Swimming Owl\u2019s words came back to haunt him. Going out on his own without his full mission briefing was stupid. He could be wasting his time if he went off on his own.<br /> <br /> Lifting up the wine skin, Flynn realized that it was already empty. How had he drank a whole wine skin so fast? He shook it mournfully and threw it aside. The crowd was scattering and heading into the various drinking establishments on the street. Every bone in Flynn\u2019s body told him to follow them. He even had a good reason. It didn't matter how drunk he was, if he came back with information.<br /> <br /> The group of exalts turned towards the forested road and began walking. \u201cShit, where the fuck are the going?\u201d If he didn\u2019t follow them now, he would lose them. He ignored the siren call of the bar and followed the group.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Temperance Roll to avoid bar hopping - 1 dice (0 successes with critical failure) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=MQG7QMHF\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=MQG7QMHF</a><br /> <br /> Spend 1 Willpower to stay with the group<br /> <br /> Limit Roll - Compassion 4 (3 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=CA7HV9RC\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=CA7HV9RC</a><br /> <br /> Flynn has spent:<br /> 2 Willpower<br /> 11 Motes of Personal Essence<br /> <br /> And Gained:<br /> 3 Points of Limit<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-23-2015, 01:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T06:21:09-08:00","id":378962,"title":"","content":"&quot;Patiently, Nahuel. You will have more than a few days to learn.&quot; Owl chuckled. &quot;And don't feel bad: nobody knows everything, and few travel far outside their homelands in this day and age. Most people I've met get their news of distant lands from the traveling caravans, if they get any news at all. If the Guild hasn't had any success with your people, it's not surprising you don't know much of the rest of the world. Who would have taught you? You cannot be blamed for not reading a book no one ever gave you...please tell me you know what books are?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T16:16:06-08:00","id":379596,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, I know what a book is. Sorath showed me one while I was getting tattooed.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T16:28:45-08:00","id":379603,"title":"","content":"Flynn manages to catch up with the rest of the group. He keeps a slight distance between himself and the others, so they would not notice the smell of alcohol on his breath. With years of practice, he is able to walk without a stagger.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, what did I miss?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Performance Roll for Acting Sober - Manipulation 5 + Performance 5 - Drunk 1 = 9 Dice (4 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBMEUKN\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBMEUKN</a><br /> <br /> Resistance Roll for Alcohol - Stamina 2 + Resistance 0 = 2 Dice (0 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3EBE63A3\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3EBE63A3</a><br /> <br /> Flynn takes one point of bashing. <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-23-2015, 07:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T06:11:30-08:00","id":380061,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not much, Flynn.&quot; Owl gave him an appraising glance. &quot;Discussions of economics and literature, nothing of any major import. But apparently Talos Cauthon is willing to host our little gathering for the night.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC: <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=VRVFFCGC\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes on my &quot;Notice Flynn is drunk&quot; roll</a>. As we tied, and I was working under the assumption it'd work the same as seeing through a disguise at a glance, I will assume I lost the tie and Flynn's tipsiness goes unnoticed. Ware ye, lest we speak longer, and Owl has a few minutes of conversation in which to make Investigation rolls!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T07:01:38-08:00","id":380077,"title":"","content":"&quot;Discussions of economics and literature? A bit of a dry topic of conversation after the excitement we just had. But don't let me interrupt your conversation. Please continue!&quot; Flynn, with slow and deliberate motions, carefully rolls his flute up in its wrappings and puts it away in his bag. <br /> <br /> [OCC] Ha! At the tea house Flynn said that he would be in a better mood if he were drinking. And now he seems to be in a better mood. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T08:29:12-08:00","id":382007,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh not dry at all, when it gives those of us with the privilege of education and good upbringing to remind ourselves how significant those accidents of birth can be. After all, how else are we to be certain that the, at times unwanted, reforms we mean to make to the modes of society are truly good? Without the smug but dignified sense of superiority this might almost appear to be rank paternalism toward those who are our moral equals as members of the community of mankind with a theoretically equal share in shaping the definition of what it means to be human.&quot;<br /> <br /> He drew in a breath, and thought he smelled alcohol.<br /> <br /> &quot;Forgive me, I find I chastise myself fairly frequently in recent... days.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Notice Flynn is drunk roll: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759950/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4759950/</a><br /> <br /> 4 successes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T09:07:18-08:00","id":382053,"title":"","content":"\u201cDo not forget there are two meanings to the word \u2018Fortune\u2019. One means \u2018Great Wealth\u2019, the other, \u2018chance or luck\u2019. You have, by chance and luck, have had a great wealth of opportunities. \u201c Flynn pauses for a moment, having lost his train of thought. <br /> <br /> Flynn face fills with regret and he continues. \u201cYou shouldn\u2019t chastise yourself for what luck has given you. Unless you waste your opportunities. But I doubt that you are the type that would.\u201d He fiddles nervously with his Sanxian case strap, trying to settle the instrument in a more comfortable position. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T08:58:22-08:00","id":383170,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good advice, Flynn. You should take it to heart.&quot; Swimming Owl smiled gently. &quot;You wouldn't blame someone born sickly or someone who grew up in poverty for their ill fortune, Master. The coin has two sides...forgive me, Talos Cauthon, but do you have anything to eat? I'm afraid I've had plenty of tea today, but not much else.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T12:21:34-08:00","id":383422,"title":"","content":"It was a small thing, a <i>very</i> small thing, but helping someone, anyone, right now felt very appealing.<br /> <br /> With a craftsmen's eye he looked at the wild plants growing by the side of the road, noticing the brown stalks where the tiny seeds could be found. One of those he plucked, rubbing his fingers over it and looking at the tiny grains that settled in his palm.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you don't mind grass, I will see what I can do.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without another word he kept walking, though now he ran he hand along the tops of the grasses and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fF53Bt-XPio\" target=\"_blank\">singing softly to himself</a>.<br /> <br /> A light breeze picked up and bent the foliage, shaking a few seeds loose and flinging tiny drops of nectar as they sprang back up. Yet they continued to sway, far more strongly than the wind should have caused them to, until pale, rippling waves seemed to flow down the stalks. Tiny flashes of sunlight on dew began to accompany the rushing grain, bursting each seed with a fleeting beam of focused light.<br /> <br /> A few minutes of this passed, and Splendor finished his song. Where he finished, by the side of the road on a cushion of clover, was a goodly sized loaf of bread; just big enough to share.<br /> <br /> &quot;I hope it turned out all right, I have never done that before.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Activating CNNT for 7 personal motes and 1 wp to make this loaf of semi-sweet bread<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4760969/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4760969/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4760969/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4760969/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 6 successes<br /> <br /> Assuming a single loaf of bread is resources - or 1 it is exceptional bread.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T14:02:57-08:00","id":383559,"title":"","content":"Noone seems to be able to tell that Flynn is drunk. He may seem just a bit happy due to the parade that was until just a few moments ago following him around.<br /> <br /> The smell of quite delicious bread fills the small area around each of you. It just seems way too appetizing to leave there for any longer.<br /> <br /> In the background, many people are continuing to celebrate and drink. It appears that yet another guildsman has come with a cart of alcohol and is selling his wares almost instantly. Many stalls are clearing out and the business district seems to be quite a bit less busy than before. It appears that many craftsman are having trouble selling their wares, while others are making a BIG profit off of many drunk patrons. Everyone seems to have forgotten about the mini-earthquakes that had been happening and for some bizarre reason have not even gone to investigate the fallen tree. (I guess celebrating too much can do that.)<br /> <br /> A moment later, a shout of &quot;She's here! She's here!&quot; echoes around the area. A small group has started to gather to look at &quot;her&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> That stunt was worth a two-die stunt Exthalion; please mark 1 extra experience for this story session. You of course can also get the normal mote or WP recovery. (That was a good song btw)<br /> <br /> Noone has truly noticed that Flynn is drunk, but are still a bit suspicious. You may make an inv+perception roll or a social+manip roll to look further into it if you wish. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T14:18:47-08:00","id":383580,"title":"","content":"&quot;She who?&quot; Flynn wanders over to the crowd that is forming.<br /> <br /> [OOC] Totally should have made Flynn's instrument a straight up guitar instead of the Sanxian in the book. Most of the Sanxian songs that have lyrics are in Chinese","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T14:48:32-08:00","id":383614,"title":"","content":"A nearby man looks shocked at you. &quot;Why Anita Fairhand of course! She is such a looker! I would get with her nice and quick if I could.&quot; The man looks you over really quick. &quot;You don't have a chance either... so don't even THINK about it!&quot; the man says as he gives out a little puff. &quot;You don't even know who she is anyway. You'll just have to look from afar.&quot; He points to a pile of boxes. &quot;We can probably see her from up there.&quot; The man then walks off to climb the boxes, pulling a couple people down so he can get up himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T15:09:10-08:00","id":383634,"title":"","content":"Flynn looks at the man with a confused look- he didn't think he was that bad looking. <i>Probably could use a shave,</i> Flynn thought, running his hand over his stubble. He scrambles awkwardly up one of the crates, next to the man.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> [OOC] Dex 3 + Athletics 0 - Drunk 1 = 2 Dice (2 Successes) <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=DJGCAM27\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=DJGCAM27</a><br /> <br /> Flynn is Appearance 3. If he wasn't an alcoholic and actually cared about his appearance, he'd be appearance four. (Something I plan on spending XP on when he gets his drinking better under control.)[/OCC]<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-29-2015, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T15:34:53-08:00","id":383672,"title":"","content":"Flynn successfully climbs up the pile of boxes to see a very tall woman with light brown hair. Her hair seemed to float to the side as if it was being blown back among an eternal never-ending breeze. When the light of the daystar shined brightly upon her hair, it looked like a golden brown crown appeared from her hair. Even from a distance, you can tell that her skin was very smooth and had no visible imperfections. <br /> <br /> From his viewpoint, Flynn could only see the left half of her face from behind, but he could tell that it was perfectly proportioned (according to the perception of many men in the town anyway). As she made a quick glance behind her, Flynn could see her intense, blue eyes that seemed to radiate with their own light.<br /> <br /> She donned some of the finest looking plate armor underneath a jacket that seemed like it was made out of many silken scarves woven together. She also had a beautiful bangle on her left wrist that seemed to have a ruby and an emerald embedded in it.<br /> <br /> As she passed into the courthouse, the crowd's gaze followed her until they had to stop. She didn't seem to be bothered by the fact. In fact, she seemed like she was contemplating something major as she looked upon the crowd herself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T15:45:37-08:00","id":383699,"title":"","content":"&quot;So...who is she?&quot; Flynn asks the man next to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T17:14:46-08:00","id":383831,"title":"","content":"&quot;I was wondering that as well... she is lovely, and dressed as a warrior; she is someone important?&quot; Nahuel is glad, for once, to not be the only one who doesn't know something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T17:25:04-08:00","id":383836,"title":"","content":"[OCC] Actually, Flynn the Musician might not know who she is, but does Flynn the Sidereal? Do I roll Lore, Bureaucracy?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T23:08:39-08:00","id":384009,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course she is important! Are you new to the east? Where do you hail from?&quot; The man continues to look at her until the doors close and then turns to you.<br /> <br /> &quot;She is Anita Fairhand. She is one of the highest in the court. She is a kind, beautiful, and strong woman. I doubt any in this town could surpass her. I've heard she is leading the talks about whether or not we should become a part of the thousand rivers alliance and have one of their courts here. I've also heard that the guild has been making some deals with the counselors. I think it could bring some good money into the town. I think we should have both, but the word is that there has been a conflict of interest.&quot; The man looks a bit proud having used some of the higher-ups 'lingo'.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Flynn the sidereal would have heard of her, but she was not of major importance in the whole of creation. Roll int+lore to try and remember more about her.<br /> Also, please try to keep OOC chat in the OOC thread if it is not also posted with some IC stuff. I don't mind a [OOC] talk if it is with a [IC] plan, but I don't want to clutter it too much with [ooc] stuff. Thanks! </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T00:50:51-08:00","id":384044,"title":"","content":"&quot;Powerful, clever and gorgeous.&quot; Talos says as he leans against the crate Flynn was standing on. &quot;No wonder the Guild wants to get their claws on her, she's everything they could desire in an underling.&quot; He smirks, watching her pass by and enter the courthouse. &quot;I suppose we could stay a while and look into this beautiful stranger.....Unless you think it's better that we head back to my home first?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T13:06:15-08:00","id":384456,"title":"","content":"Sighing, Flynn tells the man, &quot;Such a beautiful woman. Completely unattainable by brutes such as ourselves. &quot; <br /> <br /> Flynn steps down from the crate and puts an arm around both Talos and Nahual. &quot;It is too soon to turn in for the night. I vote we check it out.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Lore on Anita Fairhand - Int 3 + Lore 3 - Drunk 1 = 5 dice ( 2 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7NU4LBDC\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7NU4LBDC</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T15:19:41-08:00","id":384540,"title":"","content":"Flynn seems to recall something about Anita Fairhand being a goddess that stays in the town helping to govern it. It seems most of the citizens do not know she is a goddess. He seems to remember something about a temple that is devoted to her father being in the city. All the other details seem pretty fuzzy right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T21:40:07-08:00","id":384811,"title":"","content":"&quot;Unattainable? That sounds almost like a challenge,&quot; Nahuel says with a half-smile. &quot;Yes, let us stay a while; judging by what I saw, the attack, if it was an attack, was not aimed at us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T07:44:16-08:00","id":385022,"title":"","content":"Slowly, very slowly, Swimming Owl sighed and gently lowered her face into her palm. &quot;As our resident Guildswoman, I think I'm just going to take that comment as a compliment, Talos Cauthon.&quot;<br /> <br /> She tore off a small hunk of the bread that Splendor had made, absentmindedly popping it into her mouth...then widened her eyes slightly in surprise. &quot;Thif if goob!&quot;<br /> <br /> She swallowed.<br /> <br /> &quot;As delightful as I'm sure making Anita Fairhand's acquaintance would be...she is one of the three major power players in the area, not counting yourselves. If you gentlemen intend to cooperate to further each others' interests in the region, it would be wise to first get to know one another and...well, agree on what those interests are. An audience with Anita Fairhand is likely to turn into a political planning session, and if you're not all on the same page going in she'll try to split you up and ally with some of you and not others, to reduce your potential impact on her worshippers and the potential threat you pose.<br /> <br /> Also, it's not like she's <i>that</i> pretty.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T08:28:26-08:00","id":385065,"title":"","content":"Flynn burst out laughing at Nahuel's comment. &quot;A challenge? You, my friend, know nothing of woman, especially powerful and beautiful women. Anyways, it's never a good idea to mix business and pleasure.&quot; <i>Mostly because you'll fuck it up, </i>Flynn thought.<br /> <br /> In Flynn's experience, beautiful women end up being more trouble...and work... then they were worth. He was hoping that this mission wouldn't require the stereotypical services of a Chosen of Venus.<br /> <br /> Still, he couldn't resist needling Swimming Owl a bit. &quot;Oh? Is that envy I hear in your voice, Swimming Owl? Such a shame that there is a woman in town that turns more heads than you do. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Edited to remove the idea that Joybringers mostly do seduction mission. They are a more diverse lot than that. 01-29-2015, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T09:12:30-08:00","id":385132,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do we have an estimate on how long these negotiations are going to take? We are attempting to tinker with an operating mechanism and conditions could change so that our plans are no longer appropriate if we take to long to make those plans.<br /> <br /> As much as I would like to deliver a <i>fait accompli</i> and cut through it all, I doubt we are in a position to do so or that it would endear us much to the current powers.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 01-29-2015, 01:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T21:42:12-08:00","id":385829,"title":"","content":"&quot;I may not know much of the world outside the jungle, but women are something I am quite familiar with,&quot; Nahuel says with a small grin. &quot;In matters of love, how different can they be? Perhaps you just do not know what it is like to be a good-looking man.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you all insist, though, I will wait until we have a plan of what else needs to be done.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T14:59:05-08:00","id":387659,"title":"","content":"<i>Maidens, I must really look like shit,</i> Flynn thought. He shook his head and then he looked puzzled. &quot;One of three? Who are the other two power players in the area?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Lore Roll for Info on other Puyo Powers - Int 3 + Lore 3 - Drunk 1 = 5 Dice (4 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=HNPJDPHH\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=HNPJDPHH</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-01-2015, 10:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T03:53:15-08:00","id":388281,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's not envy.&quot; Swimming Owl grumbled. &quot;She's a goddess. That's <i>cheating,</i> is what that is. Never grows old so she doesn't have to worry about wrinkle lines, subsists on prayer so she always maintains her figure without any effort, she's a creature of essence so she doesn't have to exercise to keep her muscles firm...it's like being jealous of a mountain or a sunset for being beautiful, there's no point to it. I just wish they wouldn't shape themselves like people, y'know? Couldn't she be a twelve-foot high statue of burnished gold and crystal with flame for eyes and some wings or something, maybe wear some antlers like a <i>proper</i> deity?&quot;<br /> <br /> She sighed.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyway, our major players in the area? Anita Fairhand there has a strong pull in the local court, which also includes Mahish Salar<i>, </i>Locke Varis, The Hand of Faith, and Fairman Naysayer. There's also Blackhawk. Not a member of local government, but he's got a lot of resources: he's managing the Guild's interest in the region, trying to turn the place into a client state...a profitable plan, but more for him than for me, and definitely something a lot of other people, including you lot I suspect, would have problems with. There's also the Lady of the Gray River, she's got a lot of influence in the city. There's a small temple here with a couple of priests who I've heard have some clout with the common people, and once you get out of town the local harvest god gets more and more popular as you head out into farmland.&quot;<br /> <br /> She thought for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;With the Realm gone, I'd expect worship of the local gods to get more and more overt over time, and they willl a'll probably be interested in setting up a more direct form of control over their followers without the Immaculates as a threat. The Harvest god's probably not a bad guy to get in with, now that I think about it-the city relies on his good graces, even if they don't think about it too much yet, and he's probably gonna be a serious up-and-comer. Might be good to get in on the ground floor, like with you guys...hm. Speaking of hungry gods looking for an opportunity to make the big time, there's also a dark horse in the race. My sources,&quot; and here she glanced at Flynn, &quot;think there's another god active in the area, but they have no idea <i>who </i>they are or what their name is, just that they're starting to become active in the region...oh! Also there's a rumor the Mask of Winters might be looking to expand his influence Southwest in this direction. With the Realm withdrawing, it's a much easier target than heading North and having to tangle with the Confederation of Rivers.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T10:01:41-08:00","id":388562,"title":"","content":"&quot;The gods might make their own complaints about us. They stand forever on the precipice of infinite time. What is valor to they who do not fear injury or ending? What is sacrifice to those who need nothing and have forever to make good their loss? Where is the want of propriety to those who must endure each other forever? They have no need of honor, for men alone die so that only in story and song might they continue to exist. The gods suffer no impermanent attachment that they do not chose, never fearing parent, peer, or progeny should be taken from them.<br /> <br /> It nobility of a god is a rare thing and hard kept. They do not build monuments to endure or raise wonders to shake the earth or increase as a people in prowess or art. Their's are the cycles of deep time, until they can love the blossom for its fleetingness no longer because of the uncountable multitude of flowerings and fadings that lay before and behind on the shores of the river of time.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T10:47:58-08:00","id":388607,"title":"","content":"<i>Shit, was that a meaningful glance? I think that was a meaningful glance. Am I suppose to be the source of this information? Oh! Maybe that is her mission. Find out who this god is? Or maybe I am over thinking the whole fucking thing.</i> Flynn considers his options as Splendor blathers on about the honor of gods. This conversation was getting a bit too difficult for his drunken mind to follow.<br /> <br /> &quot;As much as I enjoy discussing the folly of the gods, we need to figure what our next step is. We going to hit the town and look for more information? Head to Talos' home and come up with a plan of action?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T00:30:45-08:00","id":391129,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perhaps we can do both, friend.&quot; Talos says to Flynn, &quot;My home is only about an hour's walk from here. We could easily head there, discuss our plans, enjoy some wine and then come back later tonight to find out more about this small town's situation. Perhaps sit down and chat with the only sunset I've considered making love to.&quot; He smirks at Swimming Owl with that last comment.<br /> <br /> &quot;Either way, it's pretty obvious that none of us like the Guild and want to see it brought down, or at least changed for the better. However, judging by how Swimming Owl is well versed in politics, I myself am skilled in building things and Nahuel is a born warrior, it seems we all have a different way of going about doing that.&quot;<br /> <br /> He shrugs, &quot;My suggestion: we find out what we can about this town, meet back at my home, discuss what we've learned and our plans for dealing with the Guild over a nice dinner, then see how we can combine our efforts into a force even the Guild cannot stop.&quot;<br /> <br /> He leans against a nearby wall, &quot;If anyone has a better plan, I'm all ears.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T20:45:13-08:00","id":392226,"title":"","content":"Nahuel nods at the remark about having different methods; he's just learning how much he has to learn, but its' obvious that these people has has fallen among do not walk the same path. He shrugs at the request for a plan. &quot;I will follow your advice in this, until I know better what I have landed in. It would be good to see more of this strange town for myself, though I care not whether it is now or later.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T14:39:48-08:00","id":393052,"title":"","content":"The lure of more wine was too much for Flynn. &quot;Let us head to Talos's home and share information and make plans. Then we can come back and put those plans into action.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Though by the time Flynn gets there, he will be hung over and not want any more wine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T18:20:29-08:00","id":393285,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If you pass out, we can carry you. Nahuel doesn't abandon his comrades, even the weird ones. :P </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T06:27:23-08:00","id":393686,"title":"","content":"After trudging through the woods for a little under an hour past the dead body of the creature, you eventually reach a large plain. Off in the distance, you can see a small building. Surrounding the edge of the field, you notice a putrid looking and bubbling swamp that seems to create a semi-circle behind the enclosure.<br /> <br /> Inside the swamp, you notice a few large, gnarled alligators as well as some jungle cats wandering the edge of the forest. Off in the distance, you think you can see a few raptors as well.<br /> <br /> Even with all this wildlife, the are seems very calm and inviting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T07:00:15-08:00","id":393714,"title":"","content":"Flynn would never forget the first time he saw a tree in creation. The tree reached hundreds of feet into the sky and he couldn\u2019t even put his small child arms around its trunk. The freshly manicured trees of Yu-Shan paled in comparison. When his guardians came to take him back to the endless city of gods, he sobbed and begged them to let him stay. He wanted to live in this magical forest of giant trees forever. Now, as an adult, the magic had gone out of the forest. One tree was much like another and Flynn was tired of walking through this forest.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, forest gave way to plains and swamp. Flynn grew quiet as the group neared their destination. The spirited and energetic Flynn was gone and replaced with a sullen and unwell looking Flynn. Flynn sensed the change in the air.<br /> <br /> <i>A manse? Talos' home is a manse?</i> He thought. For a moment, Flynn was homesick for his own manse. But his home was in Yu-Shan and he was in Creation on a mission and he would not fuck this up.<br /> <br /> As the putrid smell of the swamp hit his nose, his stomach rebelled against all the abuse he had put it under that afternoon. Flynn began to spew coffee and wine into a patch of grass outside of the small building.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-05-2015, 10:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T21:44:05-08:00","id":394440,"title":"","content":"The sight of the forest and swamp brings an honest, peaceful smile to Nahuel's face, softening his harsh lines just a bit. This is... &quot;Almost like home.&quot;<br /> <br /> He starts when Flynn vomits, at first looking around for danger, then finding none, stares at the puking performer. &quot;What is wrong with him? Is there sickness here?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T22:24:10-08:00","id":394491,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of a sort. Much as the village we just left was dominated by the unpleasant smells of middens and cesspits so is this place filled with scents unfamiliar and uncomfortable to those not familiar with them.&quot;<br /> <br /> Splendor seemed nearly as uncomfortable as Flynn, though the clinging scent of incense in the fabric around him helped somewhat to alleviate the roiling in his stomach. Like the musician he was also unaccustomed to such places. The sheer apparent randomness of it almost more disconcerting than the odor. In Yu-Shan there was not a grain of sand but that some deity had willed it be there, in its exact form, that it glorify all around it and be glorified in turn. The celestial city was as much a work of sculpture as architecture. This... this was stinking mud and rotting plants and stagnant water.<br /> <br /> To try to cover some of his unease he said, &quot;Master Talos, I wonder: was the structure build to harness the essence of the swamp or was the swamp constructed to channel the energy of the forest.&quot;<br /> <br /> He really didn't care. The sight of Flynn's emesis was only strengthening his own nausea and the question served to distract him, somewhat, from his own trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-06-2015, 11:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T06:09:23-08:00","id":394719,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, no, no....I'm fine....Just drank too much coffee...&quot; Flynn croaks out before another bout of vomiting takes him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T15:27:12-08:00","id":395504,"title":"","content":"&quot;...coffee. Sure.&quot; Swimming Owl frowned, distracted by the unusual preponderance of large predators in the area. Alligators, multiple big cats, and claw striders, all within an hour's walk? Something smelled fishy here, and it wasn't just the swamp. She hadn't spotted an unusual preponderance of prey animals on the way here. Either there was some ubiquitous prey animal that bred in large numbers in the area, or something weird was up with local food chain. She made a mental note to send a missive to the Bureau of Nature on the matter...<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyway, I doubt you lot need to worry overmuch about sickness. I've never heard of one of the dreaded Anathema being taken down by anything so common as the flux.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T15:49:31-08:00","id":395528,"title":"","content":"&quot;That is true... friend Flynn, do you need help to get inside?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T16:16:14-08:00","id":395551,"title":"","content":"Flynn doesn't answer for a moment. He closes his eyes and waits for his stomach to settle. Taking a deep breath, he was about to reject the lunar's offer of help. <i>Wait, I'm suppose to be mortal. </i><br /> <br /> &quot;Do you have any water?&quot; Flynn asks. He wasn't looking forward to being man-handled by the lunar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-06-2015, 07:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T19:42:21-08:00","id":397083,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am afraid not. But do not worry, it is not the first time I have helped a sick comrade.&quot;<br /> <br /> Rather than picking Flynn up bodily, he shifts form into a great raptor-cat, and lets the sick man lean against him as they walk towards the building.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T23:41:04-08:00","id":398502,"title":"","content":"Talos calmly stepped away from Flynn's vomit looking around at the swamp. He took in the placement of the trees, the location of the squat structure compared to the rest of the swamp, the way the creatures, even the predators, didn't run from them or try to attack them. He remembered that he had found a similar small structure the night he had freed the slaves from the Guild caravan. That night, it had been his salvation from the Guild's wrath. Now, it was the back door to home.<br /> <br /> &quot;Everyone stay close, it's kind of easy to get lost in here.&quot; He steps into the small structure's entrance and leads the group down a spiral staircase. The hallway it opened up into didn't seem thousands of years old, in fact it seemed rather clean. Above them, numerous orichalcum clockwork gears spun in unison with each other. A few vertical ones spun to reveal crystals, which illuminated the hallway they now stood in. &quot;Follow me, and don't take any paths I don't. The hallways have a tendency to change.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 02-09-2015, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-09T12:34:02-08:00","id":399180,"title":"","content":"Flynn tried to ignore the spinning gears above him as they walked through the hallways of the manse. He was grateful to have Nahuel to lean against, if only to avoid getting lost in the maze of hallways. His stomach had managed to settle, but his head was pounding. Thinking wistfully of the bottle of willow bark powder in his bag, he hoped they would arrive to the end of their journey soon.<br /> <br /> <i>How did he find this place?</i> Unclaimed manses in Creation were rare. Perhaps it was hidden manse belonging to a previous incarnation. Well, he could always ask.<br /> <br /> \u201cTalos, how did you find this place?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-09-2015, 03:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T09:25:27-08:00","id":400448,"title":"","content":"&quot;I needed a place to hide, and I ran into this manse.&quot; Talos says, stopping where the hall forks into three paths. &quot;The Guild was too worried about getting lost to follow me, and I was too smart to get lost.&quot; As they wait at the fork, the gears above them start to part and another spiral staircase descends from the ceiling, opening up a new path. &quot;Alright, the dining room is right up here, I'll have something prepared.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T18:19:55-08:00","id":401190,"title":"","content":"Flynn gratefully drops his bag and plops down into the nearest chair. He rubs his face a bit to try to wake himself up. <br /> <br /> &quot;So, while dinner is getting ready, why don't we start discussing what our purpose is in Puyo.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T00:07:20-08:00","id":401531,"title":"","content":"<i>By all the little gods of The East I am tiered. </i>He had walk 50 miles before he even met his new companions and the adrenaline high had long worn off since he thought his master had found him leaving him drained. About as drained as one would expect a 85 year old man to be after such a strenuous day so at lest his actions fit his looks now.<br /> <br /> He had decided back at the market that it was best to become simply part of the scenery, watching and gathering more information of the persons he was now engaged with. <i>I need all the knowledge I can to persuade these men as they are not the type that iv so easily wound around my finger. </i>Not an easy task as Swimming Owl was being her typical slimy guild loving self poisoning the others with her views, alas he could not stop her as she back her with far more information then he has available and would win any open debate of the matter on the sheer practical utility of that information. The moral points aside. It is that same utility why I to must keep her company. <br /> <br /> He was stunned slightly at the splendor of this manes. He had now that his manes was weak in the grand scale of things but the amount of power this manes seemed to represent was beyond what he ever thought could be harnessed from the Dragon Lines. This bodes well. Finally, upon seeing an ornate seat at a far more ornate table he relaxed into chair closest to Flynn, preparing himself for the crucial discussion to come. A discussion that he could not afford the Guild's-women to dominate.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T13:50:54-08:00","id":402359,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, my purpose is to get really really rich. Preferably in a way that strengthens the local community and reinforces it in such a way that my investments are protected.&quot; Swimming Owl shrugged. &quot;But I'm sure we all have our own aims. I say we go around the table and tell each other what each of us is looking to accomplish in the area. Where our goals overlap, we work together. If our goals don't interlap but don't interfere with one another, an alliance still helps each of us because we have access to the resources of the others...and if our goals are at odds, we'll be able to get that problem out of the way now instead of finding out after we've sunk effort into the alliance.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T01:40:35-08:00","id":404277,"title":"","content":"The room they sit in has a long wooden table with mahogany chairs at the side, save for the gold-furnished wooden chair at the head of the table where Talos lounges languidly. As they all take their places, they take a chance to observe the room. The floor was made of a translucent glass, which revealed the hundreds of constantly turning orichalcum gears that seemed to make up the entirety of the manse. The same gears made up the walls, though only a few spots were covered by the translucent glass of the floor. The space between the high vaulted ceiling was also taken up by these gears, though it had a large one in the center containing numerous shining crystals that gave the room it's light. Those who sit still long enough notice the room constantly shifting ever so slowly, as if it were part of the huge machine that was the manse. As the room shifted, as did the passageways out of it. After some time the stairway they came up through was covered by a gear, only to reveal a new exit into a hallway. The whole thing gave the impression of being inside a gigantic pocketwatch.<br /> <br /> &quot;Personally, I'm not opposed to getting rich.&quot; Talos says as he hangs his hat on the side of his chair, picking up a goblet seemingly from nowhere. As he speaks, the group notices small clockwork automatons, no larger than a housecat, walking rigidly across the glass floor. They each carry a goblet, one for each of the characters. &quot;But most importantly, I wish to help people. All my life I've had great ideas of how I can assist the downtrodden, to make their miserable existence more bearable. Ways that most men would scoff at and deem impossible. Becoming a Chosen of the Unconquered Sun has shown me that not only are my ideas possible, but I have the power to do so.&quot; He takes a drink, &quot;This manse has a weaponsmith......that way!&quot; He points to a hallway that just opened up on the wall behind him, &quot;And another workshop designed to forge the five magic materials together to make wonders one can only imagine. If we can use them in any way, I'll gladly offer them to help our cause.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T12:46:41-08:00","id":406036,"title":"","content":"Flynn watched as the clockwork automaton walked across the table with the goblets. He could smell the wine from his seat at the end of the table. <i>The best way to cure a hangover is to drink more</i>, he thought to himself. But no, this has to stop. He just threw up in front of someone\u2019s manse. That is not what a Sidereal on a covert mission does. Flynn clenched his fist and began talking to distract himself from the wine.<br /> <br /> \u201cMy purpose frankly is rather selfish. I have not been gifted with the powers of the sun and moon. I am a musician. The only lasting impact I have on Creation is my music. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cWhen I heard that one of my dearest friends was declared Anathema, I tracked him down. It wasn\u2019t difficult. I knew him well. We practically grew up together. I wanted to see if the stories and songs were true. In hindsight, it was dangerous and stupid. I was very fortunate that Jericho was still Jericho, not some sun demon. \u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAs we traveled together, I began to realize what exactly it meant to be a Solar and why the Immaculate Order hunted them down. Jericho grew up on a horse ranch not far from here. He always had a close relationship with animals, horses especially. But after his exaltation, it was almost as if he could actually speak the horse\u2019s language.\u201d A bit of pride leaks into Flynn\u2019s tone. \u201cHe could ride a mount for hours without either him or the horse tiring. \u201c<br /> <br /> Flynn\u2019s voice starts to crack with emotion. \u201cHe couldn\u2019t out ride the Wyld Hunt though. They got him in the end. There was nothing I can do.\u201d <br /> <br /> \u201cYou and you,\u201d pointing at Splendor and Talos, \u201chave access to powers beyond what a Dragon Blood can even imagine. That is why they hunt you down. \u201c He turns to Nahuel, \u201cI\u2019m starting to believe that Lunars are the same.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI have heard talk about destroying the Guild Slave Trade. It is a noble goal, but I think you are going about it the wrong way. Jericho was never a destroyer. Everywhere we went, he mended relationships and made things better. That is what the sun gave him.\u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cI was traveling in the Realm Satrap as a child, I don\u2019t remember which one, and someone once showed me an old, old, old machine. The farmer said that it had the power to strip seeds from cotton. No one knew how it worked or what powered it. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you want to destroy the slave trade, you need to replace it with something else. Fovnag\u2019s ideal of mechanical servants is a good one, but I suggest going one step further. Instead of building mechanical slaves, build machines so you don\u2019t need slaves at all. \u201c<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Temperance Roll for what I assume is wine in the goblets -- No Critical Failures, but only one success. <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=MNEUDF7E\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=MNEUDF7E</a><br /> <br /> Flynn spends one will power to avoid drinking.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T15:07:31-08:00","id":406132,"title":"","content":"After this long winded speech, Flynn turns to Talos and asks, &quot;Do you have any water I can take my medicine with?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T21:18:01-08:00","id":406331,"title":"","content":"Splendor was the next to speak.<br /> <br /> &quot;I do not know any of you, not in the way I have known those I called friends or mentors. Nor do I trust you, in the sense that I am comfortable speaking about myself. Without any pride I can say that I understand portions of the threat we face better than anyone else here. In the face of that threat I am willing to speak, and in the hope that you will become friends with whom I can tell the whole of my story.&quot;<br /> <br /> He took a breath to steady himself before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;It is true that I am Chosen of the Sun, though I would have preferred to say as much in my own time and way.&quot; He cast an aside glance at Swimming Owl and Flynn. &quot;There is no point in hiding the fact now. Yet the Great Lights of Heaven and the Dragons of Creation are not the only who Exalt the children of men.&quot;<br /> <br /> With his hand he made a subtle sign so that with the twitch of a finger his hidden protector would come forth in might and wrath.<br /> <br /> &quot;Five Maidens there are in Heaven, in whose governance is the Fate of gods and men. Exalted, for they could not have been less, shining in their colors and bearing their marks as brands of caste slew my father in cold blood. I do not know if I was meant to die with him, but I fled and have kept ahead of them. For fear of these chosen I have held my power back, kept my guard ready, and attempted to learn all that I could. Now I see that this was a mistake.<br /> <br /> The Sun did not choose me to hide my light under a basket and whatever risk it is to me personally, Creation needs heroes. I do not know if I deserve that title, but I have been called to rise to it. I do not advocate throwing away all subtlety, but we must be aware that there are more powers in Heaven and Earth to reckon with than you have known. If we move too quickly, draw too much attention to ourselves, we must be ready for the consequences.&quot;<br /> <br /> When no one reached for weapons he relaxed a little, just a little. He was not sure that one of them would betray him as soon as they were out of sight but he had to trust someone. He couldn't change the world alone, and he would be damned if the only ones he relied on were bound demons.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Anyone who wants to roll Perception + Manipulation against difficulty 2 will learn that Splendor is keeping some fairly big things back.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T23:51:06-08:00","id":406418,"title":"","content":"&quot;That's three new kinds of Anathema I've heard of in as many years.&quot; Swimming Owl frowned. &quot;That's what you get when the Scarlet Throne's empty, I guess. When the cat's out of the house, the mice start coming out of the woodwork...but I think you're right, Master. If there are more power players out there looking for a piece of the pie, that just means we need to get our piece faster, before someone beats us to it. I can't speak for these...Maiden Anathema? But it's pretty obvious that you Solar Ana...you <i>Chosen of the Sun</i> are looking to grab a big slice. And the other new kind, the black ones, they work for the Mask of Winters, and he's definitely looking to forge an empire. Moving quickly is sounding like a better and better plan to me.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:32:02-08:00","id":406819,"title":"","content":"<i>Shit, Sidereals killed his father?</i> Flynn regretted Nahuel\u2019s early arrival lead to his unfinished mission briefing even more now. The situation, if possible, was more dangerous than he though.<br /> <br /> <i>Though, we do have a lot in common,</i> Flynn mused. Based on Splendor\u2019s accent, he grew up in Yu-Shan, like Flynn. Both have lost someone they loved to Sidereal blades and fists. <i>Hopefully, vengeance is not a top priority for him.</i><br /> <br /> \u201cI didn\u2019t realize that there were so many different types of Anathema. I agree we need to move quickly. But we need to decide what the goal is. Do we want to end the slave trade? Take over the Guild operations in the area? Power without a focus is a danger to those who would weld it.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Probably should include a dice roll for that big fat lie Flynn just told.<br /> <br /> And the Book of Errata made the Heart-Brightening Presentation Style much more awesome! I didn't have to spend Willpower for that last scene's preformance!<br /> <br /> Spending 4 motes of essences to active Flynn's Second Performance Excellency via Heart-Brightening Presentation Style (Scroll of Errata p 65)<br /> <br /> Manipulation 5 + Socialize 4 + Compassion 4 (Heart-Brightening Presentation Style) = 13 dice (7 Successes + 2 Excellency Successes = 9 Successes Total)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=UARVQLPE\" target=\"_blank\">72(13d10) = 72</a><br /> <br /> Flynn has spent:<br /> 2 Willpower<br /> 7 Motes of Personal Essence (I forgot Flynn has Compassion Essence Replenishment. So I have gotten 8 motes back.)<br /> <br /> And Gained:<br /> 3 Points of Limit<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-15-2015, 09:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T15:52:28-08:00","id":407091,"title":"","content":"Nahuel shifts back to his human form and tries the wine, curiously, though he does not take a seat. He stands and drinks slowly, listening to what the others have to say before speaking his own mind.<br /> <br /> &quot;Become rich?,&quot; he snorts. &quot;I would say that you, all of you, are already wealthy beyond measure. I have never seen so many people fed so well, or in such clothing or large homes.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You speak of becoming a hero, to save the world. I was a hero to my people, and now I see that the world is so large I can understand it. To be truthful, much of what I have seen, I do not like.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anathema? I was warned of people who use that word, who would not believe that I was Chosen of Luna,&quot; he says, the sign of the Full Moon shimmering into being on his brow. &quot;I was told that those who used that word word would be my enemies, so I thank you for stopping the use of it, Swimming Owl. I have too many enemies as it is.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You ask what my goals are... in all truth, I do not know. I want to free my people from bondage, but to do that, I must destroy all of Dzibilchan, or find them a new place to call home. I want to stop other slavers from placing others in bondage, but you say that simply killing them is not enough. I am a warrior, not a maker of machines, or a sage, or a leader of men. With the gifts I have been given, I can go anywhere, do whatever I wish, but I do not know enough to decide what I must do. So first, I must learn more of the world that I find myself in, and then I will decide how I am to end slavery, for my own people and for others.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T16:39:48-08:00","id":407135,"title":"","content":"&quot;I meant no offense in my use of the word. Is there a proper term for all the different types of exalts that aren't Dragon blooded? I have not come across any thus far.&quot; Flynn asks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T16:57:23-08:00","id":407141,"title":"","content":"Splendor didn't give much comment, but he did simply say, &quot;Celestial.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T17:11:10-08:00","id":407145,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll start using that term then, Master.&quot; Swimming Owl gave Nahuel a slightly embarrassed smile. &quot;I apologize for any offense, Nahuel. Please be aware that many will use that term-the monks of the Immaculate Order teach it, along with the marks that sometimes shine on your brows, to all within the range of their teachings. They say that you are great and terrible demons, and exhort the people to fear your power. If you make an enemy of everyone who uses the word, you'll make an enemy of untold thousands of innocents whose only crime is relying on those monks for protection from ghosts and demons...and as healers and spiritual guides. They will hate and fear you, if they find out what you are...but if you treat them as enemies, you will only show them the demon they expect, rather than a heroic champion of the Changing Lady.&quot;<br /> <br /> She leaned back in her chair, stretching her arms over her head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me of Dzibilchan. I have never been there, and while I have heard rumors from the Guildsmen who travel deep into the East in search of rare herbs, I think I know as little of your homeland as you do of mine. I believe in fair bargains, and it would be unfair of me to ask your help here if I can't offer you any help with your goals.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T21:45:12-08:00","id":407382,"title":"","content":"He shakes his head, not in denial, but in weariness and exasperation; what kind of world is it where you can't simply kill those who stand against you and be done with it? &quot;This Immaculate Order sounds like it causes as much harm as good. Do the people not have their own shamans and priests to protect them? I have never cared what anyone other than my own people thought of me, but it seems that may need to change.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Dzibilchan... better to show you.&quot; He shifts his shape again, not into a raptor cat or bird, but combining aspects of human with crocodile; an elongated snout, scaly hide, and muscular tail on an otherwise human frame. &quot;This is how the Dzibilese appear; they are conquerors, who have swept all before them for past century and more. They see men and women as nothing more than beasts of burden. And many of their leaders command the elements; they are what you call Dragon-Blooded.&quot;<br /> <br /> He returns to his natural form. &quot;My people, the Yaxbalam, were one of many tribes who stood in their path; we fought, with the aid of our totem spirits, but could not withstand them. Though it pains me to admit it, we would probably have been conquered long ago, had the capital of Dzibilchan not been destroyed, and their king slain. By what, I do not know.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T07:08:33-08:00","id":407705,"title":"","content":"\u201cNahuel, you will find that you might not need to destroy the entirety of Dzibilchan or the Guild to achieve your goals. When you meet another warrior on the battle field, do you totally destroy his body to kill him? No, you find a weakness. A place where when you sink your fangs and claws into, it will cause the most damage.\u201d Flynn's hand mimics a claw and makes a slashing motion. \u201cThis weak point is what you must find. We can help you with this.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThe Immaculate Order are the shamans and priests that protect people in the Realm. The Wyld Hunt is only a small part of their responsibilities. The monks have been taught and have taught for generations that those with the powers of the Sun and Moon are soul eating tricksters. They think they are protecting the people they serve when they organize the Wyld Hunt.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLike most groups of people, the Immaculate Order is made up of individuals. There will always be those that disagree with the status quo. There have been cases where a Monk will protect one of the Anath\u2026. Celestials, but if they are found out, they are killed along with the Celestial.\u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cWhile I understand the need to defend ourselves, I\u2019d prefer that we don\u2019t indiscriminately kill anyone just because they belong to an organization that has hurt us in the past. Be it the Guild or the Immaculate Order. \u201c <i>Or Sidereals</i>, Flynn completed in his thoughts.<br /> <br /> Flynn pulled a small vial out of his bag. He shook what little white powder in the vial that was left into his mouth, making a face at the bitter taste of the Willow bark powder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-16-2015, 11:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T12:40:11-08:00","id":409223,"title":"","content":"Flynn continues, &quot;My original suggestion of creating labor saving wonders that would replace the need for slaves might fulfill most of our desires. It would eliminate the need for raiding villages for fresh laborers. It will make those who wish to be rich, very rich. It would have a very large positive impact on the lives of many.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Though it will not be an easy task. There are those who make a great deal of money off of keeping the status quo. I doubt these people will let us accomplish our goal without a fight. We may have to enter the political arena in this area to gain allies to help us.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T13:22:47-08:00","id":410497,"title":"","content":"&quot;Labor saving devices are tools, capable of being turned to more than one end. Moreover, slavery is merely a target we all find agreeable to work against. Even if there is no division among us, we will need to balance our longer term influence with the short term suffering of the enslaved. What would help is if I had more information about local conditions, I cannot...&quot;<br /> <br /> Behind his many veils Splendor's eyes opened very wide. To himself he muttered, &quot;...back bricks without clay...&quot; and &quot;The problem is maturation...&quot;<br /> <br /> He turned deliberately to Swimming Owl before sweeping his eyes across the table. &quot;Is there precedent for the hypothetical I am about to relate? Suppose I have a prophetic vision that a pack of wyld wolves will sweep in and slay two thirds of all the pigs of Puyo. Therefore, I go to those with herds of hogs and offer to pay them the full value of their pigs now in exchange for a certain number come Autumn. When the time of slaughter comes, the price of ham, pork, and bacon is very great because of the shortage. Yet because of the contracts I have made I have the pigs I purchased at the agree price and sell them for a great profit.<br /> <br /> Would the authorities support my right in such a case?&quot;<br /> <br /> Before the guildswoman could answer he turned to one of the serving automata and said, &quot;Fetch me paper and writing supplies, I must write this down.&quot;<br /> <br /> As soon as he had it he began to write, speaking quickly as he did so.<br /> <br /> &quot;We would need to establish at least four organizations, at least the convincing facade of them. First, a priesthood of a moderately powerful harvest god, though why would an important god violate the Mandate that way? Nothing to gain by it... pick candidate later, perhaps elevate local field god. Second, an ascetic order committed to extracting the maximum labor from slaves. Best if they appear especially stern. Third, an inventor or group of them to serve as the source of our labor saving devices. Finally, a group of moneylenders and merchants.<br /> <br /> We start with a paper transaction, Swimming Owl promises a sum of money over a period of time for services or some such. The content doesn't actually matter. We sell the future revenue for a cash payment now, and use those funds to establish the credibility of our priesthood. Then we sell ecclesiastical ranks, from a nominally finite pool, which provide a say in the operation and a right to draw a portion of the assets for personal use. We invest this capital in land purchases. We negotiate those purchases before hand through multiple intermediaries to keep it from becoming known that we are buying up large parcels.<br /> <br /> Then we negotiate a contract with local slaveowners for labor, paying them with a portion of the profit from the fields. We offer to purchase them at the end of the season at inflated prices with the remainder of the harvest. That's where our discipline order comes in. They approach the slave owners and offer to get even more labor as their religious duty in exchange for full reign to practice their faith on them. In reality, they inform the slaves that they will be receiving a fair wage, on paper, which will be applied toward their purchase price. If they have a sufficient output by the end of the season they will have earned their freedom, otherwise the purchase agreement with the owners will not cover them. That should motivate them more than any whip.<br /> <br /> While all this is going on the inventors come in. The priesthood will contract them to increase the yields. We use a few demonstrations to build talk around them and use that to boost faith in the sale of priestly ranks and offer the benefits to the slave owners to sweeten the labor deal. Make their compensation publicly outrageous, and paid on delivery, then use that to entice merchants and craftsmen to provide us with the additional labor and materials we need to actually produce them.<br /> <br /> At this point, we will gain a great deal of real assets, owe three times their value in debt, and have promised the next ten years of output within two. Essentially, we are minting money from promises and dreams, trading it for real wealth, and financing it by selling pieces of things that if summed would be greater than the whole.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused for breath as he looked over what he had been writing, a schematic of the plan that covered several pages and included everything from suggested percentages, estimated rates of return, and proposed details of the false organizations.<br /> <br /> &quot;Then we are going to need money to pay installments on all these debts and cover our operating costs. So we cause a panic. We drop rumors about something that will cause people to lose faith in our ability to repay. Once it has fomented the fourth group comes in. They offer essentially the reverse of what we have been. If people pay them small sums now, they will pay out large sums if the priests default on their obligations.<br /> <br /> If everything goes right, something that will require all of us to strain our skill and excellence, everyone we scammed will be rich, a huge number of slaves will be free without creating new demand, and we will be unfathomably wealthy and own most of the city-state. If it goes wrong than the house of paper collapses and the probate courts will have a full caseload for years.<br /> <br /> It will take someone far more persuasive than I am to convince the relevant parties to agree to all this.<br /> <br /> On consideration, I may have been struck by a moment of madness from Dedwen and Mun. What say you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-18-2015, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T19:03:52-08:00","id":410919,"title":"","content":"Flynn listened quietly to Splendor\u2019s plan. Afterwards, he asks one of the automatas for a goblet of water and was pleasantly surprised when it responded to his orders and brought him a goblet.<br /> <br /> <i>Where to begin</i>, Flynn thought as he drank his fill of water.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe plan has some merits,\u201d Flynn started, \u201cbut it is complicated. People are not like cogs in machines. They will not react in a rational manner. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cMost schemes have three sides. Let\u2019s call one side 'Us' and the other 'Them'. The third side is the group,\u201d Flynn indicates those in the room, \u201cthat is managing both sides and will gain the most advantage of playing the two other sides off of each other.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThe idea of setting up a front organization is a good one. It\u2019s a shame the Sailor\u2019s Grotto was destroyed. It was a convenient place to hold private meetings.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd the insurance idea\u2026well, there are plenty of people in town who are promising more than they are able to provide and others greedy enough to believe it. We don\u2019t need to create such an organization; they already exist. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cIf we want to go down this path, I say we go to the desperate, selling our aid in fulfilling their promises. To the greedy, we sell them insurance in case the desperate fail. We make money on both sides of the equation and we can use that money to fund our goals.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBut the tactical details are something we can plan when we have more information on Puyo. If we are decided on a goal of ending slavery, then what we need is information before we decide on a plan.\u201c","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-18-2015, 10:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T20:20:55-08:00","id":410951,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perhaps it is the lingering effects of a past life, but those plans leave me feeling dissatisfied. They make us part of the system instead of allowing us, those here and the rest of the people, to transcend it. The world is broken, and I want to do more than sustain that brokenness.<br /> <br /> 'Things can be better', that is the principle that lies at the secret heart of my soul. I learned it at the feet of my father, for who it justified all his labor and every setback. Recent events have made be question it more than I ever have. Yet that is all the more reason not to let it go. To do so would be to believe that <i>this</i> is the best we can do. I cannot accept that, and I do not think anyone else here can either.<br /> <br /> I accept that my plan is overly complicated and makes many assumptions. I have never done anything even remotely like it, or indeed even conceived of its like. Maybe it is even unsalvageable. Yet the one feature which I do not believe is wrong is its ambition. I think we deliver the enslaved from bondage and bring prosperity without exploitation or violence. We are Exalted, and you both,&quot; he addressed Flynn and Swimming Owl, &quot;have as much right to earn that title as the rest of us. We are made Exalted by our deeds, not by what light we shine with.<br /> <br /> Whatever we decide to do, let us do it so as to be worthy of the Exalted.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-19-2015, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T22:25:23-08:00","id":411072,"title":"","content":"((OOC: 4 successes on analyzing Splendor's plan. Gonna wait on ST's comments before I make IC comments here.))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T23:17:57-08:00","id":411122,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> One success. Flynn, you are useless! <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=A6F442D7\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=A6F442D7</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T18:56:17-08:00","id":412308,"title":"","content":"Swimming Owl thinks about the plan. Knowing that this area does have many shifts going on and that trade is increasing, it seems that bargaining without a full set-up would be quite easy. Since everyone is everywhere, it can be easy to confuse the investors, but you do run the risk of a few of them getting together for something else and figuring out the plan before it can be completed. If it could all be done really quickly, it would be quite easy. the longer it took.... the more likely it would be to fall apart. <br /> <br /> Something like this could be quite feasible for exalted though depending on their skills....<br /> <br /> <br /> Flynn realizes that the plan sounds awesome, so it must be awesome. And it COULD work... no... it WOULD word 100% for sure!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:41:50-08:00","id":412342,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>These are quick minds I deal with. I remember the day when I was so fast but my mind is so foggy now. </i><br /> <br /> Setting down the goblet of water an automaton had somehow know to bring him and<br /> Taking a deep breath to insurer he could make it though his lengthy proposal to come. The moment he was to speak splendor cut in with a rather interesting plan. A plan that not only include much of his plan that he had spent years drawing out in his mind, but a much improved version that hurt the enslaves far more then simply killing them would. <i>Splendor... he is a bit brazen... a bit foolish \u2026 but that is to be expected from a child of the sun. His goals are completable with mine and noble. This is a man I can make use of. </i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;In my years of enslavement to the guild&quot; pausing for just a moment and assuming an expression of the tired old man he was at heart, in hope to appear sage. &quot;I have learned that direct confrontation with any superior force is most often suicidal. Even as a group&quot; gesturing around the table.<br /> <br /> &quot;While the situation is dire we can't go to fast as we are small compared to a regional branch of The Guild. Let alone with the parallel threats of Mask of Winters (<i>whom ever that is</i>), this unknown god and any other force that has decided to make a power play.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">\u201cAnd I fear there must be more at work in the region then those three. The amount of refuges streaming into my town is clear evidence of that. While we can deal with these powers personally though careful and time consuming subterfuge, what we truly need is a power base of our own. Once we have established this any goal any of use might have while be far easier and potentially trivial in difficulty. This Manes is a great start to such a power base having manufactory built in. That is of course by your leave master Talos.&quot; Not to losses momentum he continued on with out waiting for a response.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> \u201cMaster Splendor has laid out a brilliant scheme to lay the foundation of such a power base on which we can achieve anything. This is a beginning not an end. We must first stand erect out of the mud of moral turpitude and the mundane life and death struggle before we can transcend past systems.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> \u201cThe Guild, trade and money itself are all extension of desire. Tools to reach it. So there are really only two different things we can do. Eliminate the despicable desire, an extremely difficult task as it requires the changing of cultures, or fulfill that desire in a way that is not despicable. This latter option of which the current plane before us is, not only being an easier task but bringing in talents of jade. We sate the desire for cheap exploitable labor, thus lessening the incentives to perpetrate the as of now unending atrocity that is slavery. I know it is within the combined capabilities of our generous savant host Talos and the brilliant <span style=\"color:#000000\">Splendor of Unfurling Horizons</span>. With The Guild connections Swimming Owl has initial funding should be a breeze to obtain. This plan is far form being unachievable and I fully support it. In fact I already have the ripe beginnings to a religious organization all ready in my town. I started it with the god of refugees of the East, Prosfygas. The refugees streaming though the land are far too many to ignore. <i>Also they provide a delightful source of power to use to better the world. </i>Long story short there are the foundations for this religious organization need for this plan that is within our control and will actually do good work instead of simply being a shell. It would be little work to make it a full fledged organization capable of serving our needs now and in the future. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Still addressing the party as a whole \u201c As slavery is a issue close to my heart I would like to address something Flynn said. 'Instead of building mechanical slaves, build machines so you don\u2019t need slaves at all. ' there lies a complicated problem. For instance, are the things serving all drinks mechanical slaves who wish freedom or simply machines built so that we don\u2019t need to enslave each other to serve us drinks? When does a machine become a person that can be enslaved? What if we created a machine that\u2019s only desire is to work to be of service? Can that machine be enslaved? What if we simply infuse an already sentient thing into a golem. It is my understanding there are a large number of gods that would be eager to serve as the animating force of such a creation. Even some humans might desire to be embodied in one of our creation. The key to all of this is if they are willing on there own freewill. It is enslavement when it is forced upon another. All said however I have no deep knowledge of how these automaton or golems are to be created. I defer to our master craftsmen's expertise in the matter. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>That should show those yougnens. I might be slow but I am keen</i></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T21:29:01-08:00","id":412415,"title":"","content":"Nahuel shakes his head. &quot;This plan is... complex. I know I am the newcomer here, ignorant, but even I know that the more things things you depend on, the more can go wrong. I agree more with what Splendor said last; this 'system' is broken. Wrong, in a way I never would have thought men could live with. When traditions do not work, they need to be thrown away. Better to make a clean start with something better, and let those who would preserve the old stand against us as they will.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;I would rather see men live in as men should, so they do not need thousands of servants, whether slave or machine. But if they must have them, let it be unthinking tools.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T14:22:21-08:00","id":413118,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hm.&quot; Swimming Owl's brow furrowed in thought. &quot;Master Splendor, you live up to your name. That plan is brilliant. Lots of moving parts and multiple points-of-failure, which is always risky in a business plan...but brilliant. I like it. That being said...&quot;<br /> <br /> She accepted a drink from one of the automatons.<br /> <br /> &quot;I think Nahuel is right. That complexity is a weakness. Only one or two parts need to fail in order for the whole thing to fail. Also, as the person ponying up a lot of the starting capital for this plan...well, even if building a casino would be highly profitable, you don't build a casino in a city you know is about to be invaded. Good way to lose your whole investment with nothing to show for it. This plan does not account for disasters beyond our control, the most likely of which would be military action by the Mask of Winters or by less dangerous warlords in the region looking to consolidate their power. There <i>is </i>a reason the place is filling up with refugees, after all. It's safe now, but with the Realm's troops gone it's only a matter of time until someone tries to seize this territory.<br /> <br /> I propose an...alteration to the plan. Working the fields just means we have food, something an invading army will want and can take without paying. I propose that instead of putting our slaves to work as field laborers, we train them as soldiers, and offer our services as a mercenary company. We offer the slaves benefits and the ability to rise in the ranks, and we offer them their freedom upon completion of a set term of service, to earn their loyalty. We supplement their ranks gradually with mechanical warriors who don't feel pain or need to sleep. Otherwise the plan remains the same, except that our investment defends itself and can defend our interests in the region. We might want to replace the field-god with Nahuel. He'd make a good warrior-deity, and he can train the troops in one shape and show up for the occasional &quot;miracle&quot; in another. Plus we don't have to involve another outsider in our scheme, we keep it in-house.<br /> <br /> Given the tumultuous nature of regional politics, I expect people will be willing to pay more money for protection than for food these days anyway. If, a few years down the road, we have a small army of battle automata and a larger army of skilled warriors loyal to us...well, then it's a simple matter to seize and consolidate power ourselves, set down whatever local laws about slavery we like, and start flexing our muscles to impact the policies of neighboring nations.<br /> <br /> ...and, of course, I make money on the mercenary contracts, can use our police force to make things a little harder on my competitors in other local markets, and I get rich even if the Realm shows up in three or four years and kills you all. Sound good?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T14:56:45-08:00","id":413193,"title":"","content":"<i>An army</i>, Flynn considered the implications of Swimming Owl\u2019s suggestion. <i>Have the Deathlords really grown so powerful? Just how much have I missed being on the run with Jericho.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I still think we should develop the labor saving devices. If only because, armies like to burn fields and steal crops and refugees need to eat. A focus on devices that encourage fast growth and increased yield would be best. \u201c No need to swell the undead ranks of the Mask of Winters with the ghosts of starved refugees. <br /> <br /> \u201cSwimming Owl, what are the rumors about going around about the Mask of Winters? How much of a danger is he to the area?\u201d <i>How much time do we have to prepare?</i> Flynn wanted to ask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T20:50:27-08:00","id":413654,"title":"","content":"&quot;I like that plan better, Swimming Owl. It is always better to be strong than weak; when two tribes fight, the one with more warriors usually wins. A tribe that cannot fight is pushed out or absorbed by those that do, and I know of little better than the art of war to make a man remember he is a man. I will not claim to be something I am not... but what I am will fill the need well enough, I think. I have a... friend, who could aid us with this plan as well. Much of his time is taken up defending my people, but those who remain are not in as much danger as they were.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What is a Mask of Winters?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T21:24:30-08:00","id":413714,"title":"","content":"&quot;While local conditions will ultimately determine the final form of the plan, I must bring up some difficulties with your suggested modification.<br /> <br /> In the first part, I can think of few activities more likely to bring opposition from local power groups. An army of slaves, and a very public anti-slavery policy will make us look very much like one of those warlords we are concerned over. Our ability, or rather lack thereof, to train and equip them fast enough to be a legitimate fighting force is also a concern. It may even push them into the arms of our enemies.<br /> <br /> Secondly, you may be overestimating the ability of Master Talos and myself to produce automatons. While I would have to inspect the facilities here before I can make any judgments, it will be insufficient on its own. Artifice is a discipline of cost. Those costs are not measured in silver or jade, though much of those is required, but in such prodigies as retain or renew a vital echo of the Creation. To produce warrior mechanica according to the... old pattern several would be required for each instance. We would need to condense industry to a fluid that we might shame the engine of Carnot, or gather the corners of spheres to shape metals in angles of uncertainty to confound the bloody sword of the gods' swarthy servant time.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stopped mid elaboration and muttered, &quot;That has the ring of verse I did not pen...&quot; Gathering his thoughts again he continued.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please forgive me, my thoughts at times outpace me.<br /> <br /> Third, we actually do require labor. Until the devices are constructed and in place there will be a great deal of physical work required. Even once they are functioning they will not totally eliminate labor.<br /> <br /> Finally, not all of the slaves we receive will have the desire or inclination for soldering. While I take no pleasure in using humans in this way, I think we only affirm their condition, and the sin of it, if we force them to fight. If that is their choice, so be it. Yet if we offer it to them, it is our responsibility to be able to see it done well. We would need trainers, armorers, and additional sources of income to support all of it.&quot;<br /> <br /> He seemed just about finished when he started,<br /> <br /> &quot;That said, we may have an existing mechanism for this sort of thing. If the stern brotherhood were to accept aspirants we could use that as a vector for training without suspicion and ensure that it is a choice rather than a compulsion. Still, I am not certain our already straining budget can afford it. We need harder numbers before we can say one way or the other.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T22:16:35-08:00","id":413803,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Exthalion;n413714]&quot;While local conditions will ultimately determine the final form of the plan, I must bring up some difficulties with your suggested modification.<br /> <br /> In the first part, I can think of few activities more likely to bring opposition from local power groups. An army of slaves, and a very public anti-slavery policy will make us look very much like one of those warlords we are concerned over. Our ability, or rather lack thereof, to train and equip them fast enough to be a legitimate fighting force is also a concern. It may even push them into the arms of our enemies.&quot;/QUOTE]<br /> <br /> &quot;That is a good thing, to my mind. I have spent my entire life fighting a losing war. One that I now have the power to win... pleases me.&quot; Nahuel leaves the rest of Splendor's objections to those who are more knowledgeable","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T09:48:42-08:00","id":414110,"title":"","content":"&quot;I, um.&quot; Sparrow frowned. &quot;No offense, Nahuel, but I'm not sure you have the power to win here either...the Mask of Winters is frankly terrifying. He conquered Thorns <i>easily. </i>Thorns was one of the mightiest kingdoms in the region, it was full of Imperial troops and Dragonbloods, and the stalemate with Lookshy meant they had lots of skilled warriors and magical weapons and dragonblooded officers there to keep up in the arms race. The Mask of Winters just stomped the place. On top of being a powerful necromancer with a pet giant big enough to carry a citadel on its back, he's apparently got multiple Anathe-hm. Multiple <i>Celestial Exalts</i> working for him. Nobody's sure exactly how many, but they apparently burn with black fire and command armies of the dead. Any living man who falls on the battlefield swells his army by three-a walking corpse, a maddened ghost, and one intelligent ghostly conscript. He's been playing nice because apparently he's not strong enough to take on Lookshy and the Guild and Great Forks and the rest of the Confederation of Rivers all at once...but theyr'e all to the north of him, and we're to the south with no major powers between him and us.<br /> <br /> Frankly, one of the reasons I love the automaton-warrior idea so much is that troops who aren't afraid of the living dead and who don't become the living dead if they're destroyed are at a ridiculous premium right now. I like the idea of training a priestly order of warriors as part of our scheme. If we can work some legitimate exorcism and warding into their curriculum, I think that would be a good idea. One of the reasons I'm here talking to you is because this market hasn't already been taken over by richer merchant princes with better backing in the Guild. The reason it hasn't is because they see this place as a risky investment-any money you put in might go up in smoke if the Mask takes over, and the odds are good that he will. So prices here are low and I don't have much competition, but the place <i>is </i>still risky. Any plan we make, as far as I'm concerned, needs to make reducing that risk a central part of the scheme, and that means the ability to defend what we're building here.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T10:11:55-08:00","id":414127,"title":"","content":"&quot;I still think the farming idea is a good one, especially when combine with the mercenary one. It has multiple advantages,&quot; Flynn ticks them off with his fingers. &quot;First, it gives us a food supply. We can use it to feed the refugees and our troops. If the Mask of Winters comes, we do not need to give him more soldiers via starvation.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSecond, it gives us a cover for training our \u2018slaves\u2019. We can create a story were certain exercises will give strong results in the field. Many farming implements can be used in war, so familiarity with them would not look out of place.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThirdly, a mercenary group gives possible employment for the slaves we have freed. I rather not turn field slaves into mercenary slaves, so we should give them a choice. But I\u2019m sure we can offer strong incentives for them to stick around. \u201c<br /> <br /> <br /> Flynn yawns. \u201cThough, all this hypothetical until we know the exact situation in Puyo. Also we will need a place in town to operate out of. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cYou two,\u201d Flynn nods towards Splendor and Nahuel will need less conspicuous clothing. I know of a local tailor, who though her daughters might think she is a slave driver, uses her own cloth. No slave labor created goods.\u201d He glances towards Fovnag when he says this.<br /> <br /> While his headache was fading, but now he was tired. He will need coffee or if no other choice, tea, to continue. \u201cDo we want to go out tonight? Or start fresh tomorrow morning?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-21-2015, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T19:47:29-08:00","id":415996,"title":"","content":"Talos has been silent the whole time, having taken out a scrip of paper and a pen, scribbling furiously on the paper.<br /> <br /> &quot;Inventions to replace slaves...what are slaves used for? Fieldworking, construction, serving, pleasure.....Maybe not pleasure, that'd be gross....Automatons would work best for serving, the other tasks would require larger machines&quot; He continues to sketch out his ideas, &quot;Agricultural creations would be the most important at first....a quicker way to harvest perhaps. Maybe faster growing wheat as well.....Eh, I'll worry about that later...&quot;<br /> <br /> He has tuned out the others, working on ideas that are now flowing from his mind to the pen in his hand.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If the GM desires, I can do some Craft: Magitech rolls right now to start the inventions. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 02-22-2015, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T20:35:56-08:00","id":416077,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>Profiting of the death and suffering of others. I would expect nothing less from someone like this amoral </i></span> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>aquatic friendly predatory bird. Unfortunately she is right. I mean WHY did my master telling me about this Mask of Winters?!</i>\u201cIs it not possible to create an automaton that can serve well in multiple situations? </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cWhile yes, it is necessary to use force to counter the forces we will face and having an army will be useful to exert such force but that is not near enough. The broken way things are now that we all have distaste for is largely people fighting each other over the glories of the distant past. The glories that where created though cooperation not the petty squabbling of the powerful at the cost of others.\u201d <i>The petty squabbles of Solars and Sidereals like you lot. </i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cBy far the most importunate task is to start building and gathering what we need to create these automaton. After all this is the linchpin of the shell game we are to play with The Guild merchants and the key needed in making a stand against Mask of Winters.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cAs for our need for labor and experience there are a lot of refuges that are skilled and more then likely to join any cause that provides them safety and stability. We need to make sure we are the ones to provide that safety and stability. Coincidentally my town has become such a haven, so we already have an in on getting access to the best of what refugees can offer. In fact I encountered a refugee that is a master thaumaturge so clearly there are gems to be found among the masses. He desires to form a school to train people to combat the chaotic nature of the time. I bring this up since if we want to train the freed slaves to be a fighting force against Mask of Winters knowing some basic thaumaturgical tricks such as warding will be invaluable.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Smiling at Flynn for the consideration of not supporting a vial institution such as slavery. <i>I would bet the bright fool did not even consider the likelihood that the material used to make that cloth was a product of slave labor. </i> His proposal to to set out this night sparked a small conflict within The Servant. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">While his body screamed \u201cNOOO!\u201d and begged for rest after such a grueling day. \u201cJust one night of rest. The beds must be heavenly in such a miraculous building.\u201d He forced past his lips \u201cTime is of the essence, if there are thing that can be done at night it is best not to let them wait.\u201d <i>This is not a time to relax far more dangerous things are a foot then I had imagined. </i></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 02-22-2015, 11:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T20:37:39-08:00","id":416079,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm. Then this Mask of Winters, I will leave for you to discourage and trick, until we are strong enough to face him. Other foes who come against us, you leave to me to defeat.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You know that I am as unlearned in your ways of fighting as everything else, yes? If I train our warriors, they will learn to fight as the Green Jaguars do.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T21:19:33-08:00","id":416134,"title":"","content":"&quot;To answer the Servant's question, it is possible to create multi-functional automata. However, it is more difficult than those with simpler purposes. Additionally, increasing their usefulness at a particular task also requires additional effort and resources.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turned to Talos<br /> <br /> &quot;Master Talos, speaking from what is surely ignorance, might thinking of solutions to agricultural problems in terms of automata be... excessive? From what I observed we could make great improvements merely by shodding plows with iron, introducing drills to ensure even depth and spacing of seed, and adapting the Eastern practice of growing multiple kinds of crop together. With... holistic techniques such as proper geomatic harmony, weaving worshipful patterns into the land, and the blessing of the field gods we could increase yields dramatically.<br /> <br /> In addition, I had some thoughts about using pulleys to replace draft animals.<br /> <br /> I think about factors such as simplicity and expense, considering that even the least work of high artifice requires a rare prodigy for the root or temper of its magic.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T13:43:15-08:00","id":416857,"title":"","content":"Talos pauses, folding up the parchment and tucking it into his coat, &quot;You're probably right. I suppose I'm just a bit too excited to fire up the workshop in the Northern Tower...I can most certainly make some top notch farming tools to start....I can start on guardian automata on the side...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T15:58:15-08:00","id":416945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=415996#post415996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Talos has been silent the whole time, having taken out a scrip of paper and a pen, scribbling furiously on the paper.<br /> <br /> <i>If the GM desires, I can do some Craft: Magitech rolls right now to start the inventions.</i><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You only need to roll once you have a specific crafting project in mind. These will count as part of your &quot;researching&quot; points toward making the artifact. This means you are actually coming up with designs in character. No need to roll for now. I need WHAT is being made first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T22:04:41-08:00","id":417195,"title":"","content":"Flynn smiled at the two Solars bickering back and forth about their inventions. It will be interesting to see what comes out of the workshop. <br /> <br /> &quot;If you two are going to be up all night clanking and making gods know what sort of racket, I probably should head back to town and find myself a room. I can meet up with Nahuel and Splendor tomorrow afternoon at the tailor's shop. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T22:21:58-08:00","id":417251,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why? Am I to be ashamed of my people, my heritage, that I must dress as one of you outlanders?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T22:31:49-08:00","id":417256,"title":"","content":"Flynn sighed. &quot;It wasn't my intention for you to hide your heritage. Who you are, Nahuel, is more than what you wear. You represent your people in more ways than your clothing. Your bearing, your accent, even the color of your eyes.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;However, if you are to spend a large amount of time in Puyo, it might be best to try to dress like a local. It will help the other people be comfortable around you and to listen to what you have to say. If I was going to spend time in your village, I would eventually learn to dress how your people dress. I couldn't imagine tramping around the jungle in what I am currently wearing. I'd be soaked in sweat in minutes and probably get my cloak caught in a bush.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But, I am not forcing you to do anything. It is simple a suggestion of mine. I mean no harm by it and will not be offended if you turn down my offer, my friend.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-24-2015, 01:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T22:32:41-08:00","id":417257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=417251#post417251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Why? Am I to be ashamed of my people, my heritage, that I must dress as one of you outlanders?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hey, us outlanders aren't so bad.&quot; Talos says with a smirk.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T16:02:21-08:00","id":419490,"title":"","content":"&quot;I dunno, I can be pretty bad.&quot; Swimming Owl grinned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T17:28:59-08:00","id":419609,"title":"","content":"Nahuel raises an eyebrow. If he's learning these folk's mannerisms right...<br /> <br /> &quot;I am sure that you can, Swimming Owl,&quot; he says dryly. &quot;And I did not mean it as an insult, Talos. Only that, among those who are not my enemies, I dislike pretending to be something that I am not. If you were to do as you suggest, Flynn, and dress as one of the Yaxbalam while you visited us, before you had learned our ways and lived them, my people would take take it as a mockery, rather than a show of respect. Which only shows again how much I have to learn. I... will think on it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T17:50:19-08:00","id":419635,"title":"","content":"&quot;Interesting. I would have assumed that part of learning the ways of your people would be learning to dress as them.&quot; Flynn decides to drop the subject of the tailor. &quot;If I ever do find myself among the Yaxbalam, I hope that I would have you guide me, Nahuel. I would not want to blunder around your village and offend someone in my ignorance. Apparently, learning a new culture is more complex than I thought.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn takes a sip of water and then pull out his Sanxian out of its case. &quot;Does anyone have any requests before dinner arrives?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T21:33:16-08:00","id":419805,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you mean music, I partial to <i>'</i>The Tower Clad With the Sky<i>'. </i>Though I wouldn't be disappointed if you didn't know it, it isn't from this direction.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-26-2015, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T08:13:48-08:00","id":420211,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Tower Clad With the Sky?&quot; Flynn asked. &quot;What direction is it from? I have never heard of that one. &quot; <i>Ever</i>, Flynn thought. It is rare for there to be a song that he doesn't know. His curiosity was peaked. <br /> <br /> &quot;Would you teach it to me? I'm always looking to increase my repertoire.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T20:17:57-08:00","id":421110,"title":"","content":"&quot;I I would gladly show you the true way for men to live, but I fear that is not likely... all of the Yaxbalam now are either slaves to Dzibilchan, or living on the hospitality of our distant cousins upon the plains. I shall consider what you have said, though. Please, I would like to hear one of your songs, anything.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T21:11:13-08:00","id":421193,"title":"","content":"&quot;Another time perhaps. It is... somewhat frustrating, having experienced surpassing excellence, to display lesser mastery.<br /> <br /> I would not think to compare my poor skill to your own, or to presume to perform when you have offered.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-27-2015, 12:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T10:08:16-08:00","id":421917,"title":"","content":"\u201cNonsense! I am no prima donna that is unwilling to share the stage! It is always better to play in duet.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;However, I understand the reluctance to perform on the spot. Perhaps later you can teach me this song and I can share some of the ones I have learned over the years.\u201d<br /> <br /> Flynn thinks for a moment, considering what to play. <i>It is almost sunset.</i><br /> <br /> \u201cI know just what to play. Though, if you will forgive my indulgence, would everyone mind relocating outside? The setting sun would set just the right mood for this piece. \u201c<br /> <br /> <i>It will also give me a chance to memorize the way out of this fucking maze of a manse.</i> Flynn picks up his Sanxian and heads towards the door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Going to start reading the dialogue I write out loud. :) 02-27-2015, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T19:39:58-08:00","id":422489,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">As The Servant watched the two solors chat, it reminded him how little he knows of world and his complete lack of knowledge when it can to the crafting of wonders.<i> Knowledge is power and I am badly lacking in that department. I must remedy this. Worse I never actually got to scout the town as I planed having ran into this strangely perfect group of strangers.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cI alas will have to be absent for your skillful duet. I have a number of duties I need to attend to in the town that I was unable to complete before I had the privilege of making such august company as I find myself. It is fortunate that some of my duties may be undertaken as \u201d Bowing his head he got up form the table. Only to be halted by the realization he has no idea how to leave this maze.<i>How did he forget to check for exits? Why did he trust these people so readily? Stupid old man, must be losing his mind.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cMaster Talos, I hesitate to disturb your contemplations but, is there any trick in exiting your manes as there is entering it?\u201d </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Waiting for a response, he steeled himself against the hesitancy to leave the safety of the group<i>. A safety that is a rare gift in his life last felt when he ran with the Cross-roads pack who picked him up from the wild, before they covertly sold him to his hated master. He had in mind a task that all but the treacherous sidereals would see in an ill light. Actions that are cruel but are needed for the greater good. </i></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T11:18:14-08:00","id":423131,"title":"","content":"Flynn jumped on the chance for an excuse to leave the manse. <br /> <br /> &quot;If you wait until after my song, we can head back to town together. I've have some errands to run back in town myself, but I did not want to walk back alone.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T20:24:41-08:00","id":423744,"title":"","content":"<i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Ha-rumph. Well it could have been worse.<br /> <br /> Having a traveling companion is safer, even if it is a sidereal. Better yet Flynn is... tolerable albeit s fool. None of the pompous insulated nature of Splendor nor the slavery loving fiendish views of the Owl. I'll be able to shake him before my hunt.</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5100/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5100/view</a> hope its not a death lord</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 03-04-2015, 04:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T06:10:44-08:00","id":427650,"title":"","content":"Flynn gathers up his bag and Sanxian and starts to follow the old man. He thinks about the song he is going to play, an instrumental piece. He shakes his head, trying to clear it. <i> I need to be paying attention to the route out of this place. </i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Perception 2 + Awareness 3 = 5 dice (1 Success) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=GJRWD4N9\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=GJRWD4N9</a><br /> <br /> Flynn still has Prior Warning up, so hopefully nothing that wants to kill us.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-04-2015, 09:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T14:06:53-08:00","id":428099,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wait, wait!&quot; Talos says, quickly leaving his chair and grabbing his hat, &quot;It's easy to get lost in here! Let me lead you out!&quot; He runs to the group, grabbing his spear and his satchel of books in a rush.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793176/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793176/</a><br /> That is five successes on the Perception+Awareness if I've counted right. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T15:27:02-08:00","id":428217,"title":"","content":"As Flynn and Talos come out of the manse, they hear something. It sounds like it could be screaming from far away. It sounds like it is coming from the direction of the town....<br /> <br /> There are no other signs coming from the town, but the forest life seems to be eerily quiet to everyone...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T15:54:36-08:00","id":428241,"title":"","content":"<i>Was that screaming?</i> Flynn thought. He couldn\u2019t be sure. It sounded like it <i>could</i> be screaming. <br /> <br /> \u201cDid you hear that?\u201d he asked Talos. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T19:35:35-08:00","id":429629,"title":"","content":"Splendor had hoped to inspect the workshop this evening, but without Talos he was more or less bound to the room, and so he followed the excitable fellow out. &quot;It seems we are returning to the town.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5174/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5174/view</a><br /> <br /> 4 successes</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T22:27:52-08:00","id":429843,"title":"","content":"Nahuel shrugs, and goes along with the others, wondering if these civilized folk always have so much trouble making up their minds. Either for comfort or some vague instinct, he shifts back into his spirit shape for the walk.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4794528/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes on perception, includes 1st Excellency.</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T14:13:14-08:00","id":430594,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>Gahhh! Why this sudden migration? I cant shake them all. </i><br /> <br /> \u201cI return to town only as I have urgent business that I put aside when I came into your company. It has only become more urgent since I was diverted.\u201d<br /> <br /> Looking to Splendor \u201cUnless your grace has reason to go it seems best for you to grow further acquainted with what I am lead to believe will be your new workshop with Talos.\u201d </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T06:10:13-07:00","id":432568,"title":"","content":"<i>Hmm...everyone else is going somewhere else...</i><br /> <br /> Swimming Owl did <i>not </i>follow Talos and the others out. This was a perfect opportunity to investigate this amazing puzzle-manse! If you're considering the possibility of seducing a guy for the sake of the mission, it's always a good idea to scope out his bedroom first and make sure he doesn't have a bunch of suspiciously lifelike bronze statues of attractive people screaming in agony. Swimming Owl had learned this from experience.<br /> <br /> Therefore, as the others began to filter out into the hallway, discussing where to go next, she sat quietly and finished her drink.<br /> <br /> <i>It is not at all out of character for the greedy guild merchant to try and deduce this place's secrets.</i> She told herself. <i>And let's be honest, Owl, you can't resist a good secret...and worst case, if you get lost or end up in danger, you play the Curious Maiden.</i><br /> <br /> She closed her eyes, and sipped her wine, and smiled as she listened to the voices of the men travel further down the hall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T09:09:24-07:00","id":432626,"title":"","content":"Flynn listened closely and realized that what he was hearing was screaming.<br /> <br /> <i>Shit, of course there is trouble going on back at town.</i> Flynn tightly gripped the strap of his bag. Every fiber of his body wanted to run to town, but he was playing a mortal musician and it wouldn't be in character to run into danger.<br /> <br /> <i>Fuck it</i>, Flynn thought as he dropped his bag and instrument just inside of the manse. He ran at top speed towards the sounds of screaming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:30:26-07:00","id":432945,"title":"","content":"Screams. Now that is something that Nahuel is all too familiar with. He doesn't know just what's causing these... just that he's heard their like many times before.<br /> <br /> <i>Not this time.</i><br /> <br /> He takes off at full sprint, stretching his repto-feline body to the utmost, shifting his feet and legs to squeeze out ever more speed, quickly outdistancing the others.<br /> <br /> (OOC: I have Dexterity 6 in raptor cat form, and if they aren't already included, using HBR to get Cheetah's Pace, and Inexhuastible.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T22:27:41-07:00","id":433603,"title":"","content":"&quot;Did you guys hear something?&quot; Talos says, tilting his head, &quot;It sounded like a scream. Maybe we should.....&quot; He pauses, realizing that his two companions had left him in the dust. &quot;Well thanks for waiting!!&quot; Talos yells before turning around and heading back into his manse, &quot;Alright, I suppose now is as good a time as any for me to give you all a tour of the manse. Like I said....it's pretty easy to get lost in here.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 03-15-2015, 11:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T14:29:13-07:00","id":437536,"title":"","content":"Splendor was faced with a decision. On the one hand, he remained afraid that exposing himself would draw the Hundred Stars to him. On the other, these were Chosen. For all there divisions, they were strongest when they worked together. If only he could trust that that was what would happen. Making up his mind he turned to the empty air.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keep them safe. All the dead who walk visible from the city, invaders from afar who come for violence, unbound demons, brigands who pray on the lawful, and and they who would and could kill these who were in the manse with me are yours. Go elsewhere if those I charge you to protect would attack you, remain hidden if possible, and return to me by dawn.&quot;<br /> <br /> He hesitated before finishing, this could go very poorly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Arise and slay the enemy.&quot;<br /> <br /> With a sick feeling in the pit of his stomach he returned to the manse and tried to find the dining room again. &quot;Swimming Owl,&quot; he called, &quot;care for a stroll about the clockwork halls?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-11-2015, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T15:02:05-07:00","id":437591,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Before the screams even registered to The Servant, <span style=\"color:#000000\">Nahuel</span> was off and running in his animal form. When Talos points out the noise however he hears it carried upon the wind.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><i>Where is that fool heading off to? He heard distant screams and just runs towards it? Ah but I myself was once such a fool unable to help myself from intervening at ever injustice before my eyes. My plans can wait for now. I'll never make it there in time in this form. Well if those treacherous sidereals are working with solers they will likely not turn in a lunner.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">\u201cThere is no rest to be had tonight. I'll see you in town master Talos.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Shifting into the form of that starved wolf that once tried to eat him during his Trials hes set off after <span style=\"color:#000000\">Nahuel. (OOC: Dex:4 and I think from the form itself </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Cheetah's Pace Mutation) </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T15:27:30-07:00","id":437640,"title":"","content":"As Flynn ran though the forest, his headache returned. He belatedly remembered that he was suppose to keep his companions in town. <i> I guess this is why</i>, he thought. Images of the possible horrors that awaited them in town filled his mind. Any death would be on his conscience. Was a skin of wine worth it? <i>Somethings never change. Bronze. Gold. Doesn't matter. I'm still a fuck up.</i> <br /> <br /> A jungle cat ran past. A lone wolf soon followed. <i>Fovnag? I knew that bastard was a lunar,</i> Flynn thought. The Jade Prison was too recently opened for a Solar to be that old and crotchety. <br /> <br /> Flynn paused a moment to catch his breath. He could hear someone coming from the direction of the manse. Briefly, he considered waiting for the others, but having to play the harmless mortal musician would limit his ability to assist the town. He wanted to keep his options open. Flynn took off at a full run again. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:21:50-07:00","id":437688,"title":"","content":"Racing through the forest at top speed, you see all the trees whiz by, but not many animals. You all can recall that these deathknights or &quot;dark lords&quot; people spoke about could often bring up a strong enough feeling of hate and torture to scare animals away. The light continues to dim, but having traveled the path recently, you can recall how to get back to the town. Not to mention that the occasional scream and yell does make it to your ears. After a while, you notice more and more people coming into the forest looking very scared.<br /> <br /> Nahuel arrives first, a few minutes before the others. People ran past him without a second thought. They had more important things to worry about than a raptor cat running past them. In fact, they did not even pause in their haste to continue getting far enough into the forest.<br /> <br /> The Servant arrived towards the edge of the forest second. Again, people ignored the wolf as if it were not a threat at all. By now, more people were starting to leave and were carrying very little. They look like they packed to stay away for quite a while, but left in a hurry.<br /> <br /> About two minutes after, Flynn and Talos come across some people fleeing into the forest. The people yell as you approach, &quot;That's the wrong way! Don't get lost! Come with us to get away from the town! We can show you the way!&quot; <br /> <br /> The daystar begins to set over the horizon and it begins to get dark and a beautiful sky lights up with bright oranges and reds, but as Nahuel come out of the forest, he can see a deep, almost pitch black darkness coming from the side of town. It seems like a pillar of darkness just exploding into the sky. A slight maniac, screechy laughter can be heard coming from the pillar. Getting even closer, he notices that it seems to have the shape of a giant bat with its wings folded.<br /> <br /> A minute later, The Servant sees the same scene. When The Servant and Nahuel come around the edge of the town, they notice a small streak of light pass towards the pillar of darkness. You are currently too far away to see what it is, but it does look like a person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:46:59-07:00","id":437705,"title":"","content":"Flynn watched the townspeople run away, but did not feel like he himself was in danger. <i>When in doubt, do what the mortals do</i>, he told himself. He turned and began to run with the other people. Once the others were out of sight, he dropped his false destiny and doubled back. Keeping in the shadows of the building, he edged closer towards the dark pillar to see what was going on. He could always don his Sorcerer Destiny if he needed to converse with the others.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Venus loves Flynn. Four Successes on Stealth!<br /> <br /> Dexterity 4 + Stealth 1 = 4 dice (4 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=6RU499Q3\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=6RU499Q3</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-15-2015, 11:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T19:09:27-07:00","id":437885,"title":"","content":"Nahuel does not know what the thing is; nor does he much care. Whatever it is, this thing clearly has no business in the world of men. These are not his people, but they were... peaceful and welcoming enough. Here is a problem that Nahuel knows how to solve.<br /> <br /> His claws and fangs lengthen, sharpen, and gleam with silver as he ducks into the shadow of a building and searches for a good avenue of attack.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Activating Claws of the Silver Moon, and five successes on a stealth roll to approach the shadow-bat thing.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5405/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5405/view</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T19:48:33-07:00","id":437915,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i><span style=\"color:#000000\">Large dark pillar. That is not a good sign. Good thing that white light seems to have it in control. One has to wonder what those two are doing? </span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\">His need for knowledge of what in the world is that massive thing overrode his fear of risk. Dogging into an alley taking a quick look to make sure there are no obvious spectators, he shifted into a crow and took flight heading towards the black figure to circling above what is likely to be a interesting conversation. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">(OCC: Just wanted to post some back-story. Felt the need to justify why i'm not still running away.)</span></span> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">It's been a long day. The panther stopped running for the first time that day. Feeling safe from his enemies and the dangers of the world that pry on all. he relaxed his body and his form becoming what he was before Luna blessed him. A scared wrinkled old man with wispy white hair. He takes this risk sparingly less he be recognized or remembered by the wrong people. His true skin tingles at the moisture in the air having not felt in for long over a year. Secure in the canopy his tired mind drifted to thoughts untouched before now.</span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\">I have only know servitude until Luna blessed me, but what I have done with her rare favor. Fled. </span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i><span style=\"color:#000000\">I fled from the salve caravan, from the predators in the night, from slave hunters, even as I was offered a stable existence It was at the cost of servitude once more. To remain would be to spit in the eye of Luna herself, rejecting her gift. I am once more on the run not only now from the Guild that held me in chains but from the Master that would have kept me from them if only I live in a golden cage he defined. Escape. It has consumed my life for far to long. What remains of me if my decades of servitude and years of flight are ignored?</span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">His thoughts halt as he come upon such a question. A question that he never before had opportunity to think of. Relaxing his mind as he did his form, he let flow his age diminished intellect to discover the unknown within.</span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\">My Will. None can claim to have lived so long under such harsh conditions. I, a mere mortal have persevered thou decades of what kill most within a year. Endless days of hard labor, illnesses that laid my fellows low, whips tore my body, hungry raking at the mind, sadistic overseers and crunching despair of the knowledge that there is no escape. While my will has been put towards survival thus far, what now shall I do?</span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Ideal hands fiddling admits his pack, his fingers brush against the Hammer he had stolen in haste from his former master. Struck with remembrance his plan to start a project of his own, he smiled.</span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\">I might be mortal no more but I am proof of mortal power. Moreover the Guild wrapped in the unnumbered evils of its practice stands as a paragon of the power mortals can wield. I shall purify the Guild be that it assuredly means destroying it.<br /> <br /> I was alone. Everything I did I did alone. I was not an overseer nor properly a slave. My lunar master cared only for himself and what might be considered a education and initiation was merely him forging a new tool for his motives. I am alone now. My mentor choose to leave me, so I remain alone in my goal to remove the Guild and empower humanity. I must find others. Mortals, Gods, Exalts whomever and whatever I can get to help I will take.</span></i><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\">&quot;For the glory of Humanity for the glory of Luna!&quot; </span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 03-16-2015, 12:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T23:52:31-07:00","id":445418,"title":"","content":"Talos leads the group through the strange labyrinthine rooms and hallways of his manse, &quot;You've probably noticed already,&quot; the Twilight says to his tourists as they cross a crystal bridge extending over hundreds of shining orichalcum gears and wheels, the same sight extending above them, &quot;But the Manse is constantly moving.&quot; He carefully steps off the bridge and onto a nearby horizontal gear, &quot;Everything moves according to the gears, so the actual layout of the manse is different at nearly every moment of the day.&quot; He steps off the gear and the group finds themselves in a completely new stairwall, this one descending downward. &quot;A few former slaves I once knew used to tell legends of this place, saying that no one who entered ever left. It's pretty easy to see why: they got lost.&quot; Talos shakes his head, &quot;Damn shame.....it's really a matter of keeping track of time....&quot;<br /> <br /> The stairwell ends, opening into a large room. The group can immediately feel the heat emanating from the large shaft in the center of the room. Far below them at the bottom of the shaft was the red glow of molten lava, and from this flow rose four crystalline pillars, glowing from the lava within as it flowed up to a platform. &quot;Thankfully, the forge is one of the few places that doesn't move in the manse.&quot; Talos says as he walks down a staircase to the platform, which had all the fixings of a masterwork smithy. As Talos stepped onto the platform, a large clockwork gear spun out from the wall towards the plaform, a few of the small automata appear at the sides of the shaft, each one bearing an orichalcum tool for blacksmithing and ready to run it to their master at a moment's notice. &quot;I've been dying to fire this thing up, but I haven't really had a chance to build anything yet. And this is nothing compared to the workshop on the other end of the Manse!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hopefully that's a decent enough description of the Manse. The workshop on the other end is, of course, the one designed for Magitech. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T06:20:47-07:00","id":445710,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fascinating.&quot; Swimming Owl smiled, peering down at the lava. &quot;Does the place have any built-in defenses, other than its confusing layout? Anything to stop a superior military force from just seizing it from the outside? This production center seems pretty central to our plans, and the only reason no one has yet tried to take it from you is because no one knows it's here...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T13:03:37-07:00","id":446415,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am actually more interested in the final cause and source of motion. All this mechanism seems odd for only changing configuration. Too exposed, vulnerable to damage. Gear work is generally meant to move force around and to transform its speed and direction. There are few things I can think of that would require all this. The other workshop <i>might</i> qualify, I would have to see it, but... there is an enormous amount of motive force at work in this place.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glanced at the long shaft and the molten blood of Earth below. Thoughtlessly he murmured, &quot;... with our fire we renew the world...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I suspect this place is that from which motion is birthed. Have you examined the lower portions of the apparatus?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T17:09:49-07:00","id":446738,"title":"","content":"The shadows seemed deeper and darker today. Many things (and people) were lurking in them. Moving from shadow to shadow to stay hidden, Flynn gets to the edge of the town to get a clear view of the pillar. In the darkest parts of buildings, Nahuel finds a rooftop to clamber onto and get a full view of the situation. As he comes out onto the roof, he sees a crow flying above toward the scene, almost blended into the dark background. With all the chaos going on, you are sure that noone has seen you.<br /> <br /> From the different views, you all notice that there is a horde of undead. The great ball of light looks like it could be Anita Fairhand. Fearlessly, she engages in battle with all of the skeletons that seems to be crowding her and holding her own. It looks like she has taken care of most of them, and is now finishing off the last few, whilst spewing insults and threats at the pillar of darkness. Now, you realize that the giant pillar of darkness in the shape of a bat is an anima... a very large anima. To make matters worse, the figure's face is completely obscured by the anima and you cannot see their features, plus they seem to be standing on some sort of disc/flying machine in midair, just watching the battle leisurely and occasionally laughing.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, you hear another loud echoing laugh. ( <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">http://www.YoutubeRepeater.com/watch?v=f3BPx2lt6E0&amp;s=0&amp;e=7 ) Using some sort of spell, he says loudly to the entire town &quot;Look you pathetic fools who have decided to stay and fight, this is all that your town can muster! This is just the smallest beginning and a simple warning. An army many times this size will be coming soon enough. Now you should decide, join us and be set for life, or leave this town to us. If you choose to stay and fight, you WILL be tortured and imprisoned in agony. The choice is yours.&quot;<br /> <br /> Talking in a normal shout he says, &quot;Goodbye Anita. You'll be dead soon too. Too bad your simple threats are meaningless. Have your neck ready.&quot; With that, he beings to move away in the sky.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T18:05:18-07:00","id":446822,"title":"","content":"<i>Shit shit shit shit. Why doesn't the Bureau of Destiny always send us somewhere just before the army arrives?!?! Why not a few months? Fucking slow Bureaucracy!</i><br /> <br /> Flynn settles down and waits in the shadows for the others to appear. Once the deathknight is gone, he will become the Musician again. Now would be a good time to approach the Goddess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:32:01-07:00","id":447110,"title":"","content":"Nahuel quietly snarls. He's seen this sort of thing before... not quite the same, but close enough to the Dragon-Blooded gatormen destroying his tribe. Not to mention, goddess or not, there's one surefire way to make a good impression on a woman.<br /> <br /> Taking advantage of his high vantage point, he sprints for the edge of the roof and leaps off, the wings of a hawk sprouting from his scaled shoulders as he does, beating at the air to carry him towards his prey. His anima flares to life; silver trees and vines grow upon the roof behind him, and an image of his human form appears, casting a spear at the at the heart of the great shadowy bat before vanishing. He lets out an earsplitting screech just before impact, and slashes at the dark figure, claws cleaving the very light of their struggling animas as they seek the invader's throat.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Welp, might as well go all out on this. Four attack flurry, enhanced by a channel of Valor, and full Excellency. Assuming a 2-die stunt.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5514/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5514/view</a> 4 successes on join battle.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5501/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5501/view</a> 11 successes<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5515/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5515/view</a> 12 successes<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5516/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5516/view</a> 4 successes<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5517/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5517/view</a> 3 successes<br /> <br /> If any of them hit, base damage is 14L, before adding extra successes.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1419,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","user":"WarDragon","date":". 03-18-2015, 09:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T18:14:48-07:00","id":449966,"title":"","content":"The shadowy figure notices the great flash of silver and the beast flying towards him. He attempts to pull out his shield, but Nahuel makes it first. The great claws slash into the darkness in a great arc. The first strike hits the figure, striking his armor in a great &quot;clang&quot;, causing the claws to bounce off to the side and rends a small part of the flesh on his arm. The next swipe manages to strike his chin and opens what feels like a deep cut, even though it cannot be seen through the shroud. Among the darkness, blood can be seen flowing down the man's arms and onto the disc. The next two swipes seem to be too big of an arc, and the figure manages to move out of the way just in time, causing the air to ripple just a bit, from the extreme sharpness of the claws.<br /> <br /> &quot;My master told me of creatures like you. I did not believe him at first, thinking that they would just be plain animals. It looks like I will need to be more careful.&quot; The figure raises a large shield in front of himself, and continues to move away on his disc. he beings to chant, and his anima starts to pull together, lifting the blood off of the disc, through his swirling anima, and around his arms.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I noticed that you took off the two-die stunt from the rest of the flurry. I added them back in, so you don't have to do anything to fix it (I put on the record in OOC that a flurry with a stunt will have all attacks keep the stunt). It gave you an extra success on your second roll, but none on the third and fourth roll. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T00:07:05-07:00","id":450216,"title":"","content":"&quot;Unfortunately Splendor, you're absolutely right about how vulnerable this place is.&quot; Talos says as he climbs back up the stairs, the tool wielding automata silently turning and returning to the spaces between the gears as he left the forge. &quot;It's by no means made of glass and silk, mind you, but it certainly isn't a fortress.&quot; He raps a knuckle on the orichalcum machinery to make his point. &quot;Personally, I think whoever built this place had more than these little guys walking around,&quot; the scavenger prince gestures to the automata, &quot;He must have built larger ones as bodyguards and protectors. Or at least planned to, judging by the blueprints in the Library.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Speaking of,&quot; Talos grinned as he headed off down another hallway, clearly taking some sort of glee in showing off the manse, similar to a child showing his friends the new toys he received for Calibration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T22:27:39-07:00","id":451306,"title":"","content":"&quot;And I know of your kind,&quot; Nahuel snarls back. &quot;Marauder. Invader. Destroyer. Be as careful as you like; I have prepared all my life to fight such as you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Surrounded by a silver bonfire in the sky that sizzles and roars where it meets the other man's black aura, Nahuel's wings flaps powerfully, pouncing on his opponent again. His claws lash out with supernal speed and force, feinting to find a way around that shield and pierce through armor.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Two attacks this time, conserving essence. Dex 6 + MA 5 + specialty 1 + accuracy 3 + stunt 1 + Excellency 6 = 22 dice before flurry penalty. Spending an additional 2m on Rocks to Pebbles, increasing pre-soak damage by 3.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5553/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5553/view</a> 11 successes<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5554/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5554/view</a> 5 successes<br /> <br /> Base damage is 17L/2, including the charm.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T08:17:16-07:00","id":451535,"title":"","content":"Flynn sits quietly in the shadows observing the scene. While Nahuel fights the Abyssal, he watches the goddess. What is her reaction to Nahuel's sudden attack?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T20:50:55-07:00","id":453752,"title":"","content":"The figure cries out in great agony as the claws rend though him and cuts of his ear and the side of his face. The blood continues to flow mercilessly, but somehow, he seems to barely manage to contain the blood flowing through his anima and around his arms and he begins to slump down. As he begins to fall, the second strikes his shield, pushing it back, but bounces harmlessly off of his armor.<br /> <br /> In a rage, the figure yells, &quot;It looks like you do not know the power of blood. You have provided me with more power fool!&quot; You now notice that the blood has turned into whips in his hands and he wields them menacingly, and flicks them towards you. He barely manages to say,&quot;Watch as your attacks are used against you!&quot; as the whips seem to snake through the air all around you. A split second later, you are hit in the back by the whips flailing around you. You manage to deflect most of its power, but it whips you across the side of the head dealing 1L dmg. During the distraction of the hit on your face, he attempts to speed away on his vehicle. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Anita glances up at the start of the fight, but focuses her energy to kill the last of the skeletons, which she does with ease. After felling the last of the skeletons with her sword, she watches the battle in silence, as she runs to get directly beneath the two.<br /> <br /> Suddenly, a spear flies out from the edge of the forest towards Nahuel. Quickly noticing, Anita attempts to throw her shield into the air to block it, but alas her attempt fails, letting the spear hit Nahuel in the chest. The spear luckily bounces off his tough hide leaving only a small scratch, but it does push him back a bit. Immediately, you all notice the figure at the edge of the forest that hurled the spear. You also see a strange black aura surround the spear as it disappears. The figure in the woods then ducks back in the forest away from sight.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Haha.. he only managed to hurt you because of ping lol. Such a lucky roll for him. With his penalties, he was having some major problems. I didn't quite expect you to be able to disable him quite so fast... lol. And just so it hopefully makes a tiny bit more sense for you, you were both acting on the same tick both turns... I always let the player go first though. I did consider the spell to be &quot;complete&quot; by then, so they did not need to roll to maintain the spell and just used the &quot;cast spell&quot; action, since it was already &quot;formed&quot;.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T21:25:48-07:00","id":453783,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i><span style=\"color:#000000\">Over my dead body will someone say such nasty things then fly away. Someone might believe his threats and leave town. How can that person be of use to me if they flee? My course of action is clear. </span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\">Flying over the platform and the quarreling children he shifted to his hybrid form which he loathe to take. </span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\">The goddess better be overflowing with good will after this. Exposing myself could easy turn out to be a truly massive mistake. </span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\">Falling from above he aimed for the center of the dark mass, his naked tail twitching in the night air eager for its role to come. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Join battle </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5563/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5563/view</a> 1 succ 2wit+2awe=4 dice :/ the old man is so slow.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T23:00:04-07:00","id":453875,"title":"","content":"<i>Two of them. Bah. </i>Still, the sight of his enemy running away spurs his predatory instincts. <i>Finish the prey at hand before it can flee.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Your blood is weak. If that is all your power, you have already lost.&quot; Nahuel pursues his fleeing opponent, eager to put him out of everyone's misery. Twin claws reach out, seeking to box him in, as jaws gape wide to clamp down on anything in reach. His anima flares again, the image of the Yaxbalam warrior this time throwing a net over the great bat, to trap and bear it down.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Going for a clinch attempt this time to make sure he doesn't get away. <br /> Dex 6 + MA 5 + specialty 1 + accuracy 2 + what the hell another Valor channel 5 + stunt 2 + Excellency 6 = 27<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4802926/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4802926/</a> 9 successes<br /> (It says 6, but there's three 10s and it doesn't know to count them twice.)<br /> <br /> I've never been 100% sure whether you can crush the same action you initiate a grapple, but if you can, I do so. Base damage 10L.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T06:59:28-07:00","id":454200,"title":"","content":"Flynn follows the trajectory of the spear back to the woods. With the two Lunars busy with the Abyssal, it fell to him to deal with the new threat. He pulled his hood over his head and skirted the field of battle and headed towards the woods after the figure. Along the way, he picked up a rock from the ground and threw it at the figure's head. He doubted the throw would knock the retreating figure out, but it might slow them down.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I hope I'm doing this right: <br /> <br /> In case I need to join battle - 7 dice (4 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=96KDEPQJ\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=96KDEPQJ</a><br /> <br /> Throwing the rock at the figure - Dexterity 3 + Thrown 1 = 4 Dice (1 Success) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=H7W3R3A6\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=H7W3R3A6</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-23-2015, 10:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T11:26:46-07:00","id":454653,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Landing with a loud thud behind the dark figure The Servant wasted no time wrapping his arms around the public menace and his leathery tail snaking around his preys left leg. Blood immediately started soaking into his fur. </span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">*sigh* That will never come out.</span></span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"> He said nothing as he did this believing that Nahuel's actions had communicated there feelings better then he ever could with mere words. Not wanting to allow further escape The Servant having firmly grasped the villain, he jumped. Jumped towards the direction of the town off of the platform. </span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">This is going to hurt.</span></span></i><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">Assuming one die stunt 4 strength + 2 MA + 1 two hands + 1 tail +1 Stunt = 8 dice</span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5590/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5590/view</a> 5 succ<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T16:06:07-07:00","id":454973,"title":"","content":"The figure had almost seen everything there was to see in creation now. His sailing the seas taught him much of creatures in the depths, heading into ports from the north to the south taught him about the extremes of weather. Nearly dying to a Solar taught him of powers he never imagined. Being saved by creatures of the dark and receiving power to live again taught him about the tricks and frailty of life, and granted him to see the side of power. The extreme tortures of his deathlord master turned his mind inside out. And now, he has seen two individuals transforming in battle to rip him to shreds. There was not much left for him to see in the world. And now he knew that he was bound to die again.<br /> <br /> As the crow flies behind him, he gets an ominous feeling. He knew that another one must have arrived. Dropping down from above, The Servant transforms into his war form and grapples the figure with his arms and tail. In that second, the figure screams out a very disconcerting scream as memories of death wash over him again. He knew this was his last moment. He would not be saved now. And he knew his master would massacre his body as soon as his armies arrived. There was absolutely no hope for him. He continued to bleed out and looked upon his enemies. The Servant had managed to quickly clinch him and shoved him off to the side, but the disc follows him, keeping them both in the air and causing no damage from a fall.<br /> <br /> &quot;Finish it quickly. I dare not wait long enough for news to get back to my master. Who knows what he could do to me even in my permanent death.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Since The Servant has already succeeded in a clinch, do you wish to change your move? If not, you can always clinch him still and combine attacks with The Servant for an even more powerful crush attack. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Flynn lobs the rock, but it merely bounces off a tree about 10 feet away from the figure. It seems not to care as it disappears even further into the forest.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> If you wish, you can start a tracking contest with wits+survival. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T16:40:06-07:00","id":455018,"title":"","content":"<i>I\u2019m being stupid</i>, Flynn thinks. He changes his strategy.<br /> <br /> \u201cHey! Wait! I just want to talk!\u201d He projects his voice using all the tricks from his years of vocal experience.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Using Heart-Brightening Presentation Style (Sidereal p. 146; Errata p. 65) to use 2<sup>nd</sup> Performance Excellency as a Presence Excellency.<br /> <br /> Spending 4 motes for 2 successes.<br /> <br /> Manipulation 5 + Presence 3 = 8 Dice (9 Successes). - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=REMDBPAJ\" target=\"_blank\">57(8d10) = 57</a><br /> <br /> Flynn has spent 12 motes of Personal Essence. <br /> <br /> Also, Flynn is not wearing any Resplendent Destiny right now.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-24-2015, 12:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T18:29:55-07:00","id":455150,"title":"","content":"His enemy gripped tight in the claws of two Chosen of Luna... and he still won't shut up. Nahuel's jaws gape wide, and clamp down on the deathknight's head, cutting off his yammering. He plants a forepaw on the man's shoulder, then crunches down, and pulls back, hard. If, as planned, the dark man's head comes clean off, he spits it out, and a few more times to get the taste out of his mouth.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you outlanders always talk so much before you die?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T20:57:05-07:00","id":455340,"title":"","content":"The figure appears in a different area of the forest next to Flynn and turns back to talk to him. A woman with scars alongside her eyes and light, almost purplish skin turns to face him, around 100 yards away.<br /> <br /> &quot;Then speak from there and make it quick, or I will have your head. If I don't like what you say, there will be more hell to pay for you too. There already will be more for some.&quot; She then glances towards the two lunars in battle, but from a safe distance where they will not notice her.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Once I get the convo from Flynn, I will finish the battle; it might affect a lot. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T06:17:29-07:00","id":455755,"title":"","content":"Flynn listens to the battle, trying to gauge when it will be finished. Fortunately, as a Musician, he can listen and speak at the same time.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who are you? What is your business in this town? Are you here to kill the Anathema?&quot; Flynn acts guarded and is ready to bolt.<br /> <br /> <i>I need to keep her here, until the others arrive to take care of her.</i> The less information about this town's defenders the Mask of Winters has the better.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Awareness - Listening to the battle - Perception 2 + Awareness 3 + Listening Specialty 1 = 6 Dice ( 5 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=KKUULKLU\" target=\"_blank\">38(6d10) = 38</a><br /> <br /> I'll post a nice long post after she answers the question.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-24-2015, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T17:10:37-07:00","id":456372,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Servant tossed the body to the side to stem the tide of foul smelling blood covering him.</span></span><br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">You savage barbarian! You just had to kill him. We could have gotten information out of him. I hope biting off a mans head will sait your blood lust for now.</span></span></i><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">A goodly number do chatter on, but hold. This fight is not yet over. Did you see where that spear came from?\u201d </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T17:17:36-07:00","id":456376,"title":"","content":"After asking the question, you feel that you might be in danger if you continue any longer. The woman hisses and says, &quot;I am the Thorn of Ages, and I am just here to make sure my Master gets what he wants;by any means necessary. Apparently, you have been to stupid to listen and understand. Either join my lord once he comes, or be destroyed. It is as simple as that.&quot; Suddenly, her brow begins to bleed a little and the mark of the Dusk caste appears. <br /> <br /> At that moment, you realize the battle will end in the next ten or so seconds.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Prior warning activated and told you that continuing your current course of action would result in something bad happening. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T17:54:31-07:00","id":456398,"title":"","content":"<i>I just need a few more seconds and the others will be here. </i>Flynn realized that a lot can happen in a few seconds.<br /> <br /> \u201cHear me, you fucking harpy. This town is defended. Your master will not find Puyo easy prey. Run back to that bastard of a deathlord and tell him that he better think twice about attacking. <b>Next time he discusses his plans, tell him that it would be in his best interest to delay his invasion or not attack at all.</b> \u201c<br /> <br /> As he says that last sentence, Flynn\u2019s caste mark lightly glows.<br /> <br /> \u201cAll your hopes of conquest will be for naught. You and your master will fail.\u201d<br /> <br /> Flynn prepares for the attack he knows to be coming. He prays to Venus to let him survive this night.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Flynn activates Presence in Absence Technique (Sidereals, pg. 146; Scroll of Errata, pg. 69) for five motes of peripheral essence. The Bolded line is the line to be used for the charm. I roll the social attack when it occurs, hopefully when Flynn has regained essence. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Flynn\u2019s caste mark is burning lightly.<br /> <br /> Flynn activates Duck Fate (Sidereal pg. 143; Errata pg. 63) , if she attacks. (I don't know if I need to state that before she attacks. It just says &quot;before opponent's attack roll&quot;. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Edited to add Duck Fate Activation. 03-24-2015, 09:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T18:27:12-07:00","id":456463,"title":"","content":"Completely missing the unspoken subtext of his fellow Lunar's question, Nahuel nods. He grins with blood-stained jaws, and flies in the direction from which the spear was cast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:09:41-07:00","id":456482,"title":"","content":"It is obvious that Thorn knows the battle is about to end as she starts to run back into the forest. &quot;I will deliver your message, but who knows if he will even listen to me.&quot; As she vanishes amongst the shadows of the trees, a spear flies toward you.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Please roll dex+dodge +2 for Duck Fate (+2 since you were already aware of danger from another charm)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As the second figure's head is bitten off, the disc begins to fall to the ground. Anita deftly catches it and puts it by her side. As Nahuel flies off toward the forest, she turns toward The Servant. &quot;Impressive. And who might you and your friend be?&quot; She takes a cautious stance with her shield and sword, but does not show any ill intent.<br /> <br /> Nahuel reaches the edge of the forest where the spear was cast. He sees a few footprints, and they seem to head east, but the path is lost a few feet away from where they start. Whilst looking, a puff of black smoke, like the one before can be seen from the south about 200 yards away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 03-24-2015, 10:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:25:42-07:00","id":456492,"title":"","content":"Nahuel dashes towards the black smoke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:35:41-07:00","id":456498,"title":"","content":"&quot;Shit!&quot; Flynn ducks out of the way of the spear. He runs to where he last saw the Abyssal, looking for her.<br /> <br /> His Lunar companions are about to head this way looking for who threw the spear and Flynn is in the forest with his anima banner up. This doesn't look good.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fucking bitch,&quot; Flynn cursing the Abyssal that left him in this mess. He hopes he can talk his way out of this.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Duck Fate Roll - Dexterity 3 + Dodge 3 + Bonus 2 = 8 Dice (5 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=M2Q4XWA3\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=M2Q4XWA3</a><br /> <br /> Awareness roll to find Abyssal - (4 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=XPFEW36H\" target=\"_blank\">33(5d10) = 33</a><br /> <br /> Flynn has used 15 motes of peripheral essence.<br /> <br /> His anima is at Soft Halo.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:01:45-07:00","id":456511,"title":"","content":"The spear misses Flynn and embeds itself in the tree behind him. Had he not tripped while ducking, and fallen over, the spear might have hit him, but alas he was safe thanks to fate (and a careful manipulation of it). The spear then vanishes in a black puff of smoke and Flynn looks around for signs of the Abyssal. He sees a flitting shadow in the distance heading east, but he is not sure if it was an animal or the woman. You also notice that Nahuel had already reached the forest and can be heard heading your way. He does not directly see you, but your anima could surely lead him to you.<br /> <br /> As Nahuel begins to run toward the black puff of smoke, he can see a faint light...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:06:40-07:00","id":456515,"title":"","content":"Flynn ponders whether he should follow the fleeting shadow or stay and try to talk Nahuel and convince him that this Sidereal here isn't the enemy.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Flynn is activating Wise Choice (Sidereals pg. 174) for 6 motes.<br /> <br /> Flynn's anima banner is at Burning Halo.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:14:41-07:00","id":456518,"title":"","content":"Flynn hears the silent whispers of fate in his ears and knows that it would be better to deal with Nahuel, rather than attempt to chase after Thorn, who obviously knows how to get around the forest quickly and quietly. There are many other potentially problematic fate strands in that path anyway... Fate seems to find the path of talking a much better choice....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:24:55-07:00","id":456525,"title":"","content":"Making sure his hood is covering his face, Flynn leans against a tree near the puff of smoke. He whispers a prayer to Venus he was taught not long after his exaltation.<br /> <br /> &quot;Beautiful Maiden, bring me your lust in the morning, and bring me relief and your blessing in the evening. Let me walk in dark places unharmed and let me come to you once more and sleep beside you and make love with you again.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn calmly waited for Nahuel to arrive and hoped that he would not met his death at his friend's claws. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> The Prayer was stolen from American Gods by Neil Gaiman. <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T21:36:45-07:00","id":456558,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Servent found himself face to face with </span>Anita the local player fully exposed in his wanted form. <i>Crap this is the chance I needed to bond with the local powers.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201cGreetings my fair lady.\u201d Bowing his rat head in respect.<br /> <br /> \u201cMy name is Nilverm and my fellow fighter is Nahuel Eyes-of-Fire. I am a friend of Fovnag and <b>was</b> here to discover why his town was being overwhelmed by refugees but it is clear now. We happened to be near town when we noticed the attack and felt obligated to prevent it. If that fiends threats carry any merit we are likely to stick around.\u201d <i>I have got to get out of here!</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Continuing in his is squeaky voice \u201c I beg pardon but I must get after my companion as there is another foul figure afoot in the woods.\u201d Acting as if it was an after thought \u201cOh and I would be in your debt my lady if you where so kind as to not make my presence known.\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Haveing said this he hastened to leave and prevent further expose. <i>Missing an opportunity to network is better then risking my cover and therefor life.</i></span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T20:37:06-07:00","id":458632,"title":"","content":"Nahuel lands in the clearing, and stalks around the stranger sitting down. He doesn't look like the brief glimpse he caught of the spear-thrower, but...<br /> <br /> &quot;What trickery is this? You attack us, and then sit here waiting? Do you mock me, after I slew your ally?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T20:48:49-07:00","id":458633,"title":"","content":"Flynn relaxes a bit when Nahuel doesn't attack him, but asks a question instead. <i>I'm a stranger to him and need to be on guard</i>, Flynn reminds himself. &quot;Oh, good. You killed the other death knight. I was afraid he was going to escape.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not the one who attacked you, Lunar. You think I'd be stupid enough to be sitting here, if I did? The death knight that threw the spear ran off into the woods. I tried to delay her, but she has some trick that allows her to disappear in a puff of smoke.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn points at where the Dusk disappeared. &quot;If you don't believe me, check the scent of where she was standing and compare it to my own. As a Lunar, you must have some form for tracking.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-26-2015, 11:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T11:20:20-07:00","id":461252,"title":"","content":"Glaring suspiciously at the man sitting on forest floor, Nahuel nevertheless does as he asks. He pads around the clearing, shifting his nose into a longer, thinner, canine snout, following the scent trails, and finally accepting that he is not being lied to.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who are you?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T12:36:42-07:00","id":461349,"title":"","content":"<i>It\u2019s complicated</i>, Flynn wanted to reply. Instead, he said, \u201cI am someone with a strong interest in keeping the people of this town out of the hands of the Mask of Winters.\u201d Flynn held out his hands to see how bright the halo of his anima was. He had a while before it faded, but he did not want to prolong this conversation more than he had to.<br /> <br /> \u201cShit, shit, shit.\u201d He considered his options. \u201cI don\u2019t have much time and there are things that you need to know. \u201c He would not allow Nahuel and the others to be in ignorance, if he could avoid it. A lack of knowledge could mean their lives and Flynn had enough on his conscience. <br /> <br /> \u201cThe woman who threw the spear at you is called \u201cThorn of Ages\u201d. She is one of the Mask of Winter\u2019s Deathknights. What is most important for you to <i>remember</i> is what a Deathknight actually is. The Solars have returned to Creation, but some of thier Exaltations have been\u2026corrupted. When the deathknight attacked me, the caste mark of Dawn bled on her forehead. \u201c<br /> <br /> Flynn slowly rose to his feet, not to startle Nahuel. He brushed off some leaves off of his clothes. \u201cAny mortal who dies in this town will become a ghostly slave of the Mask of Winters. Keeping these people alive will upset his plans. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you need to contact me, leave a message at the Magic Gourd for Little Blue Bird.\u201d Flynn knew there was a small chance that Nahuel will remember that later. But it was more likely that the Lunar would let Flynn leave if Nahuel thought he had a way to contact the mysterious man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T18:08:15-07:00","id":462940,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Upon hearing hearing a conversation and not the expected battle The Servant slowed his pace to maintain a semblance of calm. Walking in on the scene from behind the glowing figure he spoke.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well it's nice to hear that you dislike mass murderers but that does not explain why you stand idle when the town is in danger. You are clearly in tune with essence you could have fought alongside </span>Anita<span style=\"color:#000000\">.&quot; Continuing on without a breath.<br /> <br /> &quot;What are you that glow so brightly? How are we to be sure your cast mark does not bleeding and you simply got caught by my friend here before you could escape with your compatriot? That would explain why you so desire to leave would it not?&quot; <i>He would be damned if he let yet another mysterious figure in the woods go uninvestigated.</i></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 03-30-2015, 10:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T18:33:05-07:00","id":462970,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, you speak in nonsense stranger. And if you are a friend to us, why did you not aid us sooner? And why do you rush to leave now?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T18:45:57-07:00","id":462981,"title":"","content":"<i>What? Who the fuck are you? </i>Flynn thought, when the Servant walked up. <i>Is this Fovnag in a different form? Another Lunar?</i><br /> <br /> \u201cActually, I wasn\u2019t standing idle. There are more ways to win a battle than through force. I do not have fangs and claws like the two of you. My abilities are more subtle. I did what I could to help delay the invasion. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll admit that I am asking you to trust a mysterious man you found in the woods. I\u2019d be fucking suspicious of me too.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But I am not your enemy. I am already doing everything in my power to assist you in keeping this town safe. Shit, if you kill me now, you\u2019ll just be giving the Mask of Winters another ghost to enslave. If you detain me, I cannot do my job properly.\u201d<br /> <br /> &quot;I am trying to help you. I know it is difficult to believe, but it is the truth.&quot; Flynn silently curses the Broken Mask, Arcane Fate, and Karma for putting him in this position.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Flynn is trying to convince the Lunars to let him go.<br /> <br /> Using Heart-Brightening Presentation Style (Sidereal p. 146, Errata p. 65) to use Flynn\u2019s Performance Excellency for Socialize - 6 motes for three extra successes<br /> <br /> Manipulation 5 + Socialize 4 = 9 Dice (10 Successes)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=9YNNNMH4\" target=\"_blank\">50(9d10) = 50</a><br /> <br /> Flynn has used 27 Motes of Peripheral Essence.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Removing a success. 03-31-2015, 06:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T21:47:55-07:00","id":463130,"title":"","content":"&quot;I... believe him, though I could not tell you why. Perhaps I have simply seen too much that is strange for one day, and it no longer affects me as it should.&quot; Nahuel shakes his head, and stands up, reverting to his human form... though longer of leg than normal, and keeping the wings.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am going back to the town. They may need help, and I should meet this goddess Anita. Are you coming, brother?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T12:15:21-07:00","id":469521,"title":"","content":"Flynn stayed quiet as he listened the two Lunars decide his fate. He was hoping that this new Lunar was Fovnag in a different form. Not that Fovnag would recognize Flynn, but at least it was someone Flynn knew.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:23:27-07:00","id":476461,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile, back at the manse, Swimming Owl was <i>ooh</i>ing and <i>aah</i>ing over the fancy toys its owner was excitedly showing off. Mentally, she was taking notes. This place had the potential to be a veritable factory. If she could funnel enough resources into it, there was no telling what might come out...which was good. Hopefully the Mask of Winters wasn't already aware of the place, and she could throw a wrench into his plans.<br /> <br /> OOC: Sorta need something to work with to respond to, here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:27:07-07:00","id":476559,"title":"","content":"Talos eventually leads the group to another tower, this one with a large crystalline platform at the bottom. &quot;This is one of the tallest towers in the manse, and it's devoted to knowledge.&quot; He gestures to the walls surrounding the platform. Some of the slots on the wall had books and scrolls, but more than a few contained blue crystals with an orichalcum band around the center. &quot;I have yet to even read all of this stuff, but I'll show you the important part.&quot; With that, he taps the ground twice with his staff, and suddenly the entire crystal platform begins to rise. &quot;Like you said earlier, Owl, a place like this needs some form of defense. And I think whoever built the manse had something in mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> The scavenger lord walks over to another slot in the wall once the platform stops (about 200 feet above the ground floor) and picks up a crystal from one of the slots. &quot;The architect didn't build many defenses, but he had defenders in mind.&quot; He pressed a slot on the crystal and it began to glow. It began to project a 'picture of light', depicting a large statue. While the words projected next to the picture were in Old Realm, the details in the hologram seemed to show how to construct the 'statue'. &quot;Living mechanical warriors powered by Essence. Instructions on power sources, designs of various automata for both serving and combat, it's all here in the library. The little guys who brought us food are proof of this!&quot; He gestures to one of the small clockwork automata standing with them on the platform, &quot;Give me the proper resources, I can have an entire army of these things in a few short years.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T22:43:13-07:00","id":477549,"title":"","content":"Something had been bothering Splendor since they arrived, but only did did he bring it up as they encountered yet another tower.<br /> <br /> &quot;If you will forgive my impertinence, where is all of this located? When we arrived the entrance was relatively modest in height. However, the majority of meaningful locations have been located above ground level. While I have no doubt that much of the facility could be buried below the level of the swamp, the towers at least would have to project significantly. It also occurs to me that the structural mobility of the manse might also extend to the towers, though that would greatly increase their visibility. Even then, they would remain vulnerable to ingress and that appears inconsistent with the value of what we have seen so far.&quot;<br /> <br /> He was silent a moment as he considered what he said. He was beginning to feel like one of those children who is not enjoying themselves and decided to prevent everyone else from having fun as well. Still, this was important. The manse was too useful and central to far too many of the their plans to let things like that go unanswered.<br /> <br /> To hopefully ease some of the rudeness he continued, &quot;I must say I would like to look over these crystals further. Even the chance that they contain Schema of Transliminal Conception would make doing as an unimaginable honor.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T07:57:05-07:00","id":477926,"title":"","content":"Now this Swimming Owl liked. Libraries she wasn't too fond of after years of paperwork in Jupiter's perilous book-hoard... but sorcerous towers with blueprints for fell weapons and conquest? This is where she was destined to be.<br /> <br /> &quot;I love this place,&quot; she beamed. &quot;Huge, well hidden, contains it's own factory...this manse is going to change the shape of the economy around here.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T15:31:59-07:00","id":480816,"title":"","content":"As you are all talking, another figure goes up and talks to Anita, she does not seem concerned or on edge, so you know it must be someone from the town. After a short talk, the figure heads back into the town and Anita turns toward the forest. The group can see that Anita is slowly walking toward the glow of the anima that is being displayed. She does not seem to be in a rush, but just soldiers on toward the forest slowly, keeping her eyes peeled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:13:30-07:00","id":480843,"title":"","content":"<i>This is a fucking mess</i>, Flynn thought. He wished he could remember anything about Anita's Father. Was he a part of the Celestial Bureaucracy?<br /> <br /> Either way, it was probably not a good idea to flee away from the City Goddess. It would make him look guilty. Of course he had nothing to be guilty of in the first place. Except for being a Sidereal.<br /> <br /> <i>Fucking Arcane Fate.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;There is no need to go to the goddess for here she comes now. &quot; Flynn announces. He stands up straighter and waits for her to arrive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-14-2015, 07:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T17:27:04-07:00","id":480946,"title":"","content":"Nahuel goes to meet her halfway, regardless. He flies briefly through the trees, landing near her, his own silver anima separating from the stranger's blue one. He lands a short distance from the approaching goddess, and gives her a bow, of the kind he's been taught is polite throughout the civilized lands, hawk-wings spreading behind his broad shoulders as he straightens..<br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings, Anita Fairhand. I am Nahuel Eyes-of-Fire. I hope that my gift to you was pleasing?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1419,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","user":"WarDragon","date":". 04-14-2015, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T18:31:30-07:00","id":480986,"title":"","content":"Anita stop and murmurs &quot;A rather great &quot;gift&quot; indeed.&quot; She then looks you in the eyes and says, &quot;It is too bad we could not pull a plan from him first. That may have aided in defending. Nonetheless, I am glad to hear his voice cease. He has been a rather big pain in my side lately. This is the first time he has tried to fight though.&quot; After a moments pause she says, &quot;So what took you so long to get here? Were you staying in one of the small villages outside the town, or do you need a place to stay here? I can provide that fairly easily if you wish. I would also love to talk with you and your &quot;friends&quot;, if they are at least, at the council. Your information may provide helpful. Glancing to the side in the forest, she says and having SEVEN exalts in one area is nothing to sneeze at either...it could mean a lot of trouble or be our grace My intention is to find out. Also, I do want to know what your plans are and how we can coordinate... if possible. We could use your help with all the craziness going on lately.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T18:46:52-07:00","id":480994,"title":"","content":"<i>Seven? Two Sidereals, Two Lunars, and Two Solars makes six.</i> Flynn wonders who the seventh is<i>. Oh, Dodging Bullet, you sly dog! </i><br /> <br /> \u201cShall we go join the conversation?\u201d Flynn says to the Servant. He walks over to where Nahuel and Anita are standing, keeping an eye on the Servant as he does.<br /> <br /> \u201cI can assure you, my lady, we have no plans to trouble this town. It seems like you have enough trouble already with the deathknights knocking at your door. \u201c<br /> <br /> &quot;What do you know about these deathknights? You say that the floating man has been here before?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T20:03:43-07:00","id":481050,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">(OOC: Before </span>Nahuel approached Anita)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u201c<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">You are right stranger. This is highly suspicious. But I have larger things to deal with at the moment. I will not forget you and hope we can work together to end this threat.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYes let us be off my brother.\u201d Heading away from the stranger and away from Anita as to avoid her gaze for a short time. (OOC: Flynn might be able to hear this if he tries and maybe Anita depending if she tries.) Noticing Anita approaching he had to change plans quickly. </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>Why did I transform? Why? </i> He whispers to his raptor-cat comrade to prevent over curiosities ears. &quot; I need to ask a boon of you my brother. My war form is know to The Guild and its bounty hunters but my true form is not. It would be best if it remained that way. I ask you as a fellow son of Luna and for our quest to end The Guild not to refer to my fighting form by my name but by its name, Nilverm. Now I have go before I am completely exposed.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Having said his piece he turned away from the approaching goddess ignoring the stranger's chartering focusing to contain he panic at exposure. He took up a fair clip away from the crowd. Making sure no one is watching he shifted to Fovnag and headed parallel to the town as to circle about and intercept the conversation. <i>Can not let that stranger and primitive be the only ones in the discussion with the major player.</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> looking for lookers: 3 perception + 2 awareness = 5dice 2 succ. <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/6037/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/6037/view</a> </div></div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T20:11:44-07:00","id":481059,"title":"","content":"The Servant looks around and sees noone in the area. There are a few chirping birds off in the distance, but that seems to be all. After a minute you feel comfortable enough to transform, as you are certain you have not been seen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T20:26:18-07:00","id":481065,"title":"","content":"Nahuel nods in understanding, and agreement. &quot;As a son of Luna, I will respect your wishes, Nilverm.&quot;<br /> <br /> To Anita in the clearing a moment later, he smiles. &quot;It was my very great pleasure to pull this thorn from you, lady. I was at the home of one of my friends, a short way from town, yes, though I would not complain of being closer.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;The 'deathknight' spoke much, but little of use. I would not trust the words of such a one, even if he did claim to tell us of his aims. I was given warning by this blue-glowing, one, another foe of the deathknight; he claims that any who die here will rise as undead. I am not the best to answer questions of that sort,&quot; he admits. &quot;My gifts are those of the warrior. Gifts which I will be more than glad to put to use, in defending your home from such marauders.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T20:31:52-07:00","id":481070,"title":"","content":"Flynn quietly listens in on the two Lunars before heading over to talk to the Goddess. <i>Ah, so that is </i><i>Fovnag. </i>He assumed it was the same Lunar he met earlier, but it was good to have confirmation of this.<br /> <br /> <i>He must have hunted that man down to steal his shape</i>, Flynn thought to himself. He knew Fovnag was dangerous, but this was a bit worse than he thought. Though, Flynn himself wasn't innocent of murder either.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, there was a second deathknight hidden in the forest. I tried to delay her until this one,&quot; Flynn motions towards Nahuel, &quot;arrived, but she disappeared into a puff of smoke.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I have already made sleeping arrangements at a local establishment in town, but I thank you for your offer.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Listening in on the Lunars - Perception 2 + Awareness 3 + Listening 1 = 6 Dice (3 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=VW6JC6XM\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=VW6JC6XM</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-14-2015, 11:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T17:01:51-07:00","id":484036,"title":"","content":"Flynn hears all he needs to know... He is sure of the two and who they are. And knowing another secret is not a bad thing for a Sidereal...<br /> <br /> Anita turns to answer Nahuel first. &quot;Certainly he would spot many things, but it would be so simple to manipulate a mind like his. We could have gotten a bit more information from him at least. That is over with, so we have no choice but to do something else now. Your warrior's attitude would be more than welcome here. Our military is very small and has not been up to scratch. Several individuals were killed and reanimated,&quot; she says as she points over her shoulder at the heap of bones laying on the ground. &quot;A few others even deserted their post. They are not worthy to be around and are certainly not welcome here now. No use in having a warrior that does not try to fight for their land,&quot; she says with a slightly glazed over look. <br /> <br /> &quot;Well, if you wish to continue staying with this friend of yours, that would be fine, but I would be happy to give you a place here. Having you close would be a boon for this town I would guess.I would be more than happy open up a room for you in our town's golden inn.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning to Flynn, she says &quot;I am glad this one here already has a place in the city. I could definitely use your help. Your friend here has been an asset to me as well. Might I ask where you are staying so that I can find you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T20:37:13-07:00","id":484208,"title":"","content":"Flynn bows and with a straight face says &quot;If you need to contact me, leave a message at the Magic Gourd for Little Blue Bird. &quot; He turns to speak to the whole group. &quot;Unfortunately, I have to go take care of a few things before I turn in for the night.&quot; <i>Like arrange for messages to be left at the Magic Gourd</i>, Flynn thinks with a slight smile. &quot;I wish you all a very pleasurable evening.&quot; With that, the stranger turns to walk back to town.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Flynn hasn't quite left yet, if anyone wants to still talk to him. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:18:55-07:00","id":484236,"title":"","content":"&quot;This place is not as well hidden as you may think,&quot; Talos says with a frown, tapping his spear on the floor again. The platform they stand on begins to rise higher and higher until it reaches the open area of the top of the tower. &quot;Unfortunately Splendour, the entrance we used was a side entrance some distance from the manse proper. Less of it is underground than you thought.&quot; From here, it is clear that the manse was quite tall, and the other towers stretched high into the sky as well. &quot;It's pretty, useful and difficult for strangers to get around in, but the only thing defending the manse right now is how deep in the swamp it isThe only thing keeping this place from being attacked right now is that no one really knows where it is. That and the legends surrounding it, being haunted by dead anathema and their demonic servants and whatnot.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That being said, I don't think anyone nearby has mastered a force that could take this manse, so....we got time to set up some defenses?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:24:16-07:00","id":484243,"title":"","content":"&quot;Having a coward on your side is worse than fighting alone,&quot; Nahuel agrees with Anita. &quot;It would be my honor to dwell in your home, Anita Fairhand, and perhaps teach your warriors some of the ways of jungle fighting.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T09:05:57-07:00","id":485447,"title":"","content":"Anita smiles and hands Nahuel a card. &quot;Take this to the Golden Inn and hand this to the attendant. Tell them Anita says 'The gate has opened' and they will get you a nice room.&quot; <br /> <br /> She quickly turns to Flynn saying, &quot;Well F...'Little Blue Bird' I hope to get to know you a bit better soon. I am sure I will need to talk with you soon. I will leave a message for you then at the Gourd.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well I am tired and I am guessing you must all be tired as well. I need to take care of a few things and then will sleep. I bid you all goodnight and we will talk soon. Oh.. and little Lunar, please invite your other friend to come as well.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, she walks away into the town toward the priest's dwelling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T15:15:16-07:00","id":486757,"title":"","content":"Only the years of experience as a Sidereal keeps Flynn from not reacting when the goddess almost spoke his true name.<br /> <br /> <i>I\u2019m sure we will have much to talk about, Anita Fairhand,</i> Flynn thinks as he walks back to town. He has about a half an hour to kill before he can become the Musician again. Might as well put the time to good use.<br /> <br /> Keeping to behind the tree line as much as he can, Flynn heads towards the house of pleasure known as the Magic Gourd. He hopes no one would approach a flaring anima banner. A two story building with Cerulean blue banners fluttering from the balcony and porch, Flynn was familiar with the house due to a disagreement between the former Madame and the house courtesans about twelve years ago. How fortunate for the courtesans that one of their guests happen to had some medical training to sew up their knife wounds. Strange what skills a traveling musician picks up on the road.<br /> <br /> Flynn pauses by the back door to see if he could hear anything. Did the courtesans clear out of town with the rest of the mortals or did they hid in the Magic Gourd?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Listening by the back door of the Magic Gourd - Perception 2 + Awareness 3 + Listening 1 = 6 Dice (4 Successes)<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=NKWPCQYW\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=NKWPCQYW\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=NKWPCQYW\" target=\"_blank\"> http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=NKWPCQYW </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Flynn isn't expecting anyone at the Magic Gourd to remember him. That was a long gone Musician RD he used at the time.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-20-2015, 06:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T20:41:57-07:00","id":486987,"title":"","content":"Flynn realizes that quite a few people are still there, but not as many as there used to be. It could be that some left or that business changed in the last years, but who knows. Plenty of laughter and a few moans can be heard through the wall. There doesn't seem to be any conversation that really sticks out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-21T12:15:08-07:00","id":487501,"title":"","content":"Upon hearing voices in the pleasure house, Flynn heads back to the forest to wait out his anima banner and caste mark. Once he is able to pass as mortal, he will enter the Magic Gourd through the front door.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> I probably need to sit out my anima banner. I'm hoping that Nahuel needs to do the same. Otherwise, I can sit tight until time catches up with Flynn.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T07:33:12-07:00","id":492572,"title":"","content":"A short while later, those that had been in battle have the animas dissipate, letting them once again have a chance to look like like a normal person... and not a possible monster.<br /> <br /> It is now getting very dark and it would probably be best for everyone to get ready to sleep after a long day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T08:51:19-07:00","id":492610,"title":"","content":"Slightly disappointed that he would not be staying with Anita herself, Nahuel accepts the card. He finds the others and tells them where he will be, thinking it best to keep an eye on the town, as much as he liked the swamp around the manse. He returns to the Inn, and prepares to sleep his first night in a civilized bed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T15:48:01-07:00","id":492978,"title":"","content":"After talking with the Madam at the Magic Gourd, Flynn once again becomes the Musician. He looks for Nahuel and Fovnag, but is unable to find them. Instead he heads to a local inn and procures a room. He stretches out on the bed and tried to go to sleep. After tossing and turning for a few hours, he gets up and paces the small room. Alcohol always quieted his mind after a long day, but he would have to learn to fall asleep without it.<br /> <br /> He thinks about the events of the day. He might have blown his cover. His little stunt with the deathknight might cause more problems than it solves. But at least he did <i>something</i>. Flynn laid back down on the bed. He was tired of wallowing in grief. It was time to channel all of his grief and anger into more constructive activities. On that thought, Flynn manages to drift off to sleep.<br /> <br /> The next morning, Flynn rises early, unable to sleep any longer. He shaves and stares at himself in the mirror. His chin and cheeks look pale compared to the rest of his suntanned face. His eyes are bloodshot with pale blue circles underneath. He runs his hands though his long and raggedly hair. <i>Man, I do look like shit</i>, he thinks as he rinses his face. He ties his hair back and grabs his cloak. Pulling out the grocery list that he joked with Swimming Owl about the prior day, he heads to the Apothecary shop to restock his supplies.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I figured I'll have Flynn not reconnect with Nahuel and Fovnag until the next day.<br /> <br /> He is also careful before re-donning his Musician Destiny. I'll roll awareness if needed.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T18:18:17-07:00","id":493094,"title":"","content":"Splendor had slept. Thought he was no soldier, he had learned that soldiering art of being able to catch a quick rest whenever there was a moment of calm. It was one of many lessons on the road and one that he resented the most. When he woke the fatigue of the day was gone yes, but there was no peace of spirit such as he had once experienced each morning. He did not know if that peace would ever return, if he would ever be able to release the tension that kept him coiled like a spring at all times. If it did not, it was but one more charge to be leveled at the hundred stars.<br /> <br /> One mile away from Talos' manse, exactly as dawn broke, he spoke to a seemingly empty clearing. &quot;Tell me everything that happened.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 04-26-2015, 10:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T17:19:24-07:00","id":494112,"title":"","content":"Nahuel found the inn full of many of the best pleasures a man could want. There were great works of art all around the building made of stone, glistening in the essence lights in the main hall. The man at the desk took the card and made sure he received one of the finest rooms with a wonderful bed with plenty of pillows and fresh sheets. On the table lay fruit and an attendant stood by to help him. Needless to say, it was probably one of the most comfortable night he had ever had.<br /> <br /> A moment after Splendor had finished his sentence, his demon had come back to his side. &quot;Not much. Just a little tussle. Some skeletons, a flying man, and a spear wielding maniac. Nothing you don't see in hell on a near daily basis. Your acquaintances made short work of the flying man though. The hottie did appear though in good form. I mildly enjoyed watching her fight.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Flynn had easily slithered away and became the musician again with no problems and rested well through the night. Once he had gotten ready, he headed out of the building and toward the apothecary that a woman had pointed the way to. It was early morning, but not many people were out today. Luckily, the shop was still open and a grizzled, short old woman stood behind the counter. As you head in the woman speaks up. &quot;Oh. Good morning to you.. well it will be a good morning for you once you get some of my medicine. Here is some of my best drizzleweed. It should clear a hangover right up! That will get you looking perkier! Perhaps you could use some drakedust too. That will give you some more energy. It will be just the gusto you need!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T20:16:35-07:00","id":494290,"title":"","content":"&quot;Interesting. &quot;<br /> <br /> He considered in silence. He had suspicions about the woman that had caught Vorvin's eye and barely concealed a shudder at what that interest might mean.<br /> <br /> &quot;What of you though? I very much doubt you would do nothing more than watch when I had given you permission to slay something.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T14:53:48-07:00","id":495241,"title":"","content":"Flynn considers the various remedies the old woman offers. If they are legitimate, he will buy some. Flynn then produces the list out of his pocket. &quot;I'm going to need some Willowbark, Wormwood, Comfrey, Maiden's Tea, and some Poppy. Do you have any of that in stock?&quot; <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Roll to make sure the Old Woman isn't selling Flynn Snake Oil with her suggested remedies - Medicine 2 + Intelligence 3 = 5 Dice (1 Success) <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=L224UPHM\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=L224UPHM</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T07:09:51-07:00","id":498803,"title":"","content":"&quot;I didn't say that I didn't do anything. I helped take care of some pests where I could.... I just saw no need to get involved in that fight. It looked like it was handled. No need to get myself killed...&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn, you are not quite sure all the medicines she recommended will be the best help, but you do know that her materials are probably genuine. It certainly doesn't look like snake oil substitute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T21:45:53-07:00","id":499782,"title":"","content":"Flynn pays for his herbs and steps out on the street. He spends sometime searching for either of the Lunars. If he doesn\u2019t find them, he will start to head back to the Talos' Manse. He did leave his bag and Sanxian there. What was he thinking last night? He really needs to stop drinking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T14:05:29-07:00","id":502151,"title":"","content":"Fruit, on the table... kings do not live so well. He marvels at this for a moment before preparing to sleep.<br /> <br /> Nahuel has a hard time falling asleep in the strangely soft bed, but once he does, he is out like a rock. Between the unaccustomed comfort and his hard-fought battle the night before, he sleeps long past his usual waking time, after making only a moderate effort to seduce the girl who attended him. After waking the next morning, the first thing on his mind is food; if the inn does not immediately offer some, he flies out of town to hunt.<br /> <br /> After securing food, he heads back towards the manse, to tell the others what transpired, probably meeting Flynn along the way. &quot;There you are, Flynn. You missed all of the excitement last night.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T16:54:01-07:00","id":502303,"title":"","content":"Flynn pales at the mention of the night before. \u201cI have never been so terrified in all of my life. When I saw the darkness in the sky\u2026. I ran. \u201c He looks down, ashamed at having to lie to Nahuel.<br /> <br /> Hoping that Nahuel thinks that his nervousness is due to his supposed cowardly behavior, Flynn fiddles with the burlap bag containing his herbs and asks, \u201cDid you find out what was causing it?\u201d It would be good to get the whole story from Nahuel. Showing knowledge of events that the musician was not present at would be\u2026 awkward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T23:16:16-07:00","id":502551,"title":"","content":"Talos rose from his bed in the manse's 'master bedroom'. He got dressed in his usual clothes and looked at one of the little automata on the floor.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Let's fix up some breakfast for me and our guests. No reason to be a bad host.&quot;</i> He says to the automata in Old Realm. The clockwork machine gives a small salute, then scurries off.<br /> <br /> The scavenger lord picks up his spear and leaves the bedroom, thinking about his current situation. Less than a month as an &quot;anathema&quot;, and he had already found others like him. Well, Swimming Owl and Splendor at least. Hopefully Flynn and Narathul would return, they seemed like good people.<br /> <br /> Talos returned to the dining room and sat down at the head of the table. Reaching into his pocket, he took out one of the crystals from the Manse's library. He set it down and began to study the automata blueprints, waiting for his new friends to arrive for breakfast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T13:16:23-07:00","id":503298,"title":"","content":"<i>I know better than this.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Vorvin-Derlin, Slayer of Armies, by the oaths your masters swore and my power which binds you; tell me exactly what you killed and why you chose to stay out of the fight. You had the blood of the slain and a vessel of flesh to gain, and I know you and your hunger for these. What was more important to you than that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T13:42:32-07:00","id":503401,"title":"","content":"&quot;I took care of some thieves... vermin you might consider them... they ran away and I killed them. I took blood from them. There would not be much to gain from fighting with the others. My prey himself would have been a master of magic. I would not be able to hold against him. He had powers not unlike your own. Besides...there is no need for a vessel yet. One good enough has not yet come. But you should thank me for taking care of those pitiful, lawless humans. &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T14:30:52-07:00","id":503493,"title":"","content":"Splendor turned away from the demon and considered for a moment. Did he care about these thieves? No doubt hundreds of people had died last night. That these deaths could be traced back to him by a short causal chain and that should have made things different. It didn't though. If he looked into it he would probably feel differently. But should he? Was the security the demon provided worth these deaths?<br /> <br /> He found that it was.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4817192/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4817192/</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Did you dispose of the bodies?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T16:25:45-07:00","id":503603,"title":"","content":"&quot;Those scoundrels were taken care of. The beasts had feasted on them. They seemed to be very hungry and scared, so they ate as fast as they could. No need to worry. I will find some better vessels soon.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T22:24:50-07:00","id":506405,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile, in town, a large breasted woman from the pleasure house comes to see Flynn before he heads out into town during the night.<br /> There you are. A nice friend of yours came by to leave a message.&quot; She pulls out a small scroll wrapped in some twine and hands it to Flynn. &quot;Your friend asked me to personally deliver it... and help with anything you might need help with,&quot; she says giving a small wink.<br /> <br /> Several minutes later, four automata clamber back with a couple trays of food. One holds what you assume is an overcooked egg and the other holds some sort of cooked meat. By looking, you would guess crocodile, but who knows what they actually got. It does look as though it is healthy enough to eat. With a few clicks and clacks, they drop off the trays and a few plates for placing food and scurry off somewhere else.<br /> <br /> In the morning, a few people start to enter town from the edge of the woods. You hear some chatter among the townspeople that the army was defeated and that mighty warriors have come to defend the area. You hear a few tall tales here and there and talk about possible anathema, but nothing really stands out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":".  Fate and stuff... 05-07-2015, 09:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T06:36:51-07:00","id":506705,"title":"","content":"(Flashback time!)<br /> <br /> Flynn thinks back to the message he received before retiring the night before. In the privacy of his room, he cuts the twine and rolls open the scroll. He reads the message.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T16:59:37-07:00","id":507395,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hope I didn't throw a wrench in your plans. As you may have noticed, I have already talked with Anita. Maybe we should rendezvous? (If you're not to drunk to remember what that means). ~Dodging Bullet","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T18:12:13-07:00","id":507454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=502303#post502303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Flynn pales at the mention of the night before. \u201cI have never been so terrified in all of my life. When I saw the darkness in the sky\u2026. I ran. \u201c He looks down, ashamed at having to lie to Nahuel.<br /> <br /> Hoping that Nahuel thinks that his nervousness is due to his supposed cowardly behavior, Flynn fiddles with the burlap bag containing his herbs and asks, \u201cDid you find out what was causing it?\u201d It would be good to get the whole story from Nahuel. Showing knowledge of events that the musician was not present at would be\u2026 awkward.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nahuel scowls at the musician. &quot;That is shameful of you. A man, even a storyteller, should run towards danger, not from it. Were your uncles so neglectful that they never taught you to fight at all? We must correct this,&quot; he says sternly.<br /> <br /> &quot;It was caused by two of the ones you call 'deathknights,&quot; he continues, pronouncing the strange word carefully. &quot;One was fighting with Anita Fairhand, and turning the villagers into walking dead. I slew him. The other ran away into the woods and escaped.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T08:27:35-07:00","id":508116,"title":"","content":"Flynn noted that Nahuel didn't mention a glowing blue man in Nahuel's retelling of the events of last night. <i>Finally, Arcane Fate works in my favor.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I picked up some hand to hand combat from some caravan guards a few years back. But if one of these deathknights escaped, then I wouldn't mind some more training. It's best to be prepared.&quot; Flynn did need a sparing partner. Though he would have to downplay his ability for a while. <br /> <br /> <i>Or not,</i> Flynn thought, as he watched the wiry Lunar Warrior stalk his way though the woods. Nahuel could easily tear Flynn a new asshole. Flynn was enough of an asshole as it was. Having his Lunar friend gift him a second one wouldn't help on that front.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T20:58:43-07:00","id":508711,"title":"","content":"&quot;You should learn to use a weapon as well, since you cannot grow your own,&quot; Nahuel remarks. &quot;There was also a strange man, glowing blue, like one of the Chosen. I thought he seemed familiar for a moment, but then it faded... he warned us that anyone who dies in the town will become undead.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T21:11:44-07:00","id":508741,"title":"","content":"&quot;Weapon? What would you suggest?&quot; Flynn smiles as he remembers his Martial Arts instructor lecture on how a Sidereal needs no weapon expect for himself. <br /> <br /> <i>Well, so much for that, </i>Flynn thinks at Nahuel's mention of their meeting<i>.</i> &quot;Blue? Like a Water Aspect Anima?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T21:46:00-07:00","id":508751,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not know. Something I had never seen before.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you are not brave, then perhaps a bow,&quot; he says indulgently. &quot;But first, I would have to see what you know now. Seek me when you are ready.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T21:52:03-07:00","id":508755,"title":"","content":"&quot;A bow?&quot; That wasn't what Flynn had in mind at all. Perhaps recruiting Nahuel as a sparing partner was a bad idea after all.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, Flynn noticed putrid smell of the swamp around Talos' Manse. &quot;Hurrah! We have arrived!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T12:47:47-07:00","id":509193,"title":"","content":"&quot;If a bow does not appeal, there may be hope for you yet,&quot; Nahuel says with a clout on Flynn's shoulder. It's not a soft blow, meant partly as a test of his dodging or toughness. &quot;What have you been taught already?&quot;<br /> <br /> He breathed deep of the swampy air. &quot;Yes,&quot; he says with a smile. &quot;It is comforting, is it not? A cleaner smell than the stinks of the town.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T16:02:24-07:00","id":509284,"title":"","content":"&quot;Cleaner perhaps, but I believe I still prefer the scent of the Euthyphron Glade where gods and men take their rest among the roots of silver trees and the perfume of the flowers is heavy with the scents of poetry and repose. Though poetry always did have the oddest smell, like the fresh air of the early morning when you have been inside too long and absence of dust at the first fall of soft rain. Odd that both of those are awareness of absence.&quot;<br /> <br /> Splendor walked out from the forest, coming from the direction of neither the town nor the manse.<br /> <br /> &quot;My apologies, it was rude of me to eavesdrop. Though if I recall correctly we had made an appointment with a tailor for today.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T16:36:38-07:00","id":509298,"title":"","content":"Flynn instinctively evades Nahuel\u2019s friendly clout. \u201cHey! I didn\u2019t say I was ready yet!\u201d He carefully watches the Lunar out of the corner of his eye as he approached the manse entrance. \u201cI\u2019ve been taught some basic hand to hand. I was on a caravan with an Immaculate Monk was hired on as a guard. She showed me a few tricks for keeping myself alive should I find myself in trouble.\u201d <br /> <br /> \u201cGood Morning, Master Splendor!\u201d Flynn waves in Splendor\u2019s direction. \u201cYes, the Tailor. \u201c Flynn had forgotten about the Tailor. \u201cI am unsure that the tailor will be open today. There was trouble in town last night. Nahuel said that Puyo was attacked by.... deathknights, was it?\u201d He looks to Nahuel for confirmation. <br /> <br /> Flynn ducks inside the manse to find that his pack and Sanxian were still there. <i>Thank the Maidens</i>, Flynn thinks as he checks everything over. <i>Does this thing have a door bell?</i> he wonders as he looks down the dark hallway of spinning gears. <br /> <br /> \u201cHello?! Is anyone awake yet? \u201c Flynn yells into the clockwork maze.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-09-2015, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T18:17:16-07:00","id":509361,"title":"","content":"&quot;I know. You might never be ready. 'Basic' will not keep you alive, against an enemy who is determined enough,&quot; he says sternly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, deathknights,&quot; he says, again pronouncing it slowly. One of them was... slightly difficult to kill.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T19:43:37-07:00","id":522791,"title":"","content":"Flynn hears his voice echo down the hallway of the manse, but there is no response. He sighs and walks back to the two men, waiting in the clearing. <br /> <br /> \u201cShall we see if the tailor is open?\u201d Flynn suggests.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T20:41:03-07:00","id":522859,"title":"","content":"After a short while. The Servant pops out into the clearing. &quot;Ah. If you have the time, I would like to talk with you Nahuel.&quot; Turning to Flynn he says, &quot;Hello Flynn. I am going to borrow some of Nahuel's time for a short while. Do feel free to pop away and check on the tailor. I do think we should be able to find our way there shortly after you. I would definitely like to get caught up on some events last night.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Shall we go Nahuel?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T20:54:56-07:00","id":522891,"title":"","content":"&quot;But we only just arrived. This is a good time to start your training, in this place of peace,&quot; Nahuel tells Flynn. He is interrupted when the Servant approaches from out of the manse.<br /> <br /> &quot;As you wish. Flynn, when I get back, see if you can hide from me.&quot; He leaves with what he is certain the other Steward from last night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T21:13:44-07:00","id":522905,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hide? Are we playing children's games now?&quot; Flynn mumbles to himself as he begins the long walk back to town.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T21:51:42-07:00","id":522926,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you know as little as a child, then that is where we must begin,&quot; Nahuel says sternly. &quot;If you can strike your enemy before he knows you are there, you have already won the battle.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T22:49:03-07:00","id":522961,"title":"","content":"Splendor had not always enjoyed getting new clothing. In fact, Agralzo had told some of the most embarrassing stories about that early dislike. Then the great god had been referred to Mistress Ariadne. At first the, still very young, mortal had been afraid of the many armed goddess. Then she had made him a new outfit. Watching her spin the silken garments about him had amazed the boy. She had explained the meaning of every knot and fold, until Splendor had felt like he was wearing a story like his father would tell him before bed. He had never minded going to the tailor then. In fact, there had been more than a few times he had let his clothing get damaged just to have an excuse to visit Ariadne again and hear the story of the new cloths he was getting. Given what he later found out the weaver goddess charged, it was lucky for him that Agralzo was not a poor god.<br /> <br /> Smiling at the memory of happier times the Solar spoke to his companion.<br /> <br /> &quot;I hope this will not inconvenience you overmuch. After you have made the introductions I am sure you will have some time for your own affairs while my new garments are prepared. Do you have any particular suggestions? I believe the feast of the Maiden Who Once There Was is nearly upon us, though festival clothing might be outside our price range.&quot;<br /> <br /> That should have been a safe way to show that he was not entirely as disconnected as he seamed. The Feast was a relatively quiet affair in Heaven, where aspirants sought sifus, students demonstrated their accomplish on the lotus path, and onlookers meditated on the lessons on display. Well, that was how Agralzo and he had spent it. There was always someone throwing a party somewhere, but that was just Yu Shan. Surly creation wasn't <i>that</i> different. The clothing had been equally subdued, which would give Flynn the chance to offer his opinion, one of the best ways Splendor knew to make a good impression on someone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-21-2015, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T07:10:34-07:00","id":523144,"title":"","content":"\u201cMaiden Who Once There Was? I don\u2019t remember that goddess being on the Immaculate Calendar\u2026\u201d Flynn says carefully. <i>Maiden\u2019s Titties, did his father never bring him to Creation? Is he really that na\u00efve? </i>Flynn was dismayed. Apparently not everyone in Yu-Shan had the benefit of the broad curriculum that the Sidereals subjected Flynn to.<br /> <br /> Flynn must find a way to education Splendor about Creation before he says the wrong thing to the wrong person. And Flynn must find a way to do it without revealing himself as a Yu-Shan native as well.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s no problem at all. I need new clothes myself. \u201c Flynn pokes his finger though a hole in his cloak. The cloak was ripped during his race through the woods the night before.<br /> <br /> Anyways, Flynn wasn\u2019t going to let this Solar wander around town alone. It was probably best that Creation did not celebrate the Festival of the Maiden who once there was. After all the traditional festivities, Flynn and the other Sidereals often would go party crashing. Once Flynn found himself desecrating the streets of Yu-Shan with his puke.<br /> <br /> &quot;Splendor, tell me about your childhood? Where did you grow up?&quot; Sometimes the direct approach was the best approach. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Flynn and Splendor might have grown up in the same place, but they have very different experiences of Yu-Shan.<br /> <br /> Flynn also has Prior Warning up. That should give him some warning when Nahuel comes to find him. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":".  Add the last question to give Splendor something to work with. 05-21-2015, 01:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T18:15:01-07:00","id":523823,"title":"","content":"Splendor was quiet for a time as they walked, as though he didn't mean to answer. At last he opened with. &quot;The Wyld, grieving under an alien sky as my father's friends debated weather it would be wiser to abandon me. But that isn't what you were really asking.&quot;<br /> <br /> He was quiet again, his mouth in a small smile and his eyes filled with pain.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't actually know the city's proper name in Fire or Forrest tongue. It translates to 'Jade Mountain'. My father was a bureaucrat, who hated his job and loved his work if that makes sense. He did most of the paperwork in his workshop, which used to drive his assistants mad with the informality of it. They never said anything though, he was far too important. Well, never directly. I think they made a game of how many ways they could disapprove without crossing the line into rudeness. We lived near the center of the city, near his office which he did visit from time to time. My peers all called it 'the city' as though everything past the city center was some sort of outland.<br /> <br /> I wasn't my father's natural son. I was nine before I even knew why that might matter. We spent more time at father's manse than anywhere else, but we often went to visit his friends, when they weren't calling on him. Inventors, sorcerers, artisans, authors, it seemed like he knew everything in Creation who made new things. When I picked up on that, is when I started trying to make things. I knew he was important, but when I started to learn how just how important, and how illustrious his guests and friends were, it made me feel like I didn't deserve his time. Don't mistake me, he never even implied it. No matter what he was doing he always made time for me.<br /> <br /> I think it made him a little sad when I went away because of that. Maybe he felt that he hadn't done enough to encourage or praise me. He did, but...<br /> <br /> Last calibration was the first time I had seen him in five years. Nominally it was to present him with the first work of high artifice I had made. Which was tradition of course, but it is amazing how much less exuberant you feel when you aren't just leaving something in the temple like the other apprentices. We met at my 'aunt's party. She wasn't actually my aunt you understand, just a good friend of my father who I always assumed was more than a friend.<br /> <br /> That's why I am alive by the way. The party was in an orchard in the southern parks. It meant I was near enough to the outer wall to make it through a gateway. From there it was south-east to the Wyld and hopefully an escape from persuit, then north-west to the grey river and eventually Swimming Owl.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Guess what Yu-Shan literally translates to <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> You mean Yu-Shan isn't a city of endless delights and enlightenment where no law is necessary because righteousness and virtue have passed away before the self evident Way?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T19:23:24-07:00","id":523846,"title":"","content":"A thousand questions raced though Flynn's mind. He decided to ask the most innocent yet dangerous of all of his questions. &quot;Splendor, what happened that night at the party?&quot;<br /> <br /> He realized that he had to give a little in exchange for what Splendor has given him.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was an orphan too. I don't remember much about my early life but that my father was a musician.&quot; Flynn smiled as he patted his Sanxian case. &quot;I was taken in by Jericho's family as a child. They owned a horse ranch in Harborhead. &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;To be honest I was never good with horses, which caused some problems. When I was old enough, I left that ranch, never realizing that it was only home I'd ever knew. I didn't return until I heard about Jericho's exaltation. &quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn looked out in the distance, &quot;I traveled with Jericho for months, trying to outrun the Wyld Hunt. They caught up with us while we were racing towards the pole of wood. We heard as you must have that the Wyld Hunt can't track you in the Wyld.&quot; Flynn pauses. &quot;We never made it. I still have nightmares of watching his anima fade as he died.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't know why they didn't kill me.&quot; he said honestly. Why did the Bronze Faction keep him alive after he betrayed them? &quot;Perhaps they had seen enough death that day. Perhaps I was pathetic enough looking that they thought I would die anyways.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Not while Flynn was there! Flynn knows every nightclub and every bar in Yu-Shan though. Probably places Splendor has never even heard about. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Flynn's RD back story - Manipulation 5 + Socialize 4 + Gem of Grace 2 + Resplendent Destiny Bonus 3 = 14 dice ( 7 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=H4NLXENR\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=H4NLXENR</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T19:53:50-07:00","id":523864,"title":"","content":"As soon as The Servant believes he is out of earshot, he says &quot;So Nahuel, you have seen my true form. I would ask you not to divulge this information to anyone else. Please call me Fovnag anytime you see me in that form. I am.... wanted... for various reasons and do not wish to let this form be known. I have come too far to lose this form. In the heat of battle, I lost my composure and showed another form. I do not want this to ruin our plans. Until the time I can prove my worth and negate being wanted, I must be careful. As a fellow lunar, you are the only one I feel I trust with this information. Those other individuals are not as trustworthy. I believe some of them are the spies of heaven that my master told me about.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Servant then beings to look around. &quot;I have a feeling we are being watched now, but I cannot confirm it. We should put this talk on hold until we know. Can you see them?&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Roll per+ awareness if you wish to check </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T21:27:17-07:00","id":523968,"title":"","content":"&quot;It was the first night of Calibration. I had stopped by my old tailor to get something appropriate, which I am still wearing under all this, so I was a little late. When I arrived father was already there. My aunt sent both of us to a small grove a little way past where the party was taking place. I was being formal, by which I mean stupid, going through all the proper protocol for presenting him with the artifact. He interrupted me a third of the way in, threw his arms around me, and said 'Don't worry, I'm allowed to find news ways of doing things.'<br /> <br /> After that it was like.... no it was better than old times. We talked about what we had been doing, what we had learned. Little things, but we were happy. I wont bore you with all of it.&quot;<br /> <br /> He swallowed, just to give himself some time.<br /> <br /> &quot;There were three of them that came. They said some things, father replied. I can't remember most of it, except for the Joybringer. Maybe it was the irony of him being there for murder that stuck in my mind. He said, 'They will come for you, and you would have sheltered them. They would have called for you, and you would have answered them. They would have trusted in you, and you would have lived up to that trust. These things cannot be.' There was blood on their knives... Swords, they were swords. Starmetal always looks too small for an Exalted's weapon.<br /> <br /> Father was unarmed. He broke the oath he must have sworn and broke a branch from one of the sacred peach trees. I had never really seen him use the full of his power; before he had brought it into a guard stance it was a sword club. Some of the other guests had started running toward us when they heard the commotion, but they stopped when they watch father touch the wood. He was alone when the fighting started. I knew he couldn't win, and all of them knew it as well. It was almost like a formality, just going through the motions.<br /> <br /> I had no weapon, just the artifact, a hammer, I had forgotten about. It was not a weapon, but right then that didn't matter. I reached for it and ran at the nearest Sidereal. It was the blue one, and his back was turned. I don't know how he didn't notice me. His magic should have alerted him. For whatever reason it didn't, and I hit him in the back of the head. I heard his skull crack , but what really stood out was how yellow everything looked in the after image. I left the hammer on the ground. I had never killed anyone before. Then I saw why he hadn't been paying attention.&quot;<br /> <br /> Splendor's fist tightened.<br /> <br /> &quot;Father's body was pinned to the ground, skewered like a beast! I couldn't think, I wanted... but the Sun hadn't listened to what I wanted. Someone, maybe me, had called for the guards posted outside the orchard and they were coming. I had murdered one of the Exalted and father's body was visible. Some of his subordinates, other guests, had gotten close. They covered me when the guards tried to arrest the Viziers and I fled. Some of them went with me.<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl can tell you the rest better than I can.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Manipulation 1 + Socialize 1 =2 dice (2 successes)<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4818105/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4818105/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4818105/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4818105/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Splendor is keeping something back. Or Arcane Fate.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-22-2015, 01:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T11:42:55-07:00","id":524598,"title":"","content":"<i>I wonder which one of us he killed?</i> Flynn thought, as Splendor told his story. Of course Splendor would remember the Joybringer of the three Sidereals who killed his father. <i>Best not be put in a situation where I\u2019d have to reveal myself.</i><br /> <br /> Flynn\u2019s anger with the Unconquered Sun surfaced when Splendor mentioned him. His fist was white as he tightly squeezed the strap of his Sanxian case. <i>That bastard exalts someone and leaves them to fend for himself. At least the Maidens take some interest in their chosen.</i> Still it is not a good idea to start ranting about Splendor\u2019s patron. <br /> <br /> Once he controlled his anger, Flynn decides that it would be best to change the subject to something lighter. \u201cWe have a long walk ahead of us. Would you be so kind to teach me \u201cThe Tower Clad With the Sky\u201d? There is no one around besides us and the trees, if you are embarrassed to sing.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T14:54:29-07:00","id":524780,"title":"","content":"Seeing the look on Flynn's face brought Splendor to a halt. \u200b<i>That was beneath me. I should not have upset him so. Everyone deserves heroes and my words have made me all to human. He deserves better than me. I will do better.</i><br /> <br /> He grinned sheepishly. &quot;Part of my reservation was actually that the song is choral.&quot; He picked up a stick and began to make marks in the dirt. &quot;Do you know this notation? Its probably fairly old fashion.&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PXE2jxtn9-k\" target=\"_blank\">He sketched out the score quickly, the lyrics beneath.</a><br /> <br /> &quot;The song is a little odd now that I think about it. It is the tower itself that is supposedly singing, the song its feeling at pushing the boundaries of the world a little farther. I can sing each part, though you wouldn't really get the full effect.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T15:26:06-07:00","id":524799,"title":"","content":"Flynn hums the tenor line, having no trouble reading the ancient notation. In his excitement of learning an unknown song, he forgets himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do you sing Baritone? Bass? &quot; Flynn calms himself down, realizing how foolish it would be for two men to try to recreate a whole chorus. They might be Exalted but they were only two voices between them. He digs around in his bag and pulls out a pad of paper. He quickly copies down the score.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shit.&quot; he mumbles, having never cursed in Splendor's presence before. <i>How what this lost? What else lies in this Solar's memory?</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Flynn could probably make a fairly educated guess at what Splendor's vocal range is. I'll change the post if Splendor is a tenor.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T17:27:34-07:00","id":524941,"title":"","content":"&quot;Baritone.&quot; Picking up on the musician's thoughts he said, &quot;Pity there are only the two of us, it has been a long time since I heard it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T20:30:20-07:00","id":525042,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't know how much trouble these death Knights are going to cause us, but it might be a good idea to set up shop someplace closer to town. The manse is nice, but it would be a better fall back point then a base of operations.&quot; <br /> <br /> Flynn thinks for a moment. &quot;I wonder if the owner of the Sailor's Grotto is going to rebuild or is looking to sell the land. The business had a prime location, though poorly run. We are going to need some sort of front for our scheme. Or at least a Tavern we can conduct business. &quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn remembers the night before and his moment of weakness. Wine had never tasted so sweet. &quot; &quot;Perhaps a tea house would be better.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T09:21:39-07:00","id":525520,"title":"","content":"Suddenly, Flynn and Splendor hear a tenor voice singing the part in the song. A red-haired man, who looks to be about 30, walks into the clearing whilst carrying a large sack over his shoulder. &quot;Sorry to interrupt, but that is one of my most favorite songs. Not many people know that one. And it is all to rare to find enough people to sing it properly. I did once craft a music box for me, but it does not sound anything like a group of voices singing it. Nothing can beat that.&quot; The man looks thoughtfully off into the distance for a second before looking back at Flynn and Splendor.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, please forgive me. I never introduced myself. I am Nosak Firehands. I am a purveyor of goods and secrets. I explore around seeking wisdom whilst selling goods and secrets to survive. I did not expect to come across people here in these woods. Are you on your own quest?&quot;<br /> <br /> For Flynn:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Flynn realizes that this is Dodging Bullet in one of his resplendent destinies. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T10:27:18-07:00","id":525581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=523864#post523864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As soon as The Servant believes he is out of earshot, he says &quot;So Nahuel, you have seen my true form. I would ask you not to divulge this information to anyone else. Please call me Fovnag anytime you see me in that form. I am.... wanted... for various reasons and do not wish to let this form be known. I have come too far to lose this form. In the heat of battle, I lost my composure and showed another form. I do not want this to ruin our plans. Until the time I can prove my worth and negate being wanted, I must be careful. As a fellow lunar, you are the only one I feel I trust with this information. Those other individuals are not as trustworthy. I believe some of them are the spies of heaven that my master told me about.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Servant then beings to look around. &quot;I have a feeling we are being watched now, but I cannot confirm it. We should put this talk on hold until we know. Can you see them?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Roll per+ awareness if you wish to check </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Nahuel is silent for a moment, in thought. &quot;I would that being one of Luna's Chosen were a thing of pride, to wear openly before all... but I was warned by many that this is not so. I would ask why you are 'wanted' and by whom, but those are your stories to give if you choose, not mine to demand. I do not know of these 'spies from Heaven' that you worry of, though my mentor spoke of such things once... I dislike feelings of mistrust and suspicion between comrades, and all of us are in this business together.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Still... you are a fellow Lunar, and so my brother. As a warrior of the Yaxbalam, I cannot lie to anyone who has not declared himself my enemy... but I will not speak of your true nature to any who do not ask outright.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stops at the end, and focuses his senses...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">3 successes on perception + awareness roll. <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7029/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7029/view</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1419,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","user":"WarDragon","date":". 05-23-2015, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T12:45:44-07:00","id":525795,"title":"","content":"<i>Shibboleth...</i><br /> <br /> Upon hearing the song Splendor raised his hand as though in greeting. The kapithaka mudra, innocuous enough especially from a distance, was his secret sign to ready Vorvin-Derlin. He knew the stories, and since Calibration he had begun behaving as if all but the most terribly outlandish were true. Only those rumors that would have ensured he was dead already had been discarded.<br /> <br /> It was probably nothing, coincidences did happen. That didn't mean he would trust them. Flynn could answer with words, the musician was the better speaker. If he opened his mouth something arrogant and entitled would probably come out, and he refused to be that person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 05-23-2015, 06:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T17:44:22-07:00","id":526099,"title":"","content":"Flynn casually closes his notebook and puts it in his bag. &quot;We have business in Puyo this afternoon. &quot; He studies the merchant carefully. &quot;Are you on your way to town as well?&quot;<br /> <br /> Dodging Bullet must have been close enough to hear Flynn humming the tenor line. Best not to draw Splendor's attention to this. Who knows how the Solar would react to a stranger listening to the story of his father's death.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-23-2015, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T10:40:07-07:00","id":528952,"title":"","content":"As Nahuel stops to sense his surroundings, he notices a strange bug he has not seen in the area before. And that bug seems to be watching them and just staring.....<br /> <br /> &quot;Well I was not going into town, but I can help you out if need be. I may be a traveler, but I know my way around every town I have been to. I have some wares that this man here might want...&quot; he says as he points to Flynn. &quot;But I do not have any clothing that might fit you young sir. I can show you where the best tailor is. I didn't hear that he ran from town. He can be a bit expensive, but his clothing is MORE than worth it. Would you like me to show you the way? And perhaps you can look at some of my wares as we walk? Or perhaps you could benefit from some information? I also do accept information as payment, but it had better be really good information.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:36:24-07:00","id":529051,"title":"","content":"Flynn crosses his arms and asks skeptically &quot;Wares I might need, huh? What exactly are you selling?&quot; He could not appear to be too friendly with this &quot;traveling merchant&quot;. Flynn has invested too much into the Musician to risk his cover being blown.<br /> <br /> &quot;It is good that the tailor did not flee town. Hmm... last time I was here the tailor was a woman. Perhaps she sold her shop. The new one is more expensive you say?&quot; Flynn pretends to look troubled by this. He had enough money to buy the entire shop if he wished, but Flynn did not plan to let Splendor know that.<br /> <br /> <i>Ask open ended questions. Give Dodging Bullet a chance to relay what he needs to, </i>Flynn thinks.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> This RD is so shady. I'm expecting Dodging Bullet to open his trenchcoat to reveal a selection of knock off rolex watches.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-26-2015, 03:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:41:52-07:00","id":529280,"title":"","content":"The man opens the bag to pull out a few items. &quot;Of course I have this here clothing, but it would only fit you. Your friend here is just a bit bigger than you. He would definitely need to go to the tailor.&quot; The clothing is of the Eastern Style, a light tan tunic along with a long, green robe. It also comes with a hilt for a sword.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Kind of like this: <a href=\"http://imgs.inkfrog.com/pix/gdalsf/Royal_Court_Doublet.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://imgs.inkfrog.com/pix/gdalsf/R...rt_Doublet.jpg</a> but with a green tunic under instead. It looks to be of high quality though. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;I also have some wax here for your instrument. And some balm for you hands. Don't want your fingers hurting as you play after all. I do have some other objects here, but those would be VERY expensive, so maybe we should hold off on those. I COULD tell you the stories behind them though, which might give you more material for your songs....but let's head to town while we talk.&quot;<br /> <br /> He then turns to Splendor. &quot;As for you, I do have this convenient dial. It will show you the time of day whether you are able to see the sun or not. It is said to be blessed by the Unconquered Sun himself. It is adjustable and should fit on your wrist quite nicely. Or if you don't like that, I do have a nice dagger. It was made from a very good blacksmith. It is one of the highest quality!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 05-26-2015, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:47:06-07:00","id":529282,"title":"","content":"&quot;Material for my songs...&quot; Flynn considers the merchant's words. &quot;I'll make a deal for you. A story for a song? It is a long walk back to town and it will help pass time.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-26-2015, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T15:33:57-07:00","id":529347,"title":"","content":"If he agrees, Flynn will start clapping out a rhythm and start singing one of the songs he himself composed. This version has a few changes to the lyrics. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8obrc0eA6gk\" data-code=\"8obrc0eA6gk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/8obrc0eA6gk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Blackbird claw, raven wing<br /> Under the red sunlight<br /> Long clothesline, two shirtsleeves<br /> Waving as we go by<br /> <br /> Hundred years, hundred more<br /> Someday we may see a<br /> Woman king, wristwatch time<br /> Slowing as she goes to <b>reap</b>.<br /> <br /> Black horse fly, lemonade<br /> Jar on the red ant hill<br /> Garden worm, cigarette<br /> Ash on the window sill<br /> <br /> Hundred years, hundred more<br /> Someday we may see a<br /> Woman king, sword I hand<br /> Swing <b>for</b> some evil and bleed.<br /> <br /> Black hoof mare, broken leg<br /> Eye on the <b>aged thorn</b><br /> Age old dog, hornet nest<br /> <b>Met when</b> the big <b>birch fell</b><br /> <br /> Hundred years, hundred more<br /> Someday we may see a<br /> Woman king, bloodshot <b>sun</b><br /> Thumb down and starting to weep.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Bolded parts are the lyrics Flynn changes for this performance. I'll let Loki figure out how well Dodging Bullet knows Flynn's music.<br /> <br /> Performance - Charisma 3 + Performance 5 + Gem of Grace 2 = 10 Dice (3 Successes) <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=Y6YDGHAP\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=Y6YDGHAP</a><br /> <br /> Singing is hard when you are walking and carrying a large bag. lol<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-26-2015, 06:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T06:59:02-07:00","id":529893,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh. Very nice song. I have not heard anything like that before. Tell you what. I will give you one free story for that, but there will be no others. I do have to make a living after all. I am getting too soft in my old age... I would never have done this when I was younger,&quot; he says as he chuckles softly to himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, here is one of my favorite stories.&quot; The man pulls out a small scroll wrapped with red twine and undoes it. He then begins reading it. &quot;There once was a king who had been sitting on a throne, who had powers beyond them all. He ruled with strength and wisdom and thought he had complete control. He trained the birds to hunt for the town and gained much prosperity and happiness for all of its people. Wanting to relax after his work building up the kingdom, he gave all his work to his court. The court ran things for a while and they even had brought in more helpers to work, so he wouldn't have to. The king played around so much that they all became bitter to the point that he was killed by his court and their servants. Unbeknownst to them all, he had not truly died. His spirit was too great to be extinguished, but he laid there pretending to be dead. After they had left, he moved away in hiding among the shadows. There he reflected on the true nature of his followers and gained skills to control the beasts so that he may get back at his followers.<br /> <br /> First, he sent in the spiders. They scared many people and poisoned a few, but the birds came and ate them. The king did not seem dismayed on this fact and kept with his plan. The next time, he sent in another set of spiders. This time people were less afraid and chased after them with the birds. Seeming scared, the spiders ran away, but little did they realize that webs had been laid and the people got trapped, though the birds escaped. The same thing happened a few more times.By now, the people and birds had learned to look for the webs and traps of the spiders and grew much less scared. Finally, the king sent the rest of the spiders. By now, they knew how to kill the spiders and avoid their webs so that they would not be trapped. The people employed the same tactics and sent all the birds and people to find them at the source and kill them all. In this, they made one big mistake. They did not realize that the king had control of the other animals. The people and birds started to only scout the ground looking for the traps of the spiders, ignoring the great dragon flying overhead. They all lay mangled and burned on the ground, letting the spiders finish them off. Haven fallen for this trap and laying mangled on the ground, the King himself came out to laugh over their corpses. Little did he know, that there were two wiser than him.<br /> <br /> The priest of the town and his one of his court worked together to create these replicas of the townspeople, using their stocks of jade, silver, gold, as well as sacrificing their birds. Once the King exposed himself, the real townspeople came flooding in and took his head and scared off the dragon. The town had lost all their jade, silver, gold, and birds, but they deemed it better than having to suffer these attacks once more. The town suffered and lingered on, having lost their resources, until they all died. The spirit on the king flitted away laughing as he went on to the next world.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, that is one of my favorites, and one of the best stories if I say so myself.&quot; The man then hands the scroll to Flynn. &quot;I have this one memorized. You two can take this scroll.&quot;<br /> <br /> For Flynn:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The letter has a charm similar to letter-within-a-letter technique on it set for Flynn as its target. You can probably guess most of it, but it tells you that the town is planning on sending any anathema they can as a distraction to be killed by the deathknight and then finish him off themselves. Having looked into the future with some other faction members, he saw the death and destruction of everyone nearby much to the happiness of the deathknight. He is signalling that you need to make a better plan and change the priest and councils members' minds. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 05-27-2015, 10:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T06:48:14-07:00","id":530949,"title":"","content":"Flynn considers the merchant's words carefully. &quot;Hmm.... It is a good story, but I am unsure it is the best story I have ever heard. Not really suitable for song, unless if I change the ending. People like ballads with happy endings. &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Still it is bad luck to meet a tinker on the road and not buy something. Let me take a closer look at your goods.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn glances at Splendor to see what he is making of this encounter with Dodging Bullet.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Is there anything unusual about any of the goods? Maybe one of the offerings is more than what meets the eye?<br /> <br /> Let me know if I need to roll anything.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-28-2015, 10:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T17:50:13-07:00","id":531456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=528952#post528952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Nahuel stops to sense his surroundings, he notices a strange bug he has not seen in the area before. And that bug seems to be watching them and just staring.....</div> </div> </div> </div>He pauses, curiously looking back at the insect, then with a quick motion reaches out to try to catch it, in a hand as fast as a frog's tongue.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7177/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7177/view</a> Includes 1d stunt and Dexcellency. 9 successes.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> .<br /> If caught, he peers into his hand to get a closer look at the little curious creature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T20:35:49-07:00","id":531667,"title":"","content":"Splendor observed the musician watching him and knew he should say something. Being honest with himself, this merchant unnerved him. Then again, he was familiar with merchants who disparaged their own goods and underplayed the difficulty in obtaining them. It was seen as a sign of respect to implicitly offer a lower price than the goods were worth. Of course then the buyer would overstate their quality and rarity until they met somewhere in the middle. So it wasn't really that different.<br /> <br /> &quot;An interesting piece this dial must be. The name of the Most High is not often spoken in these parts, nor are prayers offered to him by the Dragon worshipers or flocks of the many gods. How might you have come by so rare a thing, and what could I offer of such worth if it is genuine? Would it not be a relic most holy to have even been seen by the Sun?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T20:58:08-07:00","id":531688,"title":"","content":"&quot;That old thing? I've seen such a device before in the markets of Nexus. The silly contraption needs to be wound once a day to keep time. &quot; Flynn interjects, quickly before Splendor could say anything else. &quot;If you could excuse us for a moment. I need to confer with my traveling companion.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn pulls Splendor aside. &quot;What are you doing!? You aren't suppose to help the merchant sell his product, if you plan on buying it!&quot; Flynn knew exactly what Splendor was doing, but they were not Celestial gods who needed to project a generous image to their fellow deities. Splendor obviously didn't know anything about haggling in Creation. The Musician did not know anything about Yu-Shan haggling, so Flynn had to berate the Solar for ruining the deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T02:06:46-07:00","id":531803,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ho ho ho. It is true. People now do seem to like the &quot;happy&quot; stories. But to me, stories of wisdom are much better. I do have some others if you so wish. Those ones do have happy endings.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning to Splendor he says, &quot;Well it is just rumored to be seen by the Unconquered Sun. Its origins seem to come from Rathess. That is probably why they say so, but I do not know its true and final origins myself.&quot; He begins to play a bit with the dial, but does not show any signs of being deterred. &quot;Of course I know you must talk. Making decisions on what to buy are certainly important.<br /> <br /> &quot;We are almost to the city though. The tailor is not far from the edge of town. I suspect we should be there in about 5 minutes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The bug squirms a bit in Nahuels hand, but does not seem to do anything crazy. It seems like a small dragon of some sort with many eyes. Maybe some sort of mixture between a dragon and a fly... nothing from this area for certain. Nahuel cannot sense anything to strange on it normally....<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> To look at the items the &quot;merchant&quot; is carrying, roll (int+occult). For Nahuel to see anything very special about the bug roll (int+surv) OR (int+occult). </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T06:36:47-07:00","id":531924,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Dodging Bullet's goods - Int 3 + Occult 2 = 5 Dice (2 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=DE7N3KP7\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=DE7N3KP7</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T07:20:03-07:00","id":531948,"title":"","content":"Flynn notices that the dial is somehow magical, but cannot tell anything special about all the other items. They may in fact be normal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T08:32:15-07:00","id":531974,"title":"","content":"&quot;The item is almost certainly a fake, and even if it isn't I have no need of a timepiece. It is as easy as drawing breath to know the place of the daystar, and I can fabricate nearly perfect such devices from scrapwood.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7205/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7205/view</a><br /> 4 successes </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T08:58:57-07:00","id":531987,"title":"","content":"&quot;You don't need a sundial to know the time of day?&quot; Flynn asks, as if he does not have the same ability. &quot;If that is true, then it is an unique gift that you should not mention to anyone, if you catch my meaning.&quot; <br /> <br /> Flynn returns to the merchant. &quot;How much for the timepiece?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T13:30:05-07:00","id":532183,"title":"","content":"Splendor notices that it has something to do with creating its own light and that it works very precisely as a sundial. There seems to be something else to it, but he cannot figure out what, The markings seem to indicate something about empowerment.<br /> <br /> The merchant turns to Flynn. &quot;Well, as he DID say it would be worth a lot if it was indeed blessed by the Unconquered Sun himself, but I don't have any proof of that. It does seem to have some interesting properties though and is fairly rare. Hmm.. I guess in this region you would deal in silver, but I would be happy to accept Jade Script too. I could use that in my travels. How does 80 koku sound? I know that is quite a bit, but I am sure you can make more off of this. Either that or 3 pounds of silver. Of course Silver would be slightly cheaper, but I leave that up to you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 05-30-2015, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T18:46:42-07:00","id":532634,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7214/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7214/view</a><br /> <br /> 2 succeses on Int + Occult roll.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;This is odd. Have you ever seen a small dragon with many eyes, brother?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T07:27:44-07:00","id":533167,"title":"","content":"Flynn chokes a bit when the merchant mentions the price. \u201cI\u2019m just a poor traveling musician. What kind of money do you think I am carrying?\u201c <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T09:09:23-07:00","id":533256,"title":"","content":"The Servant takes a look at the small creature in your hand. &quot;I think it may be of occult magic, but I am not sure. I have not seen this type of creature anywhere in my travels. I have been sent many places as a slave, but not once seen any creature like this.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> The old man turns to Flynn, &quot;Why do you think I asked him and not you? I know the toughness of being a musician. I have met quite a few. Where do you think I got this wax and other musical instrument items? These are fairly cheap. Those items would only be 1 quian.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T19:48:21-07:00","id":533932,"title":"","content":"&quot;Gods! What is this lotion made out of!? The milk of the Sacred Cows of Ahlat!?&quot; Flynn takes a step forward so Splendor can not see his face. &quot;Let me see if this lotion is worth the price...&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn mouths to Dodging Bullet, &quot;Do you need money?&quot; Perhaps Dodging Bullet has been in Creation long enough to run out of cash.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> If this is another conversion issue, I'll edit my post. I really need to reread Masters of Jade if we are going to be using hard numbers for cash.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T21:47:29-07:00","id":534008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=533932#post533932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;<br /> <br /> If this is another conversion issue, I'll edit my post. I really need to reread Masters of Jade if we are going to be using hard numbers for cash.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I am mostly doing this for theatrical reasons. From now on I will say &quot;resources x&quot; to make it easier. I got so used to doing this because of a game IRL where it is ALL about the money... </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Dodging Bullet mouths. &quot;No. Of course not, I have a much higher salary than you remember?&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I do not think so. But perhaps I am making things a little too expensive. What do you say I let you take these all off my hands for a measly few koku (resources 2). I am sure I can sell more things to others. I have been surviving on my own for quite a while. Ho ho ho. But here we are at the tailors! I can wait outside here for a bit while you make up your mind.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T10:38:30-07:00","id":534587,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let us ask one of the others... Flynn has surely seen much in his travels, and Splendor is a man of great learning. Was there any other thing you wished me to not speak of, before we seek them out?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T12:27:50-07:00","id":534710,"title":"","content":"Grumbling about annoying merchants, Flynn hands Dodging Bullet a few Koku for his goods. &quot;Now, go away. I'm sure you have other customers you need to harass. &quot; Flynn sneers after receiving the merchant's goods.<br /> <br /> Flynn resists the urge to physically drag the Solar away from Dodging Bullet and into the Tailor shop. Instead he guides Splendor into the shop, putting his annoying coworker out of his mind. &quot;Good morning! or is it already afternoon? &quot; He looks around, taking in the shop. &quot;My associate here is in need of your services. He needs one set of clothes suitable for attending court. Another for casual wear. And a third for dirty work.&quot;<br /> <br /> Flynn takes off his cloak and shows the tailor's assistant the hole. &quot;I also need my cloak mended. And I suppose I need a set of Courtier clothing as well.&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes a look at the state of Splendor's shoes, which were more suitable for the gleaming streets of Yu-Shan then the grimy streets of Creation. &quot;Do you know of a good cobbler?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Dodging Bullet isn't being annoying in general, Loki. More like he is annoying Flynn. Flynn can be difficult to work with. (Yay for low temperance) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm assuming that Yu-Shan shoes are not really made for the rough Creation lifestyle. Do you agree, Exthalion?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-31-2015, 03:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T21:17:22-07:00","id":536467,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm.. I would like to know what it is. I suppose it would not hurt to show them. But please don't mention anything about this conversation. If they know anything about it, this creature might be from them,&quot; The Servant whispers quietly. &quot;Perhaps we should follow them into the town.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you kind sir. It is the graciousness of people like you that help me survive. I do hope you find this tailor to be in good measure. I suppose I should head SW from here. I've heard that there is much less trouble going on there. Or perhaps I should head to Nexus and make a killing off of some items... hmm.. well may the sun shine upon you with its power. Good day.&quot; With that the merchant hobbles off with his bag of goods. <br /> <br /> <br /> The tailor moves immediately to size up Nahuel and takes a look at your cloak. &quot;That should be quite easy. I dare say that it should only take me an hour to get all the items ready. There is a good cobbler around here. Be warned that the maker is a woman, but she does seem to have SOME skill. At least in shoes. Don't try to get clothing from here. They are all of too low quality. They all make them cheaper to lure people in, but have the worst quality. The shoes are a different story however.&quot; The tailor continues to talk on and on barely pausing for breath for the next few minutes then scurries back to look at his materials. After a couple more minutes he comes back.<br /> <br /> &quot;For all of this, it should just be a koku (resources 1). I know the price might seem a bit higher than usual, but I assure you they will all be of great quality and fit perfectly. What say you?&quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I meant for Dodging Bullet to be a little annoying. Kind of the &quot;buddy buddy&quot; but smack talking co-worker who gets the attention of the boss. He also find you SLIGHTLY useless and probably feels he has to &quot;babysit&quot; you. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T23:02:13-07:00","id":536557,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am unsure of the way things are done, but I will also need a more suitable scabbard for my weapon.&quot;<br /> <br /> He unslung the large cloth wrapped bundle from his back, glancing at a table before leaning it against a wall. He had learned that lesson the hard way.<br /> <br /> &quot;Also, a cloak for me as well. It wouldn't be good to go around looking as though I am girded for battle.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without another word, he started removing the concealing robes. In truth they were simple wraps of spare fabric. Many of the gods who had been present at the calibration party had dressed as characters out of legend. As gods did not possess the flaring souls of the chosen, bright frabric was the usual method of representing the iconic imagery of Exalted. The eagle balanced on a planted sword of Red Tower Burning, the scroll wrapped pillars of Street of Sapphire, even the one hundred and eight stars of Sun-Eclipsing Splendor picked out in red on deepest navy in honor of the great Steward who had briefly ruled the Blessed Isle. These and a half dozen more proudly competed for the eye as Splendor undressed. Then the room seemed to grow dark.<br /> <br /> His armor was forged from the feathers of Anzu, a spirit of fire clad in the soot of its burning. Each shard of the beast had the appearance of smoky glass. They drunk in light and blazed with a heart of red flame, writhing as though in a struggle against the mantras graven on their edges. Stroking the back of his fingers against the effigy of its head as one would pet a bird, it began to retract into itself. While worn it had looked as though great wings enfolded him. What remained was a creature half dragon and half bird, each of its four limbs bearing a folded wing, and its long feathered tail frozen as though mid lash. If it moved it did so with subtlety, if it did not move it almost seemed to. Haughty eyes, each a massive ruby, seemed to judge those present and see nothing worthy of more than contempt.<br /> <br /> &quot;I think there was a little too much of his spirit bound in his remains; and I gave it too much voice, or to little.&quot;<br /> <br /> Setting the thing down carefully his own garb was now clear to see. Bright, bright blue, bright and radiant as the morpho wings from which it was woven, and covered on both sides with words in the finest hand. It was fashioned like a single scroll, woven over and under itself into herringbone patterns. Carefully, and gently, he rolled it back into the scroll it had begun as before bringing the two halves of the case together and looking at the title, <i>A Lover Clad in Blue</i>. Ah how clever he had thought he was, just scandalous enough to be talked about without being so low as to be shameful. He had heard a few snips behind his back at the party, positive proof that he had succeeded. How petty it all seemed now.<br /> <br /> Looking down he noticed his shoes were indeed coming apart. They hadn't been meant to last more than the night anyway. Their survival up to this point was nothing short of remarkable. He caught his reflection in a mirror and took a moment to consider it. Iron grey hair, coarse and stiff, had grown longer than he liked to keep it. Pale northern eyes, looked back at him from a narrow face, thinner than he remembered. Skin that looked like it had never seen the sun had finally taken something like a faint tan, something he was thankful for, but the glassy, hand-shaped scar in the middle of his back remained.<br /> <br /> Turning to the tailor, and seemingly unphased by his own nudity, he smiled and said, &quot;I think something in stock that can be altered might be best. I can pay a little extra if it was meant for someone else, but fast is probably more important than perfect right now.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-02-2015, 03:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T06:33:10-07:00","id":536936,"title":"","content":"<i>Lover Clad in Blue?</i> Flynn tries not to smirk as Splendor put the scroll away. <i>We have a saucy boy here.</i> Though Splendor was older than Flynn thought. He had assumed that the Solar was around Jericho\u2019s age. <i>Naivet\u00e9 has a habit of taking years off a person</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Does this tailor actually do good work? Flynn would be suspicious of anyone that puts down the work of others.<br /> <br /> Perception 2 + Bureaucracy 3 = 5 dice (2 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3AFJCGUM\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=3AFJCGUM</a><br /> <br /> I can imagine that once, back in the Bureau, Dodging Bullet stole Flynn's Red Stapler. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T13:01:02-07:00","id":538689,"title":"","content":"Flynn watches the tailor for his reaction towards Splendor\u2019s awe-inspiring artifacts. He decides that less of a fuss Flynn makes of them, the better. \u201cIt\u2019s amazing what trinkets can be found in the Markets of Nexus.\u201d Flynn casually comments.<br /> <br /> Flynn continues to explain to the tailor what they need, \u201cClothing off the shelf will do for everyday wear, but for Court, we will need our tailored clothing. How long will that take?\u201d<br /> <br /> Taking little note of Splendor\u2019s nudity, the Musician says to the Solar, \u201cYes, we will find you a good leatherworker for your weapon\u2019s scabbard. After we see the cobbler.&quot; <i>And maybe the barber,</i> Flynn thinks, running his hands though his hair. <i>I need a haircut.</i> <br /> <br /> As Flynn waits for the Tailor to finish with Splendor, he muses about the information Dodging Bullet gave him<i>. We must find a way to show that Nahuel and Splendor are invaluable resources not to be wasted on this fool hardy plan</i>.<br /> <br /> Flynn needs to know what was going on in court. There was small hope that Dodging Bullet did not reveal his Musician Identity to the Goddess. <i>Beautiful Woman are always more trouble than they are worth. </i><br /> <br /> They needed information about the town\u2019s defenses and which Council members could be swayed from this disastrous plan. When Nahuel gets back, he will share his suspicions about the Goddess and what she plans to do. He already mentioned that beautiful woman should not be trusted, so it isn\u2019t a reach for the Musician to want to verify that the Goddess means them no ill will.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Presence Roll for encouraging the Tailor to not think much of the Artifacts \u2013 Manipulation 5 + Presence 3 + Gem of Grace 2 = 10 Dice (3 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=L6BQU4EP\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=L6BQU4EP</a><br /> <br /> Good thing the Tailor is Mortal.<br /> <br /> I am going to assume the Tailor is competent.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-03-2015, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T19:48:22-07:00","id":539117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=536467#post536467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Hmm.. I would like to know what it is. I suppose it would not hurt to show them. But please don't mention anything about this conversation. If they know anything about it, this creature might be from them,&quot; The Servant whispers quietly. &quot;Perhaps we should follow them into the town.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Let us go then. It is strange, not knowing what is about me. I do not like this feeling, not knowing.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I will keep your secret as best I can. I am sworn to tell no lies, but honor also forbids revealing another man's secrets.&quot; He sets off towards the town after Flynn, still holding the small dragon. After a few moments, a thought occurs to him.<br /> <br /> &quot;You are not one of Luna's chosen, little thing, are you?&quot; If it doesn't answer, he proceeds on his way..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T14:05:35-07:00","id":539959,"title":"","content":"The tailor does not seem to pay much attention to the artifacts since he is so focused. He doesn't even bother to look about the trinkets. What point was there to them? The clothes are what makes a man after all. He seems to be doing quite good work too because of his focus. Indeed, the merchant was right in the fact that he was the best. <br /> <br /> &quot;Hmmm... I may have something that will fit you well. I will just need to make one simple altercation to it. I will be back with it in a few moments.&quot; After a couple of minutes he comes back with the needle in his mouth with string still through the eye of the needle. &quot;Here it is!&quot; The tailor brings out the altered version of the garb (the one I showed the picture of before) and it looks quite amazing. It fits Splendor more perfectly than any other clothes he has ever worn. <br /> <br /> <br /> As Nahuel finishes his sentence, the Old Man shifts into the form of a young guard at an angle where the creature cannot see him. You are pretty sure you have seen that picture on a wanted poster in the town. &quot;I am indeed kin to yourself. If you call it kin I suppose. I never got the whole silver pact thing anyway. I was &quot;brought to&quot; my master to be trained for a small payment for them, which they thought I did not know about. My master was horrible and it was not much different from being a slave. I do not know what the Silver Pact thought they were playing at. I do not want much to do with them. You however seem much different. I would not MIND being with one such as yourself for a long time.&quot; Shortly after that, he shifts back into his form as an old man, but nimbly moves through the forest towards the town.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T13:14:02-07:00","id":541624,"title":"","content":"&quot;What do you think?&quot; Flynn asks Splendor about his new clothes.<br /> <br /> The Musician turns to the tailor. &quot;As I am a performer,&quot; Flynn pats the Sanxian case at his side, &quot;I will need something a bit less form fitting. Something that gives me more freedom of motion.&quot; Flynn describes something that looks like <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/f3/88/47/f38847a5aea8df040a4687d73240485b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> (Without the Bracers and stupid headband).<br /> <br /> &quot;Also, I have another associate that needs a cloak. Perhaps something light to be wearable in this heat.&quot; He describes Nahuel's size. Flynn describes a cloak that looks similar to <a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/e6/96/a8/e696a8848df98948ad8d09c176911f12.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> (no gold detail needed). Instead of changing his whole appearance, Flynn hopes for Nahual to be willing to wear the cloak to blend in. Surely the Lunar understand the need for camouflage.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I pulled these pictures from this <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/letipex/exalted-inspiration/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Pinterest.</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T17:49:45-07:00","id":541890,"title":"","content":"The tailor turns to Flynn and eyes him over. That will be simple to make one for you and I COULD make a cloak for your buddy, but I don't make clothes that don't fit properly. You will need to get him to come in if you want one. Otherwise, go buy a cheap cloak from someone else that doesn't fit properly. I don't do shoddy work based off of guesses. It makes me look bad!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T21:55:34-07:00","id":547991,"title":"","content":"As if summoned, Nahuel enters the shop a few moments later, holding something cupped in his hands. &quot;Flynn, Splendor, I have been looking for you. I need to ask you something.&quot; He looks at the shopkeeper, painfully obvious in not wanting to discuss whatever it is in front of a stranger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T22:12:35-07:00","id":547995,"title":"","content":"&quot;Say his name and he appears! Nahuel, I believe I have found a compromise to our dilemma. &quot; Flynn see that Nahuel has something important to discuss. &quot;Can it wait until after the tailor?&quot;<br /> The Musician sighs. &quot;Probably not.&quot; <br /> <br /> Flynn throws Splendor his cloak to cover his nakedness. &quot;If you can excuse us for a moment,&quot; he says to the tailor. Flynn leads the two men outside of the tailor's shop.<br /> <br /> &quot;What is it?&quot; Flynn asks the Lunar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-10T18:10:27-07:00","id":549556,"title":"","content":"Nahuel carefully grips the little dragon-fly creature so he can open his hands and show it to Flynn without it escaping. &quot;This was watching us; I have never seen such a creature before. Do you recognize it?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-10T18:41:30-07:00","id":549568,"title":"","content":"Flynn looks over the little bug. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0p